1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Ayu: "Alright, everybody! Are you having a good time?!"

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Crowd: "YEAH!!!"

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Ayu: "Yay! Hearing that makes me super happy! Thank you for your continued support, from the bottom of my heart! ☆"

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Ayu: "This concert hall really is amazing, isn't it?! I can't believe I was invited to perform in such an incredible venue!"

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Fan: "It's what you deserve, Ayu-Ayu!"

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Fan 2: "We love you, Ayu-Ayu!"

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Fan 3: "We'll always support you!"

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Crowd: "A-YU! A-YU! A-YU!"

9
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Ayu: "Wow! You all sound so passionate! I'm touched that you care so much about little old me, ehehe! ☆"

10
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Ayu: "You know... When I first started out, I was just an underground idol."

11
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Ayu: "I didn't have many fans, and preforming on a big stage like this was nothing more than an impossible dream!"

12
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Ayu: "I used to cover anime songs on the streets. I worked hard to memorize the lyrics and the dance steps, but I was just a novice, and I messed up a lot."

13
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Ayu: "I never thought I'd come this far. Sometimes, I thought about giving up..."

14
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Ayu: "But I knew that would be spitting in the faces of all you wonderful people, who cheered me on even when I was at my lowest!"

15
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Fan: "Ayu-Ayu never gives up!"

16
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Fan 2: "You're strong, Ayu! Keep fighting!"

17
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Fan 3: "You can do it! You can do anything!"

18
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Crowd: "We love you, Ayu!"

19
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Ayu: "Thank you, everybody! Thank you so much!"

20
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:37,000
Ayu: "When I was still a beginner, I knew I couldn't afford to take a single fan of mine for granted. Your love and affection meant the world to me!"

21
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Ayu: "You cheered me on, so I knew I had to keep going! I didn't want to let any of you down! If I did that, I wouldn't be able to call myself an idol ever again!"

22
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Ayu: "My path was a hard one, but I never gave up! I devoted my life - my very soul - to the pursuit of being an idol..."

23
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Ayu: "And now, I've finally made it!"

24
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:07,000
Ayu: "I'm standing on this huge stage, in front of thousands and thousands of people, and I've never felt more humbled in my life!"

25
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:17,000
Ayu: "You guys are my light, my life, and my love! My heart belongs to every single one of you... and so, I'm going to dedicate this next song to you!"

26
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:21,000
Ayu: "This is my latest single, Overflowing Feelings! Let's GO! ☆"

27
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:24,000
Fan: "Alright! This is what I've been waiting for!"

28
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:26,000
Fan 2: "This is such a hype song!"

29
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:29,000
Fan 3: "Waaah... I'm getting goosebumps already!"

30
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:35,000
Fan 2: "I can't believe that Ayu-Ayu loves us so much! She's not like the other idols out there!"

31
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:38,000
Fan 4: "She really does value her fans!"

32
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:43,000
Fan: "She's so pure and beautiful... I just can't get enough of her cute smile!"

33
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:51,000
Fan 5: "I'll support you until the end of time, Ayu-Ayu! For now and forever, you're the only RL 3D girl for me!"

34
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:53,000
Crowd: "A-yu! A-yu! A-yu!"

35
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:56,000
Hiroki: "Y-Yeah, that's right. A-yu. A-yu. A..."

36
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Hiroki: "Aaah, geez. What am I even doing with my life?"

37
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,000
Hiroki: "Sigh."

38
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:07,000
*I stare at the stage, my hands jammed in my pockets, as the lights dim. The crowd falls quiet.*

39
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:10,000
*It's so silent you could hear a pin drop.*

40
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:23,000
*If I was as crazy about Ikue Ayu as some of these other fans, I'd probably consider it an immense privilege to even stand in the same room as she is, no matter how far away I am from the stage.*

41
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:32,000
*I'm sure, for some of the guys here, this is the happiest night of their lives. A middle-aged man standing next to me is actually crying.*

42
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:37,000
*Some diehard Ayu fans are acting like this concert is a religious experience...*

43
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:42,000
*And I guess I can't fault them for it (ridiculous though it seems to me).*

44
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:45,000
*Gods aren't so very different from "idols".*

45
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:50,000
*Part of me wishes I could join in the hype, but this isn't really my scene.*

46
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:52,000
*I'm pretty anxious, too.*

47
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:59,000
*When my boss finds out what happened today, he's going to kill me. If only the trains hadn't been delayed.*

48
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:06,000
*Then, I would've gotten here on time, and I would've made it to the front of the crowd like I was ordered to.*

49
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:16,000
*I brought my camera equipment with me, but I can hardly set it up now. I'm hemmed in by dozens of men, all wearing Ayu shirts and holding glow sticks.*

50
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:23,000
*There's barely enough room to swing around a cat, let alone wield a large, industry-standard camera.*

51
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:26,000
*This might be one of the worst nights of my life.*

52
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:33,000
*This concert hall is huge, but it's not enough to accommodate all of Ayu's fans. She's way too popular!*

53
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:43,000
*I've stood through about fifteen different tracks so far, and my ears are still ringing from the crowd's yelling and Ayu's "adorable" vocals.*

54
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:46,000
*I don't think I can take much more of this!*

55
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:48,000
*I hope this is the last song...*

56
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:59,000
*Slowly, almost menacingly, the background music of Ayu's latest song begins to build. It grows louder and louder, until I can feel it reverberating through the ground.*

57
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:05,000
*It's so loud, my teeth start to chatter, and my whole body trembles with nervous energy.*

58
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:11,000
*Lights burst upon the stage like fireworks, once more revealing Ayu's perfect body.*

59
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:13,000
*The crowd, as expected, goes nuts.*

60
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:15,000
Crowd: "A-YU! A-YU! A-YU! A-YU!"

61
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:23,000
*Ayu strikes a pose. She holds one arm out, as though beckoning the crowd, while her other hand curls about her microphone.*

62
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:33,000
*Ayu's gaze sweeps across the sea of glow sticks spread out before her. She smiles sweetly, as though thanking each and every one of her fans.*

63
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:36,000
*For a moment, her eyes seem to catch mine.*

64
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:41,000
*Her gaze lingers, hot like coals, upon me. I feel my skin prickle.*

65
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:45,000
*Has she picked me out of the crowd? Does she even know I'm alive?*

66
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:50,000
*I'm surrounded by so many people it's doubtful she can even see me.*

67
00:05:50,000 --> 00:06:01,000
*I'm not even one of Ayu's fans. I'm not at this concert because I love her music. If I'm being perfectly honest, I actually think her high-pitched voice is annoying!*

68
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:05,000
*Does Ayu know this? Is that why she's looking at me?*

69
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:13,000
*Suddenly, I feel exposed. I'm not like the other men here. I'm just a filthy imposter. I shouldn't be here at all.*

70
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:16,000
*The bright lights hurt my eyes. I wince.*

71
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:23,000
*All the while, Ayu continues to hold my gaze. She stares at me, her eyes large and all-consuming...*

72
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:25,000
*Then, she begins to sing.*

73
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:29,000
Hiroki: "Well, this is just great. Now what am I going to do?"

74
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:38,000
*I kick at a loose pebble on the sidewalk. It skitters away, bouncing a handful of times before it's swallowed by the darkness.*

75
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:43,000
*The street is dark, illuminated only by a few street lamps. It's cold, too.*

76
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,000
*I shudder.*

77
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:52,000
*I'm not sure what time it is. Ayu's concert finished at around 21:30, but then there was the handshake event I had to go to.*

78
00:06:52,000 --> 00:07:00,000
*I attended on the off-chance I might be able to get a brief word with the famous Ayu, and a couple of photos...*

79
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,000
*But it wasn't to be.*

80
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:05,000
*I waited in line to shake Ayu's holy hand for well over an hour.*

81
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:17,000
*I was almost at the front of the queue when the handshake event ended, and those of us unfortunate enough not to meet our idol face-to-face were told to screw off by a security guard.*

82
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:25,000
*...Well. He didn't say it in quite those terms (there were more apologies involved), but that's what it boiled down to.*

83
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:37,000
Guard: "Sorry, but it's getting late, and Ayu has a busy schedule. We'll need to cut this handshake event short for now. I apologize to those of you who were unable to see Ayu."

84
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:43,000
Guard: "Please, support her during her next concert. You'll get another chance to see her then!"

85
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:45,000
*And with that, we were dismissed.*

86
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:53,000
*My camera equipment weighs heavy in the bag looped around my shoulder. I wish I'd had a chance to actually use any of it.*

87
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:56,000
*If only the trains hadn't been delayed!*

88
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:57,000
*If only, if only...*

89
00:07:57,000 --> 00:08:03,000
*It's not my fault that I got to the concert late. There were delays. It couldn't be helped.*

90
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:15,000
*Try explaining that to my boss on Monday, though. I know he'll pin the blame on this debacle squarely upon my skinny shoulders. It's easier to chew me out than the whole rail company.*

91
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,000
Hiroki: "Sigh..."

92
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:23,000
*I seem to be sighing a lot lately. I think it must be stress. That, or a critical lack of sleep.*

93
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:27,000
*Who knew being a photographer could be such hard work?!*

94
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:37,000
*It's almost midnight on a Saturday. It wouldn't be the first time my boss has made me work during the weekends, and it certainly won't be the last.*

95
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:44,000
*I came all the way out here so I could take pics of Ayu's latest concert, but I didn't get a single snapshot.*

96
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:46,000
*What a waste of time!*

97
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,000
Hiroki: "Yawn..."

98
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:50,000
*I yawn, pressing one hand against my gaping mouth.*

99
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:57,000
*Since it's late, I should probably head home. I feel exhausted, and I have something of a headache.*

100
00:08:57,000 --> 00:09:04,000
*Curling up in bed and resting my head on a nice, soft pillow sounds like heaven right about now...*

101
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:09,000
*But it's rare I come to this part of Tokyo, and part of me's craving a drink.*

102
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:15,000
*There's a lot of nice, high-class bars around this area, and I sure could use a pick-me-up.*

103
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:23,000
*If I dally too long, the trains'll stop running. Then, I'll need to spend the night in a hotel. That sounds like a pain...*

104
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:26,000
*But I can cross that bridge when I get to it.*

105
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:30,000
*Somewhat cheered by my plan, I turn neatly on my heels.*

106
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:41,000
*There's a pretty nice bar around here, only a short walk away. My aching legs could use some exercise, and the insistent wind helps bring some color to my cheeks.*

107
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:46,000
*I've not gone more than a handful of steps, however, when I pause.*

108
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:52,000
*There's a lone woman crossing the street parallel to me, walking in the opposite direction.*

109
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:58,000
*Her head is low, her features obscured by the dark, but something about her looks... familiar.*

110
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:04,000
*Her hair is a light orange-brown color, and it's tied back in two cute twintails.*

111
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:10,000
*These twintails stream behind her like banners as she walks, fluttering in the breeze.*

112
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:18,000
*I'd recognize that hair anywhere, even if I hadn't seen it illuminated by the bright lights of a stage an hour ago.*

113
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:19,000
*It's Ayu.*

114
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:20,000
Hiroki: "No way..."

115
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:30,000
*I wonder why she's walking the night-time Tokyo streets alone. Since she's a famous idol, shouldn't she be chaperoned by at least a dozen bodyguards?*

116
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:36,000
*This doesn't make sense. There's no reason Ayu should be out at a time like this.*

117
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:42,000
*Maybe this woman isn't Ayu. It could be somebody who just-so-happens to look a lot like her...*

118
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:50,000
*But that's impossible. She's even wearing the same cute, pink-and-white outfit she wore while she was performing!*

119
00:10:50,000 --> 00:11:00,000
*Her skirt is a many-layered, ruffled work of art, a little like a fancy wedding cake, and atop her head there sits a small, not at all practical hat.*

120
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:11,000
*Her arms and legs are bare, exposed to the elements, and she's wearing a very tall, impressive pair of heels that make loud clacking noises with every step.*

121
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:18,000
*It was hard for me to see her clearly during her concert, given I was so far away from the stage.*

122
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:24,000
*Ayu was nothing more than a blur, barely visible above the heads of thousands of fans.*

123
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:32,000
*Now, however, she's standing impossibly close to me. She's only a few feet away, on the other side of this street!*

124
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:40,000
*She feels less like an incredible, untouchable idol and more like a regular human being - which, of course, she is.*

125
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:51,000
*Ayu might be beloved by millions of people across Japan, but she's not infallible. She doesn't have magical powers, and she's no goddess to be worshipped at an altar.*

126
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:57,000
*She's a regular girl. Without those heels of hers, she'd probably be pretty short.*

127
00:11:57,000 --> 00:12:03,000
*She's less impressive now, on this windswept street, than she was on the stage...*

128
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:05,000
*But she feels more approachable.*

129
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:15,000
*I was just lamenting my inability to take Ayu's photo five minutes prior. I thought I'd failed my assignment, but this could be my lucky break!*

130
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:20,000
*If I ask nicely, maybe she'll pose for a pic or two! My career will be saved!*

131
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:22,000
Hiroki: "Ayu! Hey, Ayu!"

132
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:29,000
*I don't know if saying "Hey, Ayu" is the right way to address a famous celeb like Ayu, but neither do I care.*

133
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:32,000
*These photos aren't going to take themselves!*

134
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:33,000
Ayu: "Huh...?"

135
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:37,000
*Ayu pauses. She turns, her lips pursed in a confused frown.*

136
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:38,000
Hiroki: "Ah..."

137
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:42,000
*The moment I see her face, the air is knocked out of my lungs.*

138
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:51,000
*It's definitely her. There's nobody else this could be. This is the idol who's captured millions of hearts ever since her official debut.*

139
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:58,000
*This is the idol I've seen in magazines, on the TV screen, and plastered on billboards all over Tokyo.*

140
00:12:58,000 --> 00:13:05,000
*It's the same idol I saw (albeit, begrudgingly) as she performed onstage, bathed in a sea of lights.*

141
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:11,000
*I can't let her go. The future of my career is riding on this! I don't want to be fired!*

142
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:12,000
Hiroki: "Ayuuu!"

143
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:13,000
Ayu: "What...?"

144
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:15,000
*Ayu takes a step back, alarmed.*

145
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:25,000
Ayu: "Wh-Who're you? Don't come any closer to me, you creep! I'm carrying pepper spray in my bag, and I'm not afraid to use it on a mongrel like you!"

146
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:34,000
Hiroki: "That's fine! You can pepper spray me, or call me a mongrel, or anything you want! You can even ask me to bow down before your feet!"

147
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:38,000
Hiroki: "Anything's fine, so long as you let me take your photo!"

148
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:43,000
Ayu: "A-A photo? You mean, like an upskirt photo? Are you some sort of pervert?!"

149
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:50,000
Hiroki: "No, I'm not! I'm just a humble photographer and I want to do my job! Please, won't you pose for me?!"

150
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:55,000
*Ayu doesn't sound moved by my cries. If anything, she looks downright disgusted.*

151
00:13:55,000 --> 00:14:03,000
*She wrinkles her nose (whatever happened to appreciating all her fans, huh?) and takes a few more hurried steps back.*

152
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:10,000
Ayu: "Leave me alone, you virgin loser. I'm not interested in posing for a so-called "photographer" like you!"

153
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:12,000
Hiroki: "But Ayu, please! Listen!"

154
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:16,000
Ayu: "No! Back off, or I'll call the police! I mean it!"

155
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:23,000
Ayu: "You're nothing more than an insect to me, and I have no qualms about squashing you! Leave me alone!"

156
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:32,000
*But I don't. The promise of maybe not being shouted at by my irate boss (or, indeed, fired) is too heady a holy grail for me to pass up.*

157
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:40,000
*I take another step forth. Ayu tries to retreat, but I'm faster than she is - and she is wearing a very high pair of heels.*

158
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:44,000
*Ayu totters. She teeters. It looks like she's going to fall!*

159
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:49,000
*She opens her mouth, alarmed, and a high-pitched squeal emits from her lips.*

160
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:50,000
Ayu: "Kyaaaa!"

161
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:52,000
Hiroki: "A-Ayu, wait! Hold on!"

162
00:14:52,000 --> 00:15:01,000
*Ayu might've called me a mongrel and a bug, and it's true I have no fond feelings for her music, but I still don't want her to get hurt!*

163
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:03,000
*I need to try and help her!*

164
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:06,000
*...And so, I throw caution to the wind.*

165
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:12,000
*I dive forth, seizing Ayu's wrist with my arm, and pull her teetering body against mine.*

166
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:14,000
Ayu: "H-Huh? What are you-"

167
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:15,000
Ayu: "Aaaah!"

168
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:20,000
*Unfortunately for me, gravity is a harsh mistress, and I'm unable to resist her.*

169
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:25,000
*I fall over backwards, Ayu's prone body still pressed against my own.*

170
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:26,000
Hiroki: "Nn..."

171
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:29,000
*I grit my teeth together, ready for impact.*

172
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:36,000
*As I fall, time seems to slow to a trickle. The seconds turn into minutes, which turn into hours...*

173
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:42,000
*And then, with a loud thud and a worrying crunch, I collapse against the cold, gray sidewalk.*

174
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:43,000
Hiroki: "Oof..."

175
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:48,000
*I lie there for a few moments, winded, and stare up at the starry night sky.*

176
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:54,000
*My head is pounding like the speakers at Ayu's concert, and my back is killing me.*

177
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:57,000
*I hope I haven't broken any bones...*

178
00:15:57,000 --> 00:16:06,000
*Gingerly, I twitch my fingertips. They seem to be in working order, at least (as a photographer, my fingers are pretty important).*

179
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:09,000
*Then, I try to sit up - but I can't.*

180
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:12,000
*There's a weight pressing down upon my chest!*

181
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:13,000
*It's...*

182
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:14,000
Hiroki: "A-Ayu?!"

183
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:20,000
*The famous idol Ikue Ayu, Japan's beloved sweetheart, is sitting astride me like a cowgirl.*

184
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:26,000
*Her legs are spread, her thighs pinioning me in place, while her skirt is all rumpled up.*

185
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:31,000
*She holds one hand to her head, wincing, as she tries to gather her bearings.*

186
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:39,000
*She looks dazed and confused, but I don't think she's hurt. I was able to shield her from the worst of the fall.*

187
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:46,000
*I took the full brunt of the pain for her sake, all to protect her pretty face, and I'm glad it worked.*

188
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:56,000
*Who'd want to look at photos of a famous idol with a bruised eye and a split lip? I'd get into a world of trouble if I tried to publish pics like that!*

189
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:58,000
*...Speaking of taking photos...*

190
00:16:58,000 --> 00:16:59,000
Hiroki: "Crap."

191
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:07,000
*I'd almost completely forgotten about my bag slung across my chest, filled with expensive, top-of-the-range equipment.*

192
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:12,000
*I didn't buy any of that equipment myself. It was on lease by my company!*

193
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:21,000
*My boss always warns me, before I head off on my assingments, to take care of the expensive camera and the lenses he trusts me with.*

194
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:30,000
Boss: "This equipment is worth more than your life. If you break it, I'll break one of your arms! Do you understand, Ogasawara?"

195
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:32,000
Hiroki: "Damn iiiiit..."

196
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:41,000
*The words force their way out of my chest. My lungs feel constrained by both my mounting anxiety and the weight of Ayu's body.*

197
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:46,000
*I haven't checked inside my bag yet, but I'm already fearing the worst.*

198
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:49,000
*The crunch sound I heard as I fell over...*

199
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:55,000
*What if that wasn't my skull, crumpling on itself like a paper plate, but all my equipment?*

200
00:17:55,000 --> 00:18:02,000
*If my camera's broken, it'll be impossible to take a pic of Ayu, even though she's right in front of me!*

201
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:06,000
*I've screwed up yet again! My boss is going to be so pissed off!*

202
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:18,000
*Why'd I have to come over all chivalric at such a critical junction? My job's on the line as it is, without adding wanton destruction of company property to my list of sins!*

203
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:22,000
*Ayu might be attractive, but she isn't worth this much trouble!*

204
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:26,000
*Now, I want nothing more than to drink myself into oblivion!*

205
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:28,000
Hiroki: "Hey, um... Ayu..."

206
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:35,000
*I blink up at Ayu. Her pretty face swims before me, rendered vague and hazy thanks to my pounding headache.*

207
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:38,000
Hiroki: "I'm sorry about all that. Uh..."

208
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:46,000
Hiroki: "I know you might be in a state of shock, but would you mind getting off me? It's hard to breathe, you see..."

209
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:47,000
Ayu: "..."

210
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:53,000
*Ayu doesn't reply. Instead, she stares at me, her eyes blank and unseeing, her mouth slack.*

211
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:56,000
*Her soul hasn't escaped from her body, has it?*

212
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:59,000
*Has she gone into a state of catatonic shock?!*

213
00:18:59,000 --> 00:19:05,000
*Since Ayu's an idol (and a popular one at that), she must be bound by quite a strict contract.*

214
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:10,000
*Most idols aren't allowed to spend much time with members of the opposite sex.*

215
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:18,000
*Could this be the first time she's ever been so close and personal with a man? (A man who isn't her father, I mean.)*

216
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:22,000
*That might explain why she's staring at me so intensely.*

217
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:26,000
*She looks like she's just clapped eyes on an extra-terrestrial!*

218
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:27,000
Hiroki: "Damn..."

219
00:19:27,000 --> 00:19:30,000
*I curse once more, my head and my lungs on fire.*

220
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:41,000
*As if it wasn't bad enough that I've (potentially) broken tens of thousands of yen worth of camera equipment, it's beginning to look like I might've broken Ayu, too!*

221
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:49,000
*I only reached out to grab her 'cause I wanted to help! I was trying to spare her from sustaining too much damage!*

222
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:52,000
*I never meant to cause her so much harm...!*

223
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:53,000
Hiroki: "Ayu, um..."

224
00:19:53,000 --> 00:20:01,000
*I can't let myself panic. If I do, I might startle Ayu even more. I need to be cool, calm, and impersonal, like a doctor...*

225
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:05,000
*Though, given the circumstances, that's quite a tall order!*

226
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:15,000
*The weight of Ayu's body is pressing against me. I can feel the warmth of her skin through my clothes, not the mention the fullness of her thighs.*

227
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:19,000
*Her lips are pursed, and her cheeks are dusted with red blush.*

228
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:25,000
*She looks utterly delectable, much like the fake strawberry that adorns her tiny tophat.*

229
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:33,000
*I don't think much of Ayu's singing voice, but I can finally see (in painfully clear detail) why she's so enduringly popular.*

230
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:42,000
*She's insanely good-looking - and, unlike a lot of other celebs, who hide behind extensive photo editing, she looks even better in person!*

231
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:45,000
*She smells good, too - kind of like strawberries.*

232
00:20:45,000 --> 00:20:54,000
*The cool wind runs through Ayu's hair, wafting her scent towards me. Her unique aroma fills my nostrils, while her body consumes my eyes.*

233
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:57,000
*Now, my five senses know nothing other than Ayu!*

234
00:20:57,000 --> 00:20:59,000
Hiroki: "Ah... Haa, nn..."

235
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:06,000
*The hardness and the coldness of the sidewalk melts away, as does the throbbing pain in my back and my head.*

236
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:14,000
*All of a sudden, it doesn't matter that I can't breathe. I want this moment to last a lifetime - but that's hardly practical!*

237
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:20,000
*If anybody sees us like this, we're done for! Ayu's reputation will be in shreds...*

238
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:30,000
*Unless, of course, she claims that I molested her. Then, I can forget about my work-related woes! I'll be sent straight to prison instead! Yahoo!*

239
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:37,000
*...Fuck. This is bad. I need to try and wriggle my way outta this position, or things'll go from bad to worse!*

240
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:43,000
Hiroki: "Ayu, please... We can't stay like this. Not in the middle of public street."

241
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:49,000
Hiroki: "I don't want to sound rude, but would you mind moving? For both our sakes?"

242
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:50,000
Ayu: "Ah... Haa..."

243
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:56,000
*Ayu breathes heavily. Her voluptuous chest rises and falls and her thighs cinch about my waist.*

244
00:21:56,000 --> 00:22:02,000
*Rather than extricating herself from me, she's gripping me more intensely than ever!*

245
00:22:02,000 --> 00:22:04,000
Hiroki: "A-Ayu, please-"

246
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:13,000
*I try to dissuade her, but to little avail. Her fingers grip the fabric of my shirt, and then she does something truly improbable.*

247
00:22:13,000 --> 00:22:16,000
*She begins to grind her hips against me!*

248
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:18,000
Hiroki: "I, ahh... Nnn..."

249
00:22:18,000 --> 00:22:20,000
*I lie there like a pinned bug.*

250
00:22:20,000 --> 00:22:24,000
*I'm so stunned, I hardly know what to think or feel.*

251
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:26,000
*This is... This is...*

252
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:27,000
*This is incredible!":

253
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:35,000
*If this perfect paragon of feminine beauty keeps rubbing against me, I won't be responsible for my future actions!*

254
00:22:35,000 --> 00:22:40,000
*She's so cute... And the little moans spilling from her mouth are to die for!*

255
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:42,000
Ayu: "Nn... Haa, haa..."

256
00:22:42,000 --> 00:22:47,000
*I was never a big fan of Ayu, but if this keeps up, she might just convert me!*

257
00:22:47,000 --> 00:23:00,000
*After this is over and done with, will I be obligated to attend the rest of her concerts? Will I have to fork out the cash to buy all her newest CDs, her merch, and tickets for her performances?*

258
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:04,000
*It'll be hard to do that if I lose my job, though...*

259
00:23:04,000 --> 00:23:07,000
*And it'll be even harder if I get sent to prison.*

260
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:11,000
*I know I should put an end to this, but I'm a weak man!*

261
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:20,000
*Ayu's undeniably good-looking, and she's more appealing than ever when she isn't talking in that annoying, high-pitched voice of hers!*

262
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:21,000
*Her moans...*

263
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:23,000
Ayu: "Nn... Haa, haaa..."

264
00:23:23,000 --> 00:23:26,000
*They're so sexy it should be a crime!*

265
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:30,000
*I want to feel more of Ayu's perfect body against mine!*

266
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:32,000
*I want to hold her...*

267
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:34,000
*I want to kiss her...*

268
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:35,000
*I... I... I...*

269
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:38,000
*This is taking things a bit too far!":

270
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:41,000
*This is too much! It's way too much!*

271
00:23:41,000 --> 00:23:45,000
*I need to get her off me, and fast, before something bad happens!*

272
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:49,000
Hiroki: "Hey, Ayu! Earth to Ayu! Do you know what you're doing?"

273
00:23:49,000 --> 00:23:53,000
Hiroki: "If word gets out about this, there'll be a huge scandal!"

274
00:23:53,000 --> 00:23:56,000
Hiroki: "Do yourself a favor and get off me!"

275
00:23:56,000 --> 00:23:57,000
Ayu: "Ah..."

276
00:23:57,000 --> 00:24:04,000
*Ayu blinks. She looks down at me, her fingers still curled about the fabric of her my shirt, her lips pursed.*

277
00:24:04,000 --> 00:24:11,000
*Her eyes don't look glassy, like they did before... and, though she's still blushing, her brow is furrowed.*

278
00:24:11,000 --> 00:24:14,000
*She doesn't look like she's enjoying herself.*

279
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:17,000
*In fact, she seems downright pissed.*

280
00:24:17,000 --> 00:24:19,000
Ayu: "You... Y-Y-Y-You..."

281
00:24:19,000 --> 00:24:21,000
Hiroki: "Yes? What is it?"

282
00:24:21,000 --> 00:24:22,000
Ayu: "You... You..."

283
00:24:22,000 --> 00:24:23,000
Hiroki: "I...?"

284
00:24:23,000 --> 00:24:24,000
Ayu: "You PERVERT!!!"

285
00:24:24,000 --> 00:24:30,000
*Ayu slaps my cheek. She slaps it so hard my teeth rattle and stars explode behind my eyelids.*

286
00:24:30,000 --> 00:24:33,000
*That's... probably going to leave a mark.*

287
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:36,000
*Damn, now the right side of my face is throbbing!*

288
00:24:36,000 --> 00:24:39,000
*What a nice way to cap off the night...*

289
00:24:39,000 --> 00:24:49,000
Ayu: "I-I can't believe you would try to take advantage of me like that, out in the open! You should be ashamed of yourself! You're the absolute worst!"

290
00:24:49,000 --> 00:24:55,000
*Ayu pushes herself off me. She gets to her feet, still teetering in her heels, then glowers.*

291
00:24:55,000 --> 00:25:03,000
Ayu: "Your mother would be ashamed if she could see you right now! You're less than an insect! You're even less than a worm!"

292
00:25:03,000 --> 00:25:09,000
Ayu: "You don't even deserve to exist on the same planet as those worthy creatures!"

293
00:25:09,000 --> 00:25:21,000
Ayu: "At least worms and ants and spiders help the environment! They're part of the ecosystem, but you're just a waste of space! You don't deserve to live! Why don't you just die?!"

294
00:25:21,000 --> 00:25:25,000
Ayu: "Better yet, I'll kill you myself! I really will kill you!"

295
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:34,000
*Ayu doesn't try to help me back to my feet. Instead, she spits vitriol at me, even more corrosive than the harshest of chemicals.*

296
00:25:34,000 --> 00:25:44,000
*I try to get up, but Ayu doesn't make it easy for me. Slapping my face wasn't enough to satisfy her self-righteous rage, because she kicks my shin.*

297
00:25:44,000 --> 00:25:47,000
*I stagger back, hissing, doubled-over with pain.*

298
00:25:47,000 --> 00:25:48,000
Hiroki: "Damn it..."

299
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:53,000
*Ayu's heels are very sharp and pointed, and being kicked by them hurts!*

300
00:25:53,000 --> 00:25:57,000
*At least Ayu's hatred has helped to ease my raging passions.*

301
00:25:57,000 --> 00:26:02,000
*I don't feel turned on any more. Instead, I feel pained, upset, and confused.*

302
00:26:02,000 --> 00:26:08,000
Hiroki: "I-I wasn't trying to take advantage of you! You fell and I went to steady you!"

303
00:26:08,000 --> 00:26:15,000
Hiroki: "It's because of me that you didn't hurt yourself. Couldn't you thank me for that, at least?"

304
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:16,000
Ayu: "Thank you?!"

305
00:26:16,000 --> 00:26:18,000
*Ayu stares at me incredulously.*

306
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:24,000
Ayu: "Why should I thank you? I never would've fallen if you hadn't called out to me, you moron!"

307
00:26:24,000 --> 00:26:29,000
*...Well, I guess she's not wrong about that. That's one point to Ayu.*

308
00:26:29,000 --> 00:26:36,000
Ayu: "Besides, I bet you wanted me to land on top of you! You were practically throbbing with anticipation!"

309
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:45,000
Ayu: "You're the worst, and I never want to see you ever again! You're lucky I'm not going to call the police on you, you sick fuck!"

310
00:26:45,000 --> 00:26:49,000
Ayu: "Never talk to me ever again! That is an order! Hmph!"

311
00:26:49,000 --> 00:26:58,000
*Ayu turns and marches off. She mutters to herself all the while, her arms swinging back and forth at her sides like a soldier's.*

312
00:26:58,000 --> 00:27:07,000
*I'm not sure what she's saying, exactly, but a few choice bits and pieces of her angry monologue filter back to me on the cool breeze.*

313
00:27:07,000 --> 00:27:10,000
Ayu: "...loser. Who does he think he is?"

314
00:27:10,000 --> 00:27:13,000
Ayu: "...attractive or anything. Not my type, so..."

315
00:27:13,000 --> 00:27:18,000
Ayu: "...like that before. Must be a trick. Don't let him get the better of you!"

316
00:27:18,000 --> 00:27:21,000
Ayu: "There's nothing special about that guy!"

317
00:27:21,000 --> 00:27:28,000
*I don't move. I'm so stunned by my unexpected encounter with Ayu I can only stand there, mouth agape.*

318
00:27:28,000 --> 00:27:35,000
*It's only after a few minutes have elapsed and Ayu has faded from view that I finally return to my senses.*

319
00:27:35,000 --> 00:27:44,000
*My head's still throbbing and my back aches, but I don't think I've broken anything. That's something to be thankful for, at least...*

320
00:27:44,000 --> 00:27:47,000
*But the same can't be said for my camera.*

321
00:27:47,000 --> 00:27:48,000
Hiroki: "Shit."

322
00:27:48,000 --> 00:27:53,000
*I take one cursory look inside my bag, and soon wish I hadn't bothered.*

323
00:27:53,000 --> 00:27:58,000
*There's no two ways about it. My boss is definitely going to kill me.*

324
00:27:58,000 --> 00:28:00,000
Hiroki: "Urgh... What a day..."

325
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:08,000
*I'm sitting in a smoky bar, nursing some cocktail or another. I'm not sure what it's called, and neither do I really care.*

326
00:28:08,000 --> 00:28:21,000
*I was so out of it when I arrived at this bar (and more than a little intimidated by the vast selection of drinks available), I asked the bartender to make up whatever cocktail they wanted.*

327
00:28:21,000 --> 00:28:33,000
*The cocktail is a comforting amber color, and it tastes faintly fruity. It's not bad - though, in my current state of misery, I wouldn't say "no" to something even harder.*

328
00:28:33,000 --> 00:28:39,000
*...Then again, getting too drunk might be a poor idea. My head's still killing me.*

329
00:28:39,000 --> 00:28:47,000
*Though alcohol can sometimes take the edge off worldly pains, at other times, it can only serve to exacerbate them.*

330
00:28:47,000 --> 00:28:51,000
*Given I've been so unlucky today, I'd rather not take my chances.*

331
00:28:51,000 --> 00:28:54,000
*I sip at my drink, only half-tasting it.*

332
00:28:54,000 --> 00:28:59,000
*Jazzy piano music fills the air, mingled with that of casual conversation.*

333
00:28:59,000 --> 00:29:06,000
*This bar's a fairly popular one, and several men and women (though mostly men) are sitting about, drinking.*

334
00:29:06,000 --> 00:29:18,000
*Some of the men are in business suits, while the women wear sparkly evening dresses; their faces carefully made-up and their feet wedged into perilously high-heeled shoes.*

335
00:29:18,000 --> 00:29:21,000
*I wonder if these men just finished work?*

336
00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:27,000
*It's a weekend, but that doesn't necessarily mean R&R for Japan's bankers or businessmen.*

337
00:29:27,000 --> 00:29:34,000
*Some companies operate even during Saturdays and Sundays; their workers obliged to work long into the night.*

338
00:29:34,000 --> 00:29:40,000
*I pity all these guys, with their slicked-back hair and their slightly rumpled suits.*

339
00:29:40,000 --> 00:29:44,000
*At least, I would, if I hadn't had such an awful day myself.*

340
00:29:44,000 --> 00:29:51,000
*Not only did I fail to take any photos of Ayu, but I was also slapped across the face by the selfsame woman.*

341
00:29:51,000 --> 00:29:58,000
*Then, to cap things off, I broke the very expensive camera equipment my boss commanded me to take care of.*

342
00:29:58,000 --> 00:30:04,000
*I'm so not looking forward to going into work on Monday. My boss is gonna eviscerate me.*

343
00:30:04,000 --> 00:30:10,000
*At least the businessmen around me, weary though they look, seem to be having fun.*

344
00:30:10,000 --> 00:30:16,000
*They probably earn a lot more than I do, and I doubt their bosses are as draconian as my own.*

345
00:30:16,000 --> 00:30:24,000
*My boss is a jumped-up man with an inflated sense of self-importance, who loves to breathe down the necks of his employees.*

346
00:30:24,000 --> 00:30:32,000
*He chews us out for the smallest of errors, and he seems to take genuine sadistic delight in making the newest hires cry.*

347
00:30:32,000 --> 00:30:41,000
*He's never made me cry (I wouldn't want to give him the satisfaction), but I'd be lying if I said I wasn't a little afraid of him.*

348
00:30:41,000 --> 00:30:50,000
*I've (generally) kept in his good graces for the three years I've been working under him, but that's going to come to an end on Monday.*

349
00:30:50,000 --> 00:31:00,000
*I'd like to think he won't fire me (as much as I dislike my job, I kinda need it to pay the bills), but that might be a touch too optimistic.*

350
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:09,000
*Even if he doesn't fire me (which is a distinct possibility), the costs of this smashed camera are gonna come directly out of my earnings.*

351
00:31:09,000 --> 00:31:11,000
*Either way, I'll be in trouble.*

352
00:31:11,000 --> 00:31:16,000
Hiroki: "I guess I'll be eating instant noodles for the rest of the month..."

353
00:31:16,000 --> 00:31:21,000
Hiroki: "This'll be the last time I'll be able to go to a bar, too."

354
00:31:21,000 --> 00:31:25,000
*I mope over my drink, my fingers buried in my hair.*

355
00:31:25,000 --> 00:31:33,000
*I'm suddenly very aware of how expensive this cocktail was, and I want to make it last for as long as possible.*

356
00:31:33,000 --> 00:31:39,000
*Whether I get fired or not, finances are gonna be tight. I can't afford to spend too much.*

357
00:31:39,000 --> 00:31:45,000
*How I envy the businessmen around me, forking out bills for fancy drinks and snacks.*

358
00:31:45,000 --> 00:31:56,000
*Pretty women (maybe girlfriends, but they could be escorts - it's hard to tell) hang on their arms, laughing at all their bad jokes, their lips shimmering with gloss.*

359
00:31:56,000 --> 00:32:01,000
*When was the last time a pretty girl draped herself over me like that, huh?*

360
00:32:01,000 --> 00:32:10,000
*...Well, strictly speaking, it was about half an hour ago. Ayu was making herself pretty comfortable on my lap, until she slapped me.*

361
00:32:10,000 --> 00:32:13,000
*That's another thing to feel rotten about.*

362
00:32:13,000 --> 00:32:17,000
Hiroki: "That Ayu's so sadistic... She really got my hopes up..."

363
00:32:17,000 --> 00:32:25,000
*I take another sip of my cocktail. I hope it might lighten my dreary thoughts, but it's actually making me feel worse.*

364
00:32:25,000 --> 00:32:33,000
*Maybe I should hurry up and get out of here. I'm too broke to get drunk, and the trains'll stop running soon...*

365
00:32:33,000 --> 00:32:40,000
*I knock back the rest of my cocktail, then get to my feet. I'm ready to make a beeline for the exit when...*

366
00:32:40,000 --> 00:32:46,000
???: "Oh my. Are you leaving already? That is a shame! It's not even midnight yet!"

367
00:32:46,000 --> 00:32:48,000
*A sultry voice calls me back.*

368
00:32:48,000 --> 00:32:50,000
*I turn, blinking... then gasp.*

369
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:54,000
*Sitting by the counter is an incredibly attractive woman.*

370
00:32:54,000 --> 00:32:59,000
*She has dark, tanned skin which contrasts with her almost bone-white hair.*

371
00:32:59,000 --> 00:33:06,000
*She's dressed in business attire, but her pinstriped suit and white shirt gape open, to reveal an ample bosom.*

372
00:33:06,000 --> 00:33:11,000
*One of her legs is crossed over the other, and in one hand she holds a glass.*

373
00:33:11,000 --> 00:33:21,000
*Her eyes are green, a little like cat's, and they're lidded. A playful smile puckers her lips, and her face is flushed, probably from the alcohol.*

374
00:33:21,000 --> 00:33:32,000
*Something about her looks familiar, but I can't quite place her face. To be quite frank, her large bosom is attracting most of my attention, as are her thighs.*

375
00:33:32,000 --> 00:33:36,000
*You could crush a watermelon between thighs like that!*

376
00:33:36,000 --> 00:33:39,000
*Was she really calling out to me? But why?*

377
00:33:39,000 --> 00:33:48,000
*I don't think I'm particularly unattractive, but my flyaway hair and my baggy jeans aren't the pinnacle of fashion, or good taste.*

378
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:56,000
*It should be obvious, at a glance, that I don't pull in half the salary as some of the big-shot businessmen around here do.*

379
00:33:56,000 --> 00:34:02,000
*I must've been mistaken. It can't have been me she was calling out to. There's no way!*

380
00:34:02,000 --> 00:34:05,000
*I turn, ready to walk away once more, but...*

381
00:34:05,000 --> 00:34:11,000
???: "Hey! I was talking to you, you know? It's rude to leave a lady in the lurch!"

382
00:34:11,000 --> 00:34:15,000
???: "Didn't your mother teach you any manners? Fufufu~"

383
00:34:15,000 --> 00:34:21,000
*The woman's laugh is throaty, and it does any number of curious things to my body.*

384
00:34:21,000 --> 00:34:27,000
*I can feel my hair standing on end, and my mouth feels dry despite the alcohol I consumed.*

385
00:34:27,000 --> 00:34:30,000
*I guess she really was talking to me.*

386
00:34:30,000 --> 00:34:32,000
Hiroki: "Um... I beg your pardon..."

387
00:34:32,000 --> 00:34:40,000
*I glance back at the femme fatale, doing my level best not to gawp at her chest (I'm not a teenager any more, damn it!)*

388
00:34:40,000 --> 00:34:46,000
Hiroki: "Do I know you? You look familiar, though I don't think we've met before..."

389
00:34:46,000 --> 00:34:51,000
???: "Oh? I look familiar, do I? I suppose that's hardly a surprise."

390
00:34:51,000 --> 00:34:56,000
Marina: "My name is Marina. Wakatsuki Marina. Does that ring any bells?"

391
00:34:56,000 --> 00:34:57,000
Hiroki: "Ah..."

392
00:34:57,000 --> 00:35:07,000
*Now that she's said it, her name does sound very familiar! The newspaper I work at, Sakura Daily, ran an article on her just a few weeks ago!*

393
00:35:07,000 --> 00:35:20,000
*Wakatsuki Marina is a famous entrepreneur and businesswoman. Half-Japanese, half South African (I think), Marina is the head of a world-famous brand of designer clothes, perfume, cosmetics, and more.*

394
00:35:20,000 --> 00:35:27,000
*She's one of the wealthiest women in Tokyo. Though she's no idol, I think she might be more famous than Ayu!*

395
00:35:27,000 --> 00:35:33,000
*I've run into two famous celebs today, all in under an hour. What are the odds of that?*

396
00:35:33,000 --> 00:35:41,000
*While Ayu was content to slap me and call me a pervert, Marina actually seems interested in instigating a conversation.*

397
00:35:41,000 --> 00:35:42,000
*This is amazing!*

398
00:35:42,000 --> 00:35:54,000
*I'm a photographer for a local paper, so I've met a few B-list celebrities in my time, but never before have I met a woman that exudes class and glamor like Wakatsuki Marina!*

399
00:35:54,000 --> 00:35:56,000
*Be still, my beating heart...*

400
00:35:56,000 --> 00:35:59,000
Marina: "My, my! You certainly look surprised!"

401
00:35:59,000 --> 00:36:06,000
Marina: "You'll attract flies if you let your mouth hang open like that, dear. It's not a very attractive look."

402
00:36:06,000 --> 00:36:08,000
Hiroki: "Oh, um... I'm sorry..."

403
00:36:08,000 --> 00:36:13,000
Marina: "It's alright. You don't need to apologize. I'm not offended!"

404
00:36:13,000 --> 00:36:19,000
Marina: "People often gawp when they see me. I'm quite used to it. I am a celebrity, you know."

405
00:36:19,000 --> 00:36:24,000
Hiroki: "Yes, um... I-I'm aware. I-I can't believe I didn't recognize you sooner!"

406
00:36:24,000 --> 00:36:27,000
*I bow again, which makes Marina giggle anew.*

407
00:36:27,000 --> 00:36:37,000
Marina: "Like I said, you don't need to apologize. I get enough of that at work. It's always "Yes, Ma'am, right away!" and "We're so terribly sorry!"..."

408
00:36:37,000 --> 00:36:44,000
Marina: "My workers all respect me, but they're so distant! It's almost like they're afraid of me!"

409
00:36:44,000 --> 00:36:55,000
Marina: "I know I'm very wealthy, beautiful, charismatic, and so on, but at the end of the day I'm still a normal woman. I get tired of people grovelling before me."

410
00:36:55,000 --> 00:36:59,000
Marina: "Sometimes, I just want to have a normal conversation!"

411
00:36:59,000 --> 00:37:02,000
Hiroki: "Oh, right... I-I see... I'm so-"

412
00:37:02,000 --> 00:37:09,000
*An apology is fully-formed on my tongue, but I cut myself off before I can say anything foolish.*

413
00:37:09,000 --> 00:37:17,000
*This must be why Marina called me over, despite the vast gulf of difference between our wealth and social standing.*

414
00:37:17,000 --> 00:37:28,000
*She's tired of being treated like a celeb, and (no doubt owing to a capricious whim of the wealthy) she wants to speak to a member of the peanut gallery like me.*

415
00:37:28,000 --> 00:37:33,000
*This is all a bit sudden (my heart's thudding incredibly hard!), but... Well.*

416
00:37:33,000 --> 00:37:38,000
*If Marina wants to speak to a nobody like me, who am I to refuse her?*

417
00:37:38,000 --> 00:37:46,000
Marina: "Now, why don't you sit your cute bottom back down at the counter, sweetie? Don't you want to buy another drink?"

418
00:37:46,000 --> 00:37:50,000
Hiroki: "I wouldn't mind, but I don't have much money..."

419
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:54,000
Marina: "That's alright! I'd be more than happy to foot the bill!"

420
00:37:54,000 --> 00:38:01,000
Hiroki: "That, um... That's very kind of you, but are you sure? I wouldn't want to put you out..."

421
00:38:01,000 --> 00:38:02,000
Marina: "Nonsense!"

422
00:38:02,000 --> 00:38:05,000
*Marina waves one manicured hand carelessly.*

423
00:38:05,000 --> 00:38:11,000
Marina: "I'm a wealthy businesswoman. A drink or two is hardly going to break the bank!"

424
00:38:11,000 --> 00:38:15,000
Hiroki: "A-Ahaha... I guess you're right about that."

425
00:38:15,000 --> 00:38:22,000
*I flush, embarrassed that I (a mere photographer) even thought to question the depths of Marina's pockets.*

426
00:38:22,000 --> 00:38:26,000
*She's infinitely richer than I could ever aspire to be!*

427
00:38:26,000 --> 00:38:32,000
*I know common courtesy dictates that men should foot the bill during dates, but... screw it.*

428
00:38:32,000 --> 00:38:39,000
*This isn't really a date, and Marina's the one who offered to buy me a drink in the first place.*

429
00:38:39,000 --> 00:38:43,000
*I think it's fine to flaunt convention every once in a while.*

430
00:38:43,000 --> 00:38:48,000
Hiroki: "If you don't mind, then sure. I'll be happy if you bought me a drink."

431
00:38:48,000 --> 00:38:52,000
Marina: "That's the spirit! I like a man who can hold his liquor!"

432
00:38:52,000 --> 00:38:57,000
Marina: "Bartender! Can I get a couple of lemon highballs over here?"

433
00:38:57,000 --> 00:39:01,000
*I sit down next to Marina while she plies me with alcohol.*

434
00:39:01,000 --> 00:39:08,000
*We drink together for a while, idly exchanging banter. All the while, I try not to stare at Marina's chest.*

435
00:39:08,000 --> 00:39:13,000
*I can hardly believe that this is happening. What's become of my life?!*

436
00:39:13,000 --> 00:39:20,000
*About half an hour (and three more lemon highballs) later, Marina shoots me a curious glance and says...*

437
00:39:20,000 --> 00:39:25,000
Marina: "So, Hiroki, why do you look so down? Did something happen?"

438
00:39:25,000 --> 00:39:30,000
Hiroki: "I guess you could say that, yeah... But was it really that obvious?"

439
00:39:30,000 --> 00:39:39,000
Marina: "Quite! That's why I called out to you. I couldn't stand to see such a handsome young man looking so... Well. Defeated."

440
00:39:39,000 --> 00:39:49,000
Marina: "I know we're relative strangers, but as the old saying goes, "a problem shared is a problem halved". Would you mind telling me what's on your mind?"

441
00:39:49,000 --> 00:39:56,000
Hiroki: "I don't know if you'd want to hear it. It's nothing that interesting. It's... work stuff, I guess."

442
00:39:56,000 --> 00:40:05,000
Marina: "As a businesswoman, I'm very well-acquainted with troublesome "work stuff"! I have plenty of problems of my own to deal with."

443
00:40:05,000 --> 00:40:10,000
Hiroki: "I figured as much. That's why I don't want to burden you with mine."

444
00:40:10,000 --> 00:40:11,000
Marina: "But..."

445
00:40:11,000 --> 00:40:19,000
*Marina leans in a little closer to me. I can feel the silky softness of her silvery hair against my flushed skin.*

446
00:40:19,000 --> 00:40:28,000
Marina: "...I think it would be nice to listen to somebody else's woes. It might take my mind off my own concerns - and who knows?"

447
00:40:28,000 --> 00:40:35,000
Marina: "Listening to your problems might help me think of a way to resolve these pesky problems of mine!"

448
00:40:35,000 --> 00:40:43,000
Marina: "Would you mind telling me what's wrong, dear? I'd love to get to know you better. You're so cute, after all..."

449
00:40:43,000 --> 00:40:47,000
*Marina draws her pink, cat-like tongue along her lower lip.*

450
00:40:47,000 --> 00:40:50,000
Marina: "Why, you're good enough to eat!"

451
00:40:50,000 --> 00:40:54,000
Hiroki: "I-I don't think I'm all that good-looking..."

452
00:40:54,000 --> 00:41:02,000
Hiroki: "But, if you want to listen to my belly-aching, I suppose I can oblige. You did buy me a few drinks, after all."

453
00:41:02,000 --> 00:41:08,000
*Now comfortably light-headed, I offer Marina a small smile, then launch into my tale.*

454
00:41:08,000 --> 00:41:12,000
Hiroki: "I'm a photographer for the Sakura Daily. Do you know it?"

455
00:41:12,000 --> 00:41:18,000
Marina: "Ah, yes! I was interviewed by an employee of that newspaper only a few weeks prior!"

456
00:41:18,000 --> 00:41:26,000
*So I wasn't misremembering. We really have run a piece on Marina before. It's nice to know I'm not going senile, I guess.*

457
00:41:26,000 --> 00:41:31,000
Hiroki: "Well... My boss sent me out to a concert by Ayu tonight. She's a-"

458
00:41:31,000 --> 00:41:37,000
Marina: "Popular idol? Yes, I know about her! I know her very well, as a matter of fact!"

459
00:41:37,000 --> 00:41:38,000
Hiroki: "Really?"

460
00:41:38,000 --> 00:41:42,000
Marina: "You'd be surprised to know how close we are! Fufufu!"

461
00:41:42,000 --> 00:41:51,000
*I look at Marina, intrigued. She doesn't look like the sort of person who'd be familiar with the musical stylings of Ikue Ayu.*

462
00:41:51,000 --> 00:41:57,000
*Marina looks like she'd be into classical music or jazz, not high-energy J-Pop numbers.*

463
00:41:57,000 --> 00:42:00,000
*I guess you can't judge a book by its cover.*

464
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:07,000
Hiroki: "Well... I was meant to take some pics of Ayu while she was performing, but there were a few problems."

465
00:42:07,000 --> 00:42:17,000
Hiroki: "The trains were delayed, and I arrived at the concert late. It had already started when I got there, and I couldn't get to the front of the crowd."

466
00:42:17,000 --> 00:42:22,000
Hiroki: "I was shunted all the way to the back, behind a whole sea of people."

467
00:42:22,000 --> 00:42:31,000
Hiroki: "There was no space, and there were too many bodies in the way, and I couldn't set up my camera. I had no chance to take any photos."

468
00:42:31,000 --> 00:42:35,000
Marina: "Oh no! That sounds like quite the disaster!"

469
00:42:35,000 --> 00:42:41,000
Hiroki: "It was. My boss is gonna kill me when he finds out... And that's not the end of it."

470
00:42:41,000 --> 00:42:45,000
*I give Marina a quick, abridged version of the night's events.*

471
00:42:45,000 --> 00:42:52,000
*I tell her about my gloomy night-time wanderings through the city, then my chance encounter with Ayu.*

472
00:42:52,000 --> 00:43:05,000
*I don't go into every single gory detail (I don't, for instance, tell Marina how excited I got when Ayu fell on me), but I do tell Marina that Ayu slapped me for my efforts, then called me a pervert.*

473
00:43:05,000 --> 00:43:11,000
Hiroki: "I didn't want to do anything inappropriate to her. I was just trying to do my job!"

474
00:43:11,000 --> 00:43:15,000
*I lament helplessly, my words falling in a tumble from my throat.*

475
00:43:15,000 --> 00:43:22,000
*When lubricated with alcohol, it's surprisingly easy to gush about the most embarrassing of things!*

476
00:43:22,000 --> 00:43:28,000
Hiroki: "She slapped me really hard, too. The whole side of my head is still smarting!"

477
00:43:28,000 --> 00:43:29,000
Marina: "Ah, yes..."

478
00:43:29,000 --> 00:43:36,000
Marina: "I can see a red mark on your face, now that you mention it. She must have done a number on you."

479
00:43:36,000 --> 00:43:42,000
Hiroki: "She really did. For an idol, she had a surprising amount of upper body strength."

480
00:43:42,000 --> 00:43:50,000
Hiroki: "I didn't know she was so powerful! She certainly doesn't look like it! She's so tiny, and she wears so much pink!"

481
00:43:50,000 --> 00:44:01,000
Marina: "Idols are made of tougher stuff than you might think. They pour a lot of time and effort into perfecting their dance routines, and they work long hours."

482
00:44:01,000 --> 00:44:04,000
Marina: "I'm not surprised that Ayu's so strong..."

483
00:44:04,000 --> 00:44:10,000
Marina: "Though I wish she'd learn to use that head of hers! She's so thoughtless!"

484
00:44:10,000 --> 00:44:15,000
Marina: "I really am sorry she caused you so much distress, Hiroki!"

485
00:44:15,000 --> 00:44:21,000
Hiroki: "It's fine. What's done is done. I'm trying not to think about it too much..."

486
00:44:21,000 --> 00:44:28,000
*And the alcohol's certainly helping. My surroundings look hazy and unreal, and my mind is pleasantly numb.*

487
00:44:28,000 --> 00:44:33,000
*One or two things about Marina's words do seem quite odd, though...*

488
00:44:33,000 --> 00:44:39,000
Hiroki: "It sounds like you know Ayu quite well - not just as an idol, but as a person?"

489
00:44:39,000 --> 00:44:42,000
Marina: "I suppose you could say that!"

490
00:44:42,000 --> 00:44:51,000
Marina: "Ayu and I are close, like I said. We're not family, but we might as well be. She's like... a naughty little sister to me, I suppose!"

491
00:44:51,000 --> 00:44:54,000
Hiroki: "What, really? I didn't know that...!"

492
00:44:54,000 --> 00:44:59,000
Marina: "Few people do. My relationship with Ayu isn't widely publicized."

493
00:44:59,000 --> 00:45:08,000
Marina: "Ayu's good at putting on a cute act before the cameras, but she has a short temper, and she can be quite nasty at times!"

494
00:45:08,000 --> 00:45:15,000
Marina: "Do you want me to have a word with her? I'm really quite upset that she would treat you so badly!"

495
00:45:15,000 --> 00:45:21,000
Hiroki: "O-Oh, no. It's fine. Like I said, it's too late to worry about that now..."

496
00:45:21,000 --> 00:45:26,000
Marina: "Maybe so, but I do sympathize with you! You must have had a rough night!"

497
00:45:26,000 --> 00:45:30,000
Hiroki: "Well, that's just part of being an adult. I'm used to it."

498
00:45:30,000 --> 00:45:37,000
Hiroki: "The alcohol has helped. So has talking to you. Thanks for listening to my worries, Marina."

499
00:45:37,000 --> 00:45:45,000
Marina: "It's no problem at all! I'm glad I was able to aid you in some small manner, though I wish I could do more."

500
00:45:45,000 --> 00:45:53,000
Marina: "It's partially my fault Ayu was so rude to you. If I'd disciplined her better, she never would have slapped you!"

501
00:45:53,000 --> 00:46:00,000
Marina: "Keeping Ayu in line is my job. Lady Yue asked me to keep an eye on her, and I've failed."

502
00:46:00,000 --> 00:46:02,000
Marina: "I feel... most humbled..."

503
00:46:02,000 --> 00:46:03,000
Hiroki: "Lady Yue?"

504
00:46:03,000 --> 00:46:14,000
*I wonder who that is. Based on the title Marina gave her, she sounds like royalty. Is she a foreign princess? But what connection does she have with Marina and Ayu?*

505
00:46:14,000 --> 00:46:15,000
*I'm a little lost...*

506
00:46:15,000 --> 00:46:20,000
*But, before I can ponder this, I feel a soft sensation against my thigh.*

507
00:46:20,000 --> 00:46:27,000
*Marina is gripping my upper leg with one hand, her manicured nails digging through the fabric of my pants.*

508
00:46:27,000 --> 00:46:28,000
Marina: "Hiroki..."

509
00:46:28,000 --> 00:46:35,000
*Marina leans in. Her voice falls to a soft, sultry whisper, which envelops my body like a caress.*

510
00:46:35,000 --> 00:46:44,000
Marina: "I cannot overstate how sorry I am that Ayu caused you so many problems. She's a naughty girl, and I will scold her later..."

511
00:46:44,000 --> 00:46:48,000
Marina: "But for now, I would like to apologize on her behalf."

512
00:46:48,000 --> 00:46:52,000
Marina: "Would you mind coming back to my office with me?"

513
00:46:52,000 --> 00:47:00,000
Marina: "You're a fine specimen of a man, and it's been a long time since I last found prey worthy of my unique attention."

514
00:47:00,000 --> 00:47:04,000
Marina: "You intrigued me the moment I saw you, so please..."

515
00:47:04,000 --> 00:47:08,000
*Marina licks her lips, her eyes heavy with expectation.*

516
00:47:08,000 --> 00:47:10,000
Marina: "...don't let me down."

517
00:47:10,000 --> 00:47:20,000
Marina: "My, my. I must say, I'm impressed. I didn't think you'd be able to go for quite that long - particularly with all that alcohol inside you!"

518
00:47:20,000 --> 00:47:24,000
Marina: "You're quite the interesting man, Hiroki... Fufufu..."

519
00:47:24,000 --> 00:47:29,000
*Marina laughs, her eyes half-lidded, as she runs her fingers through my hair.*

520
00:47:29,000 --> 00:47:34,000
*She's sitting cross-legged upon the floor, wearing her typical office attire.*

521
00:47:34,000 --> 00:47:43,000
*I, meanwhile, am lying upon Marina's lap, wearing nothing but my underwear. Under normal circumstances, I'd probably feel exposed, but...*

522
00:47:43,000 --> 00:47:44,000
*Well.*

523
00:47:44,000 --> 00:47:48,000
*These circumstances are anything other than "normal".*

524
00:47:48,000 --> 00:47:54,000
*I met the famous businesswoman, Wakatsuki Marina, in a small bar on a swanky street.*

525
00:47:54,000 --> 00:47:59,000
*After plying me with a few drinks, she invited me back to her office.*

526
00:47:59,000 --> 00:48:01,000
*Then, we enjoyed ourselves.*

527
00:48:01,000 --> 00:48:07,000
*Now my madness has subsided somewhat, I'm beginning to feel the consequences of my actions.*

528
00:48:07,000 --> 00:48:14,000
*My whole body aches, as though I've been thrown off the top of Tokyo Tower, and my head's killing me.*

529
00:48:14,000 --> 00:48:18,000
*At least I can rest it on Marina's delectable thighs.*

530
00:48:18,000 --> 00:48:19,000
Marina: "How cute..."

531
00:48:19,000 --> 00:48:25,000
*Marina continues to run her hands through my hair, her voice a light, lilting sing-song.*

532
00:48:25,000 --> 00:48:32,000
*Though I put Marina through the wringer, she's emerged from our love-making relatively unscathed.*

533
00:48:32,000 --> 00:48:37,000
*She doesn't seem at all out of breath, unlike me! In fact, she's even smiling!*

534
00:48:37,000 --> 00:48:45,000
*I guess Marina's forged from pretty tough stuff. Is that a prerequisite if you want to get ahead in the business world?*

535
00:48:45,000 --> 00:48:47,000
*She has far more stamina than I do!*

536
00:48:47,000 --> 00:48:48,000
Hiroki: "Marina..."

537
00:48:48,000 --> 00:48:57,000
*I blink up at Marina's pretty face, my gaze unfocused. Her visage swims before me, and my temples start to pound something fierce.*

538
00:48:57,000 --> 00:48:58,000
*Shit.*

539
00:48:58,000 --> 00:48:59,000
Marina: "Yes?"

540
00:48:59,000 --> 00:49:01,000
*Marina, for her part, only smiles.*

541
00:49:01,000 --> 00:49:07,000
*She looks down at me, her bone-white hair trailing against my cheek, and says sweetly...*

542
00:49:07,000 --> 00:49:09,000
Marina: "What is it, dear?"

543
00:49:09,000 --> 00:49:12,000
Hiroki: "You, um... I was just wondering..."

544
00:49:12,000 --> 00:49:14,000
Hiroki: "Did that feel good for you?"

545
00:49:14,000 --> 00:49:17,000
Marina: "You're concerned about my enjoyment?"

546
00:49:17,000 --> 00:49:23,000
Hiroki: "Yeah. I was so into it, I didn't really think about you... But that's not fair."

547
00:49:23,000 --> 00:49:25,000
Hiroki: "I was... acting selfish."

548
00:49:25,000 --> 00:49:30,000
Marina: "My, my! You really are a sweetheart! How conscientious you are!"

549
00:49:30,000 --> 00:49:35,000
Hiroki: "I don't think I'm very sweet. I behaved like an animal earlier..."

550
00:49:35,000 --> 00:49:45,000
Marina: "Maybe you did, but I quite liked that! I'm fond of men who can take charge... Though it's much appreciated that you care about me so much, fufu~"

551
00:49:45,000 --> 00:49:54,000
Marina: "To answer your earlier concerns... Yes, I enjoyed myself. I haven't had a chance to let off steam like that in a long while!"

552
00:49:54,000 --> 00:49:56,000
Hiroki: "Ah... Thank goodness..."

553
00:49:56,000 --> 00:50:00,000
*Marina's gentle reassurances elicit a small sigh of relief.*

554
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:04,000
*Now that I know she enjoyed herself too, I feel like I can relax.*

555
00:50:04,000 --> 00:50:05,000
Hiroki: "Aaah..."

556
00:50:05,000 --> 00:50:12,000
*I yawn. Sleep washes over me in waves. My eyelids feel very heavy, and it's a struggle to keep my eyes open.*

557
00:50:12,000 --> 00:50:16,000
*I nuzzle my head against Marina's warm lap and close my eyes.*

558
00:50:16,000 --> 00:50:21,000
*My temple's still pounding, but I feel surprisingly at ease with Marina.*

559
00:50:21,000 --> 00:50:28,000
*This might sound weird, given everything we just did, but there's something almost... motherly... about her.*

560
00:50:28,000 --> 00:50:31,000
*I can feel my conscience slipping away...*

561
00:50:31,000 --> 00:50:38,000
*But, as I fall into the land of slumber, I swear I can hear Marina's voice; light and sing-song, as always.*

562
00:50:38,000 --> 00:50:47,000
Marina: "What a charming specimen you are. I was drawn to you by mere curiosity at first, I'll admit, but you've made quite the impression."

563
00:50:47,000 --> 00:50:51,000
Marina: "You're a sweet boy with a surprising amount of stamina..."

564
00:50:51,000 --> 00:50:57,000
Marina: "And your scent is very, very unique. I've never met a human boy quite like you before."

565
00:50:57,000 --> 00:51:04,000
Marina: "Maybe I'll make you mine. I'm sure that will make Ayu jealous! She's always been so possessive..."

566
00:51:04,000 --> 00:51:13,000
Marina: "But don't worry, my cute, precious Hiroki. No matter what happens, I'll always let you rest your weary head on my lap."

567
00:51:13,000 --> 00:51:14,000
Marina: "Fufufu..."

568
00:51:14,000 --> 00:51:23,000
*Laughing softly, Marina bows her head. I can feel her warm breath against my cheek, coupled with the softness of her silver hair.*

569
00:51:23,000 --> 00:51:30,000
*Maybe this is all a dream. It doesn't feel real. Reality's starting to slip from my grasp like melting snow...*

570
00:51:30,000 --> 00:51:38,000
*But I'm sure, as my breathing evens out and my mind drifts away, that I can feel a soft sensation against my lips.*

571
00:51:38,000 --> 00:51:40,000
*Beep beep beep beep...*

572
00:51:40,000 --> 00:51:42,000
Hiroki: "Nn... What...?"

573
00:51:42,000 --> 00:51:48,000
*I'm roused from my slumber the following morning by the shrill beeping of my alarm clock.*

574
00:51:48,000 --> 00:51:54,000
*Its tinny cry burrows into every single crevice of my skull. My temple throbs, and I groan.*

575
00:51:54,000 --> 00:51:56,000
Hiroki: "My head's killing me..."

576
00:51:56,000 --> 00:52:06,000
*Sadly for me, my alarm clock doesn't seem to understand how under the weather I am. It's nothing but a machine, and it's utterly immune to my plight!*

577
00:52:06,000 --> 00:52:07,000
*Beep, beep, beep...*

578
00:52:07,000 --> 00:52:13,000
*The hateful device continues to mock me. I swear, it's getting louder with every beep...*

579
00:52:13,000 --> 00:52:15,000
Hiroki: "Alright! Alright! Enough!"

580
00:52:15,000 --> 00:52:25,000
*I sit up on my futon, the covers bunching about my bare legs, and reach out for the clock. I seize it, then turn it off with a satisfying click.*

581
00:52:25,000 --> 00:52:31,000
*Now that my alarm clock's been silenced, I can finally hear myself think. That God for that!*

582
00:52:31,000 --> 00:52:35,000
Hiroki: "How much did I have to drink last night, anyway...?"

583
00:52:35,000 --> 00:52:42,000
*I press my hand against my temple. It does little to ease the throbbing pain beneath my fingertips.*

584
00:52:42,000 --> 00:52:48,000
Hiroki: "Speaking of last night, what happened? I can't remember. It's all a blur..."

585
00:52:48,000 --> 00:52:52,000
*I think I went to see the famous idol, Ayu, in concert.*

586
00:52:52,000 --> 00:53:00,000
*I didn't see Ayu because I wanted to (her music's not really my thing) - I did it because I had to. It was a job.*

587
00:53:00,000 --> 00:53:08,000
*I brought along my expensive camera equipment, hoping to take a few high quality pics of Ayu's performance, but...*

588
00:53:08,000 --> 00:53:09,000
Hiroki: "Oh God."

589
00:53:09,000 --> 00:53:16,000
*I glance about my bedroom. My clothes are strewn across the floor, my shoulder bag alongside them.*

590
00:53:16,000 --> 00:53:23,000
*I can't remember the precise details of last night, but I do remember tripping and falling on my ass.*

591
00:53:23,000 --> 00:53:29,000
*I hurt my head and my back, and my bag made an alarming crunch as it fell on the sidewalk.*

592
00:53:29,000 --> 00:53:32,000
Hiroki: "My camera... Did I really break it...?"

593
00:53:32,000 --> 00:53:41,000
*I lurch across my room, dragging my futon with me, and claw my way to my bag. I open it up, praying for the best, while expecting the worst.*

594
00:53:41,000 --> 00:53:48,000
*I'd very much like my hazy recollections of last night to be nothing more than a nightmare, but...*

595
00:53:48,000 --> 00:53:49,000
Hiroki: "Damn it!"

596
00:53:49,000 --> 00:53:57,000
*The camera's scuffed and marked, and the lens is cracked all the way down the middle! It's completely inoperable!*

597
00:53:57,000 --> 00:54:05,000
Hiroki: "Alright, Hiroki. Calm down. Maybe the lens is broken, but the camera itself might work. You just need to stay cool..."

598
00:54:05,000 --> 00:54:13,000
*I extricate the heavy camera from my bag with trembling, sausage-like fingers, and reach for the on/off switch.*

599
00:54:13,000 --> 00:54:17,000
*I press it, heart hammering, awaiting a miracle, but...*

600
00:54:17,000 --> 00:54:19,000
Hiroki: "No dice, huh?"

601
00:54:19,000 --> 00:54:24,000
*The camera refuses to turn on. It's given up the ghost completely.*

602
00:54:24,000 --> 00:54:26,000
Hiroki: "Well, that's just peachy."

603
00:54:26,000 --> 00:54:37,000
*Disgusted, I throw the broken camera back into the bag (it's not like I can damage it more than I have already) and fall back against the tatami floor with a thud.*

604
00:54:37,000 --> 00:54:44,000
Hiroki: "And to think... I wanted to be a photojournalist. Now, I'm nothing more than a liability..."

605
00:54:44,000 --> 00:54:52,000
*This morning isn't the most auspicious. I wish I could turn back time, slip beneath my futon, and fall asleep once more.*

606
00:54:52,000 --> 00:54:59,000
*Then, I wouldn't have to contend with the looming fear or losing my job, or this awful headache!*

607
00:54:59,000 --> 00:55:10,000
*At least today's a Sunday. I don't need to go into work until tomorrow. That should give me a bit of time to prepare for the inevitability of losing my job.*

608
00:55:10,000 --> 00:55:12,000
*That is strange, though...*

609
00:55:12,000 --> 00:55:16,000
Hiroki: "If today's a Sunday, why was my alarm clock on?"

610
00:55:16,000 --> 00:55:23,000
*I usually turn my alarm clock off during the weekends (when I don't have jobs to attend to, that is).*

611
00:55:23,000 --> 00:55:32,000
*I have to wake up pretty early to commute to work during the weekday, so on the weekends I like to veg out in my futon until midday.*

612
00:55:32,000 --> 00:55:40,000
*Did I turn my alarm clock on before I went to bed? But why? Did past-me want to torture present-me or something?*

613
00:55:40,000 --> 00:55:43,000
*Do I have a secret sadistic streak or something?*

614
00:55:43,000 --> 00:55:50,000
*...Well. Given I'm the one who set that alarm clock, perhaps it'd be more correct to say "masochistic".*

615
00:55:50,000 --> 00:55:51,000
*Then again...*

616
00:55:51,000 --> 00:55:54,000
Hiroki: "Was I really the one who set that alarm?"

617
00:55:54,000 --> 00:55:58,000
Hiroki: "How did I even get home, anyway? I don't remember."

618
00:55:58,000 --> 00:56:02,000
Hiroki: "After that failed gig, I went out drinking, and then..."

619
00:56:02,000 --> 00:56:05,000
*I strain my brain, struggling to remember...*

620
00:56:05,000 --> 00:56:10,000
*And that's when it hits me, in a sudden burst of intense realization.*

621
00:56:10,000 --> 00:56:16,000
Hiroki: "Wakatsuki Marina! She invited me back to her office! How could I forget that?!"

622
00:56:16,000 --> 00:56:24,000
*I enjoyed myself with the famous businesswoman, Wakatsuki Marina, in an attempt to forget my sorrows. Then, I passed out.*

623
00:56:24,000 --> 00:56:31,000
*How, then, did I end up back in my apartment? I don't get it. Did last night really happen, or...?*

624
00:56:31,000 --> 00:56:38,000
*I look around my room, searching for some kind of clue. Fortunately, it doesn't take me long to spot it.*

625
00:56:38,000 --> 00:56:42,000
*There, lying next to my alarm clock, is an envelope.*

626
00:56:42,000 --> 00:56:43,000
*Is that from Marina?*

627
00:56:43,000 --> 00:56:49,000
*I open the envelope, then slide out a pure, white sheet of paper that reads thus:*

628
00:56:49,000 --> 00:56:50,000
*Dear Hiroki,*

629
00:56:50,000 --> 00:56:58,000
*Thank you for drinking with me last night. I had a very good time! I hope our dalliances proved to be enjoyable for you, too!*

630
00:56:58,000 --> 00:57:13,000
*After you passed out in my office, I asked my chauffeur to drive you back home. I found your address on your business card, which was in your wallet. I hope you can forgive me for looking through something so personal!*

631
00:57:13,000 --> 00:57:25,000
*I asked the chauffeur to set your alarm nice and early, so you don't oversleep. You drank a good deal last night, and I'm afraid you'll doze the day away if given the opportunity!*

632
00:57:25,000 --> 00:57:28,000
*Remember: the early bird catches the worm!*

633
00:57:28,000 --> 00:57:36,000
*You might disagree with me, but I think it's important to wake up in a timely manner! Don't go back to bed, you hear?*

634
00:57:36,000 --> 00:57:46,000
*I've taken quite an interest in you, and I'm going to whip you into shape if it's the last thing I do! Maybe you could look at it as a pet project of mine!*

635
00:57:46,000 --> 00:57:47,000
*Yours, Marina*

636
00:57:47,000 --> 00:58:00,000
*PS: If you're worried about going into work tomorrow, don't be. I have connections, and I'll do all I can to smooth things over. I won't let your boss fire you. You're much too precious!*

637
00:58:00,000 --> 00:58:02,000
Hiroki: "Huh... Well, whaddaya know?"

638
00:58:02,000 --> 00:58:08,000
*I guess I really did meet Wakatsuki Marina last night. It wasn't a weird fever dream after all!*

639
00:58:08,000 --> 00:58:14,000
*I'm not sure what Marina means by her PS, though. Is she going to talk to my boss on my behalf?*

640
00:58:14,000 --> 00:58:23,000
*That'd be nice of her, but I'm not sure if even Wakatsuki Marina would be able to talk my boss over. He's a stubborn old goat.*

641
00:58:23,000 --> 00:58:26,000
*I should prepare for the worst, just to be sure...*

642
00:58:26,000 --> 00:58:30,000
*God. My head's throbbing so much it's hard to think.*

643
00:58:30,000 --> 00:58:35,000
Hiroki: "Sorry, Marina, but I think I'm going to go back to bed after all."

644
00:58:35,000 --> 00:58:40,000
*I shuffle back to my futon and drop inelegantly against the soft covers.*

645
00:58:40,000 --> 00:58:47,000
*This is too much for me to deal with right now. I'm afraid, if I don't get any rest, my brain will explode.*

646
00:58:47,000 --> 00:58:51,000
*My life's starting to feel like something from a TV drama!*

647
00:58:51,000 --> 00:58:59,000
*I just hope whoever's in charge of writing the screenplay of my life will see fit to tone things down a notch come tomorrow.*

648
00:58:59,000 --> 00:59:00,000
*The next day...*

649
00:59:00,000 --> 00:59:01,000
Hiroki: "Safe...!"

650
00:59:01,000 --> 00:59:13,000
*I jump onto the train seconds before the automatic doors close. In my haste, I push a couple of businessmen wielding briefcases to the side, and they tut at me disapprovingly.*

651
00:59:13,000 --> 00:59:15,000
Hiroki: "Sorry! I'm sorry!"

652
00:59:15,000 --> 00:59:25,000
*I apologize to these men, head bowed, as any good youngster should. It's important to remember one's manners, after all - even on a day like this.*

653
00:59:25,000 --> 00:59:37,000
*It's a Monday morning, and the weather is swelteringly hot. I awoke a little after 06:30, had a shower, ate a hurried breakfast, pulled on my clothes, then headed to the train station.*

654
00:59:37,000 --> 00:59:44,000
*I got on my train around 07:30, as per usual, and now I'm ready for my daily hour commute to work.*

655
00:59:44,000 --> 00:59:58,000
*If my calculations are right, I should get to work around 08:30. Though my work day doesn't technically start until 09:00, my boss is a hard ass, and he likes everybody to be present and accounted for far earlier.*

656
00:59:58,000 --> 01:00:08,000
*It'd be nice if I got paid a little extra for coming in half an hour early, and staying behind hours later, but that's not how the world works.*

657
01:00:08,000 --> 01:00:12,000
*My boss isn't just a hard ass. He's also incredibly stingy.*

658
01:00:12,000 --> 01:00:18,000
*If I could find a better job a little closer to home, I'd accept it in a heartbeat...*

659
01:00:18,000 --> 01:00:26,000
*But it's precisely because I can't find a better job than this that I've been stuck at this place for the last three years.*

660
01:00:26,000 --> 01:00:29,000
*It's enough to make a man cry, really.*

661
01:00:29,000 --> 01:00:38,000
*...Well. When my boss learns full the extent of my failures over the last weekend, I might not have to worry about this commute much longer.*

662
01:00:38,000 --> 01:00:51,000
*Marina said she'd put in a good word to my boss, but I don't know how much weight her reassurances will hold. She might be famous, but my boss isn't the sort of person to be swayed by celebrities.*

663
01:00:51,000 --> 01:01:02,000
*The train sways back and forth, rattling down the track. This particular compartment is full to bursting, and I'm being jostled from all sides by grumpy men and women.*

664
01:01:02,000 --> 01:01:10,000
*The train takes a curve, and I slip backwards. I accidentally stand on a businesswoman's foot, and she glowers at me.*

665
01:01:10,000 --> 01:01:12,000
Hiroki: "Sorry! I'm very sorry!"

666
01:01:12,000 --> 01:01:18,000
*I seem to be upsetting everybody today. Talk about losing friends and alienating people.*

667
01:01:18,000 --> 01:01:23,000
*I try to shuffle away from the woman, but there's nowhere else I can really go.*

668
01:01:23,000 --> 01:01:32,000
*There's barely an inch of free space in this miserable compartment, and my side's being poked and jostled with intrusive elbows.*

669
01:01:32,000 --> 01:01:42,000
*It's a hot summer's day, and the inside of this over-crowded train feels like a sauna. I already showered once this morning, but I'm sweating already!*

670
01:01:42,000 --> 01:01:44,000
*I hope I don't smell bad...*

671
01:01:44,000 --> 01:01:54,000
*Time ticks by far too slowly. The train pulls in at a stop, and (mercifully) a few people get off - including the woman whose foot I stepped on.*

672
01:01:54,000 --> 01:01:56,000
*Finally, I can breathe...!*

673
01:01:56,000 --> 01:01:57,000
*But not for long.*

674
01:01:57,000 --> 01:02:06,000
*A new influx of people get on the train, more than making up for those who stepped off. Now, the compartment's even more crowded than ever!*

675
01:02:06,000 --> 01:02:12,000
*I'm hemmed in by the doors, a businessman behind me and a young girl to the front.*

676
01:02:12,000 --> 01:02:19,000
*I can't see the girl's face, but if I had to wager a guess at her age, I'd put her in her early twenties.*

677
01:02:19,000 --> 01:02:28,000
*She isn't wearing a school uniform, which rules out the possibility that she's a high school student. Maybe she attends a local university?*

678
01:02:28,000 --> 01:02:36,000
*Her hair is dyed a crazy shade of blue, and she's wearing a pink jacket coupled with a pair of very, very short shorts.*

679
01:02:36,000 --> 01:02:40,000
*She's pressed against me so intimately I can smell her.*

680
01:02:40,000 --> 01:02:50,000
*She, unlike the other grumpy commuters on this train, smells fresh and sweet, a little like cinnamon. Her hair, in particular, is delectable!*

681
01:02:50,000 --> 01:02:57,000
*Now I'm aware of how good this mystery girl smells, I'm more anxious than ever about what I might smell of.*

682
01:02:57,000 --> 01:03:08,000
*Silly though it is, I'd like to make a good impression on her. I can't see her face, but I'm sure she's cute. Only a cute girl would wear shorts as daringly tiny as hers.*

683
01:03:08,000 --> 01:03:17,000
*I imagine the girl in my head, as I often do during my commutes to work. I mean, it's not like there's anything else I can do.*

684
01:03:17,000 --> 01:03:23,000
*I fashion her with a pair of large eyes, fringed with long lashes, and a button nose.*

685
01:03:23,000 --> 01:03:29,000
*She'll have pursed lips, pink like cherry blossoms, and two sweetly blushing cheeks, and...*

686
01:03:29,000 --> 01:03:30,000
Hiroki: "Aaah..."

687
01:03:30,000 --> 01:03:31,000
*...a nice body.*

688
01:03:31,000 --> 01:03:37,000
*I don't even need to wonder what her body's like, because I can feel it pressed against me.*

689
01:03:37,000 --> 01:03:42,000
*It's possible that this could be an honest mistake on the girl's part, but...*

690
01:03:42,000 --> 01:03:44,000
???: "Nn... Haa, nn..."

691
01:03:44,000 --> 01:03:45,000
???: "Aaah..."

692
01:03:45,000 --> 01:03:46,000
*Now she's moaning!*

693
01:03:46,000 --> 01:03:53,000
*I want to escape before things escalate any further, but that's impossible. The train's too busy!*

694
01:03:53,000 --> 01:03:56,000
*This girl has me trapped, and she must know it.*

695
01:03:56,000 --> 01:03:59,000
*How am I gonna wiggle out of this one?!*

696
01:03:59,000 --> 01:04:00,000
Hiroki: "H-Hey, um..."

697
01:04:00,000 --> 01:04:05,000
*I draw closer to the girl (a risky move, I know) and bring my lips to her ear.*

698
01:04:05,000 --> 01:04:09,000
Hiroki: "You might not be aware of this, but you... um..."

699
01:04:09,000 --> 01:04:10,000
*I swallow.*

700
01:04:10,000 --> 01:04:13,000
Hiroki: "You're kind of... pressing against me..."

701
01:04:13,000 --> 01:04:22,000
*I hope that this is some sort of misunderstanding. With a bit of luck, the girl will squeak in alarm and back away, her face burning.*

702
01:04:22,000 --> 01:04:28,000
*I'd like to resolve this problem peacefully, without disturbing the people around us, but...*

703
01:04:28,000 --> 01:04:29,000
???: "I know."

704
01:04:29,000 --> 01:04:34,000
*The girl replies swiftly, with nary a trace of embarrassment in her tone.*

705
01:04:34,000 --> 01:04:37,000
Hiroki: "You... Wh-What do you mean, you know?"

706
01:04:37,000 --> 01:04:39,000
???: "I know... what I'm doing."

707
01:04:39,000 --> 01:04:42,000
Hiroki: "Y-You do? Then why don't you stop?!"

708
01:04:42,000 --> 01:04:45,000
???: "I don't want to. This is too much fun."

709
01:04:45,000 --> 01:04:51,000
Hiroki: "Th-This might be fun for you, making me squirm, but this is a real problem for me!"

710
01:04:51,000 --> 01:04:54,000
???: "It's a problem? You don't like it?"

711
01:04:54,000 --> 01:04:57,000
*I'm afraid I like it a bit too much!":

712
01:04:57,000 --> 01:05:01,000
Hiroki: "N-No, that's not it! I like it more than I should!"

713
01:05:01,000 --> 01:05:05,000
Hiroki: "If this keeps going, we'll both be in trouble!"

714
01:05:05,000 --> 01:05:06,000
???: "Really?"

715
01:05:06,000 --> 01:05:09,000
Hiroki: "Yes, really! This is dangerous, so-"

716
01:05:09,000 --> 01:05:11,000
???: "...I don't get it."

717
01:05:11,000 --> 01:05:16,000
???: "If you like it, we should keep going. I want to make you happy."

718
01:05:16,000 --> 01:05:22,000
*Aaargh! I'm not getting through to her at all! In fact, I think I might've made things worse!*

719
01:05:22,000 --> 01:05:25,000
*You're a total stranger! I don't know you!":

720
01:05:25,000 --> 01:05:31,000
Hiroki: "It's not a question of whether I like it or not! You're a total stranger!"

721
01:05:31,000 --> 01:05:38,000
Hiroki: "We shouldn't be doing something like this - particularly not in public! It'll bother everyone!"

722
01:05:38,000 --> 01:05:41,000
???: "It will, if you raise your voice like that..."

723
01:05:41,000 --> 01:05:44,000
???: "But, if you're quiet, it should be fine."

724
01:05:44,000 --> 01:05:46,000
???: "Let's keep going."

725
01:05:46,000 --> 01:05:48,000
Hiroki: "N-No, I just said-"

726
01:05:48,000 --> 01:05:52,000
???: "I heard what you said... but I don't think you meant it."

727
01:05:52,000 --> 01:05:57,000
???: "You must like me at least a little, or you wouldn't be breathing so hard."

728
01:05:57,000 --> 01:06:00,000
*...Crap. I was afraid she'd noticed that.*

729
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
*Well. I guess it was hard for her not to, given how close my body is pressed against hers.*

730
01:06:06,000 --> 01:06:08,000
*Is there really no way out of this?*

731
01:06:08,000 --> 01:06:15,000
*Is this girl going to railroad me (ha, ha) onto this path of degenerecy no matter what I do or say?!*

732
01:06:15,000 --> 01:06:19,000
???: "Marina wasn't joking. You smell incredibly good."

733
01:06:19,000 --> 01:06:22,000
???: "I just want to be close to you... Hiroki."

734
01:06:22,000 --> 01:06:24,000
Hiroki: "Haa, haa, haa..."

735
01:06:24,000 --> 01:06:29,000
*I make my way to work, the soles of my shoes slapping against the sidewalk.*

736
01:06:29,000 --> 01:06:36,000
*After the little "incident" on the train, I felt obliged to get off a few stops earlier than usual.*

737
01:06:36,000 --> 01:06:47,000
*I couldn't bring myself to stay on that train, surrounded by all those good men and women, after everything I'd done. It would've been way too embarrassing.*

738
01:06:47,000 --> 01:06:51,000
*I gasp for air as I wend my way through Tokyo's busy streets.*

739
01:06:51,000 --> 01:07:01,000
*Men and women in business attire throng about me, and veritable armies of high school students in their crisp, white uniforms chat and giggle excitably.*

740
01:07:01,000 --> 01:07:13,000
*They all look so young and carefree: the girls with their plaited hair and blue plaid skirts, the boys with their sports bags slung over their shoulders and their scuffed black shoes...*

741
01:07:13,000 --> 01:07:18,000
*What I wouldn't give to be a teen again. They don't know how easy they have it!*

742
01:07:18,000 --> 01:07:31,000
*My encounter with that mysterious girl on the train might've taken my mind off things for a few minutes (did our liaison truly finish so fast?), but now doubts are starting to catch up with me.*

743
01:07:31,000 --> 01:07:35,000
*It doesn't matter how quickly I walk. I can't outstrip my fears.*

744
01:07:35,000 --> 01:07:39,000
*What am I gonna do when I see my boss? What is he going to say?*

745
01:07:39,000 --> 01:07:42,000
*My head might as well be on a chopping block!*

746
01:07:42,000 --> 01:07:49,000
*This day's shaping up to be a crazy one, and it's not even 09:00 yet. I've only been awake a handful of hours!*

747
01:07:49,000 --> 01:07:54,000
*Maybe, when I get to work, I'll find my boss has transformed into a cute girl!*

748
01:07:54,000 --> 01:07:57,000
*That's... quite a disturbing thought, actually...*

749
01:07:57,000 --> 01:08:01,000
*You know what? Let's not pursue this train of thought any longer.*

750
01:08:01,000 --> 01:08:02,000
*Really, though...*

751
01:08:02,000 --> 01:08:11,000
*If I get to work and find my garrulous, ill-tempered boss has transformed into a cute girl overnight, I wouldn't even be surprised.*

752
01:08:11,000 --> 01:08:16,000
*At this point, it'd be just one more drop in the ever-expanding ocean.*

753
01:08:16,000 --> 01:08:20,000
*But, to my relief (though not, necessarily, surprise)...*

754
01:08:20,000 --> 01:08:24,000
Boss: "Ogasawara! What do you have to say for yourself, hmm?!"

755
01:08:24,000 --> 01:08:25,000
Hiroki: "Oh... Uh..."

756
01:08:25,000 --> 01:08:28,000
*My boss has not turned into a cute girl after all.*

757
01:08:28,000 --> 01:08:32,000
*He looks just as ill-tempered as always, if not more.*

758
01:08:32,000 --> 01:08:40,000
*I've only just arrived in the office. I've yet to set down my bag and sit at my desk, but he's already giving me an earful.*

759
01:08:40,000 --> 01:08:44,000
*He careened into the office the moment he heard me open the door.*

760
01:08:44,000 --> 01:08:52,000
*He must've been waiting for me to make my grand entrance, like a fan eagerly awaiting the beginning of an Ayu-Ayu concert...*

761
01:08:52,000 --> 01:09:03,000
*But, unlike Ayu's loyal contingent of fans, my boss isn't holding a glow stick or wearing a shirt with my face on it. If he was, I'd be pretty freaked out, NGL.*

762
01:09:03,000 --> 01:09:08,000
*Instead, he's holding a cup of coffee in one hand a scowl upon his face.*

763
01:09:08,000 --> 01:09:18,000
*Judging by his expression, and the way he's shaking (he'll spill that coffee if he's not careful), he's preparing himself for the mother of all rants.*

764
01:09:18,000 --> 01:09:19,000
*I am so busted.*

765
01:09:19,000 --> 01:09:27,000
Boss: "Well? Don't just stand there going "oh", you gormless cretinl! You know what you've done! Where is my apology?"

766
01:09:27,000 --> 01:09:30,000
Hiroki: "Oh, uh... I-I'm sorry, Boss..."

767
01:09:30,000 --> 01:09:33,000
Boss: "Sorry won't cut it, and you know that!"

768
01:09:33,000 --> 01:09:37,000
*Then why did you ask me to apologize in the first place?!*

769
01:09:37,000 --> 01:09:45,000
*That's what I'd like to say... but I know, given the circumstances, it'd be better not to infuriate him further.*

770
01:09:45,000 --> 01:09:55,000
*My boss has never hit anybody before (though, secretly, I think he'd quite like to), but the steaming cup of coffee in his hands is quite concerning.*

771
01:09:55,000 --> 01:10:02,000
*It would be very, very easy for him to "accidentally" slip, in his rage, and pour it all down my front...*

772
01:10:02,000 --> 01:10:11,000
Boss: "I asked you to get some photos of Ayu for an upcoming news piece and you've buggered it all up! Where are my photos, huh?!"

773
01:10:11,000 --> 01:10:17,000
Hiroki: "I, um... I'm sorry. There were a few technical issues. The trains were delayed and-"

774
01:10:17,000 --> 01:10:19,000
Boss: "That's no excuse!"

775
01:10:19,000 --> 01:10:29,000
Boss: "As a photographer - no, as an employee - it's your duty to see to it that you accomplish all of your jobs, regardless of the external circumstances!"

776
01:10:29,000 --> 01:10:36,000
Boss: "So the trains were delayed? So what? You should've used your head! Why didn't you hire a taxi?!"

777
01:10:36,000 --> 01:10:42,000
Hiroki: "It was too late for that. The train broke down. I got on it in time, but-"

778
01:10:42,000 --> 01:10:43,000
Boss: "But nothing!"

779
01:10:43,000 --> 01:10:53,000
*The boss slams his cup of coffee down on my desk. A few brown droplets of scalding drink fly over the rim of the cup and spatter on a stack of documents.*

780
01:10:53,000 --> 01:10:56,000
*I guess I'm gonna have to clean that up later...*

781
01:10:56,000 --> 01:11:00,000
*That is, if this desk is still mine by the end of the morning.*

782
01:11:00,000 --> 01:11:05,000
*The more my boss rants and raves, the more unlikely that's beginning to look.*

783
01:11:05,000 --> 01:11:12,000
*A few of my work colleagues have been alerted by the noise, because they're peeking at us curiously.*

784
01:11:12,000 --> 01:11:19,000
*One of my workmates gives me a sympathetic smile, while another looks coldly amused by my plight.*

785
01:11:19,000 --> 01:11:22,000
*I guess it's alright for them. Lucky so-and-sos...*

786
01:11:22,000 --> 01:11:29,000
Boss: "I've had it up to here with you, Ogasawara! I have no need for an employee who can't do his job!"

787
01:11:29,000 --> 01:11:36,000
Boss: "You're a failure - and, to cap it all off, you broke an expensive piece of company equipment!"

788
01:11:36,000 --> 01:11:37,000
Hiroki: "Ah..."

789
01:11:37,000 --> 01:11:38,000
*I stare at my boss.*

790
01:11:38,000 --> 01:11:49,000
*He could've deduced my failure to take any pics of Ayu, given my failure to upload them to the cloud over the weekend, but how does he know about the camera?*

791
01:11:49,000 --> 01:11:51,000
*I haven't told him about that yet.*

792
01:11:51,000 --> 01:12:01,000
*I was saving that bit of news 'til last. I thought it'd be a nice way to cap off this awful morning: the cherry on top of the shit sundae, if you please.*

793
01:12:01,000 --> 01:12:05,000
*Somebody must've told him about that camera already... but who?*

794
01:12:05,000 --> 01:12:10,000
*Was it Marina? Did she really call my boss up and beg for his pardon?*

795
01:12:10,000 --> 01:12:16,000
*If so, I commend her efforts, but my boss doesn't look at all moved by her pleas.*

796
01:12:16,000 --> 01:12:24,000
*His face is getting redder by the second. I'm afraid he's going to explode, like an overinflated weather balloon!*

797
01:12:24,000 --> 01:12:32,000
Boss: "When I heard that, I just about hit the roof! How could you be so careless? That camera is worth more than your life!"

798
01:12:32,000 --> 01:12:39,000
Boss: "Our deadlines have all been pushed back because of your carelessness! How do you feel about that, huh?"

799
01:12:39,000 --> 01:12:40,000
Hiroki: "I, um..."

800
01:12:40,000 --> 01:12:43,000
*I look at my feet, my voice dropping to a whisper.*

801
01:12:43,000 --> 01:12:45,000
Hiroki: "I... am very sorry, sir."

802
01:12:45,000 --> 01:12:47,000
Boss: "What did you say?"

803
01:12:47,000 --> 01:12:50,000
*My boss leans in, cupping his ear with his hand.*

804
01:12:50,000 --> 01:12:53,000
Boss: "Speak up, boy! I can't hear you!"

805
01:12:53,000 --> 01:12:55,000
Hiroki: "I said... Um..."

806
01:12:55,000 --> 01:13:02,000
*Even more of my colleagues are watching me now. They're not even trying to hide their amusement.*

807
01:13:02,000 --> 01:13:05,000
*I bet they're all laughing at my expense.*

808
01:13:05,000 --> 01:13:07,000
*People can be so cruel!*

809
01:13:07,000 --> 01:13:13,000
Hiroki: "I... I-I'm very sorry, sir. Really, I am. I know my behavior was inexcusable-"

810
01:13:13,000 --> 01:13:25,000
Boss: "Indeed, it was! Not only did you make a hash of a simple job, but you also destroyed a piece of company equipment! I should have you fired for that, at the very least..."

811
01:13:25,000 --> 01:13:27,000
Boss: "But I'm a lenient man."

812
01:13:27,000 --> 01:13:32,000
Hiroki: "Yes, Boss, you're right. I'll have my desk cleared out right away, and-"

813
01:13:32,000 --> 01:13:34,000
Hiroki: "W-Wait, what...?!"

814
01:13:34,000 --> 01:13:36,000
Boss: "You heard what I said."

815
01:13:36,000 --> 01:13:39,000
*My boss folds his arms, his expression sullen.*

816
01:13:39,000 --> 01:13:52,000
Boss: "You've worked at this company for three years. During this time, you've been a model employee. It's rare that I've had cause to get on your case - unlike various other people in this room..."

817
01:13:52,000 --> 01:14:00,000
*My boss shoots a pointed glance at a few of my other co-workers, who're still listening in to my (supposed) dressing-down.*

818
01:14:00,000 --> 01:14:06,000
*Now that they've realized most've the drama has passed, they seem to have lost interest.*

819
01:14:06,000 --> 01:14:14,000
*A couple of them blush, suitably chastised, as they return to their work, while a few others pout and click their tongues.*

820
01:14:14,000 --> 01:14:17,000
*Did they want me to be out of a job?*

821
01:14:17,000 --> 01:14:19,000
*This office is full of vultures!*

822
01:14:19,000 --> 01:14:29,000
Boss: "In general, I have no real complaints with you. Last Saturday was an unfortunate blip, shall we say, in your otherwise spotless performance."

823
01:14:29,000 --> 01:14:40,000
Boss: "If you were a newbie, I'd be inclined to fire you over this... but I don't want to cast one of my valued employees out into the cold over a couple of mishaps."

824
01:14:40,000 --> 01:14:43,000
Hiroki: "Then... D-Does that mean...?"

825
01:14:43,000 --> 01:14:52,000
Boss: "Yes, indeed. I'm giving you another chance, Ogasawara - but you're on thin ice. Don't betray my trust again, or you'll be sorry!"

826
01:14:52,000 --> 01:15:03,000
Boss: "I don't like being made a fool out of. I'm going to work you to the bone! Be prepared to put in the hours to make up for your atrocious blunder! Do you hear me?"

827
01:15:03,000 --> 01:15:06,000
Hiroki: "Oh, sir...! Yes, sir! Thank you very much!"

828
01:15:06,000 --> 01:15:11,000
*I bow deeply to my boss, cringing at my own superciliousness all the while.*

829
01:15:11,000 --> 01:15:18,000
*Only a few seconds ago, I was insulting this guy in my head and calling him an asshole! I'm so two-faced...*

830
01:15:18,000 --> 01:15:22,000
*Maybe my boss isn't quite as horrid as I thought...*

831
01:15:22,000 --> 01:15:30,000
*But he's still a businessman, at the end of the day, and I doubt he'd make this call if he didn't have ulterior motives.*

832
01:15:30,000 --> 01:15:31,000
*Now I'm curious...*

833
01:15:31,000 --> 01:15:38,000
Hiroki: "What's going to happen about the camera? Will the cost of replacing it be taken from my own wages?"

834
01:15:38,000 --> 01:15:42,000
Boss: "Ah. About that camera. It's a funny story, that."

835
01:15:42,000 --> 01:15:45,000
*The boss massages his quivering chin in thought.*

836
01:15:45,000 --> 01:15:53,000
Boss: "That would be standard company policy, yes... But you can rejoice, Ogasawara. You must have a guardian angel."

837
01:15:53,000 --> 01:15:55,000
Hiroki: "An angel, sir...?"

838
01:15:55,000 --> 01:16:03,000
Boss: "Indeed. She called the office this morning, when I got in for work, and she explained the whole sorry affair to me."

839
01:16:03,000 --> 01:16:10,000
Boss: "At first, I was incredulous. I thought it was some kind of prank, but she was very persuasive."

840
01:16:10,000 --> 01:16:11,000
Boss: "Still..."

841
01:16:11,000 --> 01:16:13,000
*My boss shakes his head, bemused.*

842
01:16:13,000 --> 01:16:22,000
Boss: "I can't believe that you know Wakatsuki Marina! For such a plain, unassuming man, you've got a surprising amount of connections!"

843
01:16:22,000 --> 01:16:26,000
*Aaah. So Marina really did call my boss! That wasn't just talk!*

844
01:16:26,000 --> 01:16:36,000
*I don't know Marina all that well, but she's already done a lot for me. I have to wonder what she sees in me, and how I'm going to repay her.*

845
01:16:36,000 --> 01:16:42,000
Boss: "How'd you get into her good graces, hmm? The two of your childhood friends?"

846
01:16:42,000 --> 01:16:45,000
Hiroki: "Oh, no. I've only known her a day..."

847
01:16:45,000 --> 01:16:46,000
Boss: "Really?"

848
01:16:46,000 --> 01:16:47,000
*My boss snorts.*

849
01:16:47,000 --> 01:16:54,000
Boss: "Well, you must've made quite the impression! She offered to pay for the equipment you damaged in full."

850
01:16:54,000 --> 01:17:00,000
Boss: "She wired the money over to the company bank account shortly after our phone call."

851
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:11,000
Boss: "She also told me that she's familiar with Ikue Ayu. She offered to set up a private meeting between you and her, so you can take photographs of her uninterrupted."

852
01:17:11,000 --> 01:17:13,000
Boss: "What do you think about that?"

853
01:17:13,000 --> 01:17:14,000
Hiroki: "Ah..."

854
01:17:14,000 --> 01:17:23,000
*Once more, words fail me. I stare at my boss in silent, slack-jawed surprise, unable to articulate more than a handful of broken syllables.*

855
01:17:23,000 --> 01:17:25,000
Hiroki: "You... I mean, um..."

856
01:17:25,000 --> 01:17:27,000
*I clear my throat, then try again.*

857
01:17:27,000 --> 01:17:30,000
Hiroki: "Is the date of this meeting fixed?"

858
01:17:30,000 --> 01:17:38,000
Boss: "Yes, indeed. Miss Wakatsuki put me through to Miss Ikue's agency, and they were only too happy to oblige."

859
01:17:38,000 --> 01:17:50,000
Boss: "You'll be seeing Miss Ikue this weekend, alone, on her private beach in Okinawa. We'll fly you out there, of course. Miss Wakatsuki very kindly offered to foot the bill."

860
01:17:50,000 --> 01:17:56,000
Boss: "I'll mail the full details over to you later, but that's about the gist of things."

861
01:17:56,000 --> 01:18:09,000
Boss: "You've been given an amazing opportunity, so don't screw this up. You have a chance to take as many photos of Miss Ikue as you want - and, while you're at it, you might as well interview her."

862
01:18:09,000 --> 01:18:11,000
Boss: "This could be your big break."

863
01:18:11,000 --> 01:18:15,000
Boss: "Give it your all! I won't accept anything less than 110%%!"

864
01:18:15,000 --> 01:18:17,000
Hiroki: "Y-Yes, sir! Of course, sir!"

865
01:18:17,000 --> 01:18:24,000
*I bow and scrape to my boss anew, amazed by the wealth of possibilities that've landed on my lap.*

866
01:18:24,000 --> 01:18:29,000
*I'm going to see Ayu again this weekend, on a private beach in Okinawa, no less!*

867
01:18:29,000 --> 01:18:37,000
*As a mere member of the hoi polloi, I've never been to a private beach before. I'm starting to feel like a celeb myself!*

868
01:18:37,000 --> 01:18:47,000
*Marina really has come through for me. Not only did she pay for the camera I smashed, but she's managed to fix up a meeting between Ayu and I!*

869
01:18:47,000 --> 01:18:57,000
*My boss was right (for once). Marina really is like a guardian angel! She's a dark-skinned, fair-haired angel, and I owe her, if not my life, then my job!*

870
01:18:57,000 --> 01:19:02,000
*My immediate future has been secured... but I can't afford to get complacent.*

871
01:19:02,000 --> 01:19:05,000
*There's still my meeting with Ayu to contend with.*

872
01:19:05,000 --> 01:19:10,000
*If I'm going to impress both Marina and my boss, I need to do my best.*

873
01:19:10,000 --> 01:19:16,000
*Now I've been saddled with all these responsibilities, I don't want to let anybody down!*

874
01:19:16,000 --> 01:19:24,000
*The rest of the day goes by in a blur. I'm still reeling after my conversation with my boss, and nothing feels quite real.*

875
01:19:24,000 --> 01:19:34,000
*Thanks to my failure on Saturday, we have to scramble to put together a new article in lieu of the one about Ayu (that'll be suspended until next week).*

876
01:19:34,000 --> 01:19:39,000
*I end up working overtime, and it's dark when I finally leave the office.*

877
01:19:39,000 --> 01:19:42,000
Hiroki: "Geez... My boss is such a slave driver..."

878
01:19:42,000 --> 01:19:48,000
Hiroki: "You'd think he'd be a bit more considerate, given my connections with the noveau riche."

879
01:19:48,000 --> 01:19:52,000
Hiroki: "I've barely had a chance to sit down all day..."

880
01:19:52,000 --> 01:19:56,000
*Yawning, I check my phone. It's a little after 21:00.*

881
01:19:56,000 --> 01:20:00,000
Hiroki: "Urgh... I should've been at home hours ago."

882
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:08,000
*Oh well. I might be tired now, but my job's secure, and I have my weekend retreat in Okinawa to look forward to.*

883
01:20:08,000 --> 01:20:15,000
*With a bit of luck, things'll work out alright, and I'll get a bevy of photos that'll please my boss.*

884
01:20:15,000 --> 01:20:18,000
*That should put me in his good books.*

885
01:20:18,000 --> 01:20:23,000
*Maybe he'll even let me go home on time for a change! That would be a treat...*

886
01:20:23,000 --> 01:20:29,000
*For the present, however, I'm absolutely gagging for a drink. That might help soothe my nerves.*

887
01:20:29,000 --> 01:20:37,000
*With this thought in mind, I board the train for a few stops. Then, I head to the same bar where I first met Marina.*

888
01:20:37,000 --> 01:20:44,000
*While it's true I want something to drink, part of me is hoping I'll run into my benefactress once more...*

889
01:20:44,000 --> 01:20:47,000
*And, fortunately, for me, luck is on my side.*

890
01:20:47,000 --> 01:20:55,000
*Marina is sitting at the bar, one toned leg crossed over the other, just like it was during our first encounter.*

891
01:20:55,000 --> 01:21:00,000
*Her fair hair falls over her shoulders, and she nurses a glass in one hand.*

892
01:21:00,000 --> 01:21:04,000
*When she sees me, she smiles, and she waves me over.*

893
01:21:04,000 --> 01:21:09,000
Marina: "Why, hello, handsome. Fancy seeing you here! It's a small world!"

894
01:21:09,000 --> 01:21:15,000
Hiroki: "It's just a coincidence. I felt like dropping by on the way home from work."

895
01:21:15,000 --> 01:21:16,000
Marina: "Really?"

896
01:21:16,000 --> 01:21:20,000
*Marina inclines her head, a knowing smile playing about her lips.*

897
01:21:20,000 --> 01:21:29,000
Marina: "That's funny. I was under the impression that your workplace was a good half hour away, on the other side of the Sumida river."

898
01:21:29,000 --> 01:21:35,000
Marina: "Surely there are bars closer by you could frequent, if alcohol's all you want?"

899
01:21:35,000 --> 01:21:42,000
Hiroki: "I-I... had business to attend to on this side of the city. That's all. Don't read too much into it."

900
01:21:42,000 --> 01:21:44,000
Marina: "If you say so, dear!"

901
01:21:44,000 --> 01:21:52,000
*Marina laughs carelessly. I can tell by her tone she doesn't believe a word I'm saying - not that that's very surprising.*

902
01:21:52,000 --> 01:21:55,000
*I don't believe a word I'm saying, either.*

903
01:21:55,000 --> 01:21:57,000
*I'm such a terrible liar...*

904
01:21:57,000 --> 01:22:08,000
*Why can't I tell Marina I was looking for her? I appreciate everything she did for me, and I want to thank her - truly, I do. She really did save my neck...*

905
01:22:08,000 --> 01:22:14,000
*But admitting that aloud, particularly in a crowded bar like this, would be embarrassing.*

906
01:22:14,000 --> 01:22:19,000
*God. I'm so stubborn. I went out of my way to find her, but now I'm clamming up!*

907
01:22:19,000 --> 01:22:21,000
*I'm acting just like a little kid!*

908
01:22:21,000 --> 01:22:31,000
*Maybe Marina can read my thoughts (it hasn't been the first time I've pondered this), because she rests a hand against my own and says softly...*

909
01:22:31,000 --> 01:22:37,000
Marina: "It's alright, Hiroki. You don't need to tell me why you came here. I can tell."

910
01:22:37,000 --> 01:22:39,000
Hiroki: "A-Am I that easy to read?"

911
01:22:39,000 --> 01:22:43,000
Marina: "Yes, indeed! Most men are. Don't take it too personally."

912
01:22:43,000 --> 01:22:44,000
*Marina titters.*

913
01:22:44,000 --> 01:22:48,000
Marina: "You don't need to thank me for helping you."

914
01:22:48,000 --> 01:22:57,000
*Which is just as well, given the words "thank you" have yet to cross my lips. Maybe I need to lube my throat up with alcohol first?*

915
01:22:57,000 --> 01:23:04,000
Marina: "I helped you because I wanted to. You're a very interesting man, and I am awfully fond of you."

916
01:23:04,000 --> 01:23:15,000
Marina: "Talking your boss around was easy enough. He's full of bluster, but it's all an act. His obstreperousness melted away with a few choice words from yours truly!"

917
01:23:15,000 --> 01:23:19,000
Hiroki: "You did more than whisper sweet nothings in his ear."

918
01:23:19,000 --> 01:23:28,000
Hiroki: "He told me you gifted a sizeable chunk of money to our company - and you set up a private meeting between myself and Ayu."

919
01:23:28,000 --> 01:23:30,000
Marina: "Well, what can I say?"

920
01:23:30,000 --> 01:23:31,000
*Marina shrugs.*

921
01:23:31,000 --> 01:23:36,000
Marina: "I have wealth and connections. It would be a shame not to use them."

922
01:23:36,000 --> 01:23:43,000
