950
01:26:13,000 --> 01:26:19,000
Hiroki: "A-Alright then. We can go back to your office, if that's what you want..."

951
01:26:19,000 --> 01:26:22,000
Hiroki: "I... guess I wouldn't mind, either. Um..."

952
01:26:22,000 --> 01:26:32,000
Hiroki: "I know I can be awkward. I'm not used to people doing favors for me. My parents were pretty strict, so I got used to working things out on my own."

953
