Hiroki: "I'm still not used to relying on others... so, I find it hard to accept people's help. I'm bad at thanking people, too. It's hard to find the right words..."

954
01:26:43,000 --> 01:26:49,000
Hiroki: "But I really do appreciate everything you've done, Marina. I think you're wonderful."

955
