956
01:26:52,000 --> 01:26:57,000
*Marina laughs, her voice sultry, and pushes her bust against my arm.*

957
01:26:57,000 --> 01:27:04,000
Marina: "Thank you for trusting me with a bit of your backstory, Hiroki. I promise I'll take good care of you."

958
01:27:04,000 --> 01:27:07,000
Marina: "You're special, like nobody else..."

959
