Hiroki: "Before last Saturday, I seemed to repel women! My life's done a total 180, and I have no idea what's going on! It's all too much to be a coincidence!"

1016
01:31:37,000 --> 01:31:44,000
Marina: "Hehe. You're working yourself up into quite a lather, dear. Don't let it get to you too much."

1017
