1020
01:32:00,000 --> 01:32:08,000
Marina: "At first, I intended to keep quiet about all this... but I'm awfully fond of you, and I hate to see you squirm so!"

1021
01:32:08,000 --> 01:32:14,000
Marina: "You've been a very, very good boy, so I can let you in on a little secret."

1022
