1047
01:34:39,000 --> 01:34:47,000
Marina: "That being the case, it's my job to show proof of my claims. Then, you won't be able to deny what I really am."

1048
01:34:47,000 --> 01:34:54,000
Marina: "I would never normally show my real form to anybody, but you're special. I like you a lot, Hiroki..."

1049
01:34:54,000 --> 01:34:58,000
