1062
01:36:06,000 --> 01:36:09,000
Hiroki: "This is... really incredible..."

1063
01:36:09,000 --> 01:36:14,000
Hiroki: "Y-You say that the world is full of succubi, just like you?"

1064
01:36:14,000 --> 01:36:29,000
Marina: "Yes, indeed. We've been living amongst humans since the dawn of time. Many of society's most famous, revered women have been succubi - like Cleopatra, for instance. It's a wonder how few people know about it, really!"

1065
01:36:29,000 --> 01:36:37,000
*Marina's fingers sink into the full mounds of her chest. She manipulates her breasts about her tail, grinning all the while.*

1066
01:36:37,000 --> 01:36:47,000
