01:37:03,000 --> 01:37:17,000
Marina: "We succubi don't need to do such things to sustain ourselves, but we do need to be revered. That's why so many of us are in positions of power - be it in business, politics, or the entertainment industry."

1070
01:37:17,000 --> 01:37:29,000
Marina: "We need to be loved and adored. If we're not, we'll lose all our magical powers. We'll lose our good looks, we'll start to age like humans do, and then we'll wither away."

1071
01:37:29,000 --> 01:37:43,000
Marina: "We succubi work long and hard to keep you humans in our thrall. That's why I've sacrificed so much for my business. It's why Ayu pushes herself to be Japan's number one idol, and it's why Cosmos..."

