1100
01:40:43,000 --> 01:40:50,000
Marina: "I've only known you a few days, but I'm incredibly fond of you. I want to make you mine..."

1101
01:40:50,000 --> 01:40:52,000
Marina: "But therein lies a problem."

1102
01:40:52,000 --> 01:40:59,000
Marina: "My sisters must have heard me talking about you with Ayu. They're awful gossips, really!"

1103
01:40:59,000 --> 01:41:07,000
Marina: "Whenever I find a handsome boy to play with, they try to steal him away from me. It's like a sort of game."

1104
01:41:07,000 --> 01:41:18,000
Marina: "It seems like Cosmos has already found you, and I doubt she'll be the last. My sisters will all start coming after you, desperate to claim your heart."

1105
01:41:18,000 --> 01:41:26,000
Marina: "I hope that you have enough stamina to handle all of us! As a succubus, I don't mind sharing my conquests..."

1106
01:41:26,000 --> 01:41:32,000
Marina: "But fielding off the advances of numerous succubi might just be enough to break you!"

1107
01:41:32,000 --> 01:41:41,000
Marina: "You have an unusual amount of stamina... but you're still a human, at the end of the day, and you're far more fragile than you look."

1108
01:41:41,000 --> 01:41:51,000
Marina: "If my sisters get too rowdy, I'll try to discipline them. I don't want them to break you completely... but you'll need to toughen up, too!"

1109
01:41:51,000 --> 01:42:02,000
Marina: "Please don't let me down, my dear Hiroki. I've expended a lot of time and money on you already, so it would be a shame if you fell apart too quickly! Fufufu~"

1110
01:42:02,000 --> 01:42:04,000
*Beep beep beep beep...*

1111
01:42:04,000 --> 01:42:06,000
Hiroki: "Nn... What...?"

1112
01:42:06,000 --> 01:42:14,000
*I'm woken the next day by the shrill beeping of my alarm clock. Its tinny ring pierces my skull like a skewer, and I wince.*

1113
01:42:14,000 --> 01:42:19,000
Hiroki: "God... Would it kill you to be quiet for, like, five seconds?"

1114
01:42:19,000 --> 01:42:26,000
*My alarm clock, of course, doesn't listen to me. It's an inorganic object that can't think or feel.*

1115
01:42:26,000 --> 01:42:34,000
*Sometimes, I wish I was an inorganic object, too. Then I wouldn't have to suffer from so many debilitating headaches.*

1116
01:42:34,000 --> 01:42:38,000
Hiroki: "I must've had too much to drink yesterday..."

1117
01:42:38,000 --> 01:42:40,000
Hiroki: "What happened again?"

1118
01:42:40,000 --> 01:42:45,000
*The events of last night return to my befuddled mind in drips and drabs, but...*

1119
01:42:45,000 --> 01:42:47,000
*Beep beep beep beep...*

1120
01:42:47,000 --> 01:42:51,000
*My alarm clock's still trilling away, as insistent as ever.*

1121
01:42:51,000 --> 01:42:55,000
*It's so loud it's starting to set my teeth on edge.*

1122
01:42:55,000 --> 01:43:01,000
*I guess I can't ignore it any longer. Not if I want to cling to what remains of my sanity.*

1123
01:43:01,000 --> 01:43:05,000
Hiroki: "Alright, alright! I'm coming! Shut up already!"

1124
01:43:05,000 --> 01:43:16,000
*I haul myself from my futon and seize my clock, as I have every day for the last three years. I turn it off, cutting short its incessant clangor, then sigh in relief.*

1125
01:43:16,000 --> 01:43:18,000
*Finally. Peace and quiet!*

1126
01:43:18,000 --> 01:43:22,000
*Now, I can think about last night a little more clearly.*

1127
01:43:22,000 --> 01:43:32,000
*Work got out late. I remember that much. Then, as I meandered to the train station, I was struck with the sudden desire to have a stiff drink...*

1128
01:43:32,000 --> 01:43:35,000
*And, what's more, the sudden desire to see Marina.*

1129
01:43:35,000 --> 01:43:47,000
*I traveled across Tokyo to that classy bar where I first met Marina. I hadn't seriously expected to see her again, but Lady Luck must've been on my side, 'cause there she was.*

1130
01:43:47,000 --> 01:43:54,000
*We talked for a little, and drank rather more than a little. Then, she invited me back to her office.*

1131
01:43:54,000 --> 01:43:57,000
*We spent a long time together, and then...*

1132
01:43:57,000 --> 01:43:58,000
Hiroki: "Nn..."

1133
01:43:58,000 --> 01:44:06,000
*Though my alarm clock's been silenced, my forehead still throbs. I press a hand to my temple, my teeth worrying my lower lip.*

1134
01:44:06,000 --> 01:44:10,000
*Images flash through my mind, all of them equally improbable.*

1135
01:44:10,000 --> 01:44:12,000
*Horns. Wings. A tail.*

1136
01:44:12,000 --> 01:44:23,000
*Marina isn't a human. She's a succubus. She sustains herself through the strength of human adoration, and her physical stamina is far greater than any average woman's.*

1137
01:44:23,000 --> 01:44:37,000
*Marina's not the only succubus in Tokyo, either. Ikue Ayu, the famous idol, is another one of her "younger sisters" - and so was that strange girl I met on the train. Cosmos, I think Marina said her name was.*

1138
01:44:37,000 --> 01:44:48,000
*Now Marina's taken a special interest in me, succubi all over Japan will flock to me. Marina warned me as much before she asked her chauffeur to take me home.*

1139
01:44:48,000 --> 01:44:57,000
Marina: "My sisters will all start coming after you, desperate to claim your heart. I hope that you have enough stamina to handle all of us!"

1140
01:44:57,000 --> 01:45:05,000
*Did that really happen? It sounds patently unbelievable, but the longer I lie here, the sharper the memories become.*

1141
01:45:05,000 --> 01:45:10,000
*Marina... really is a succubus. She transformed before my very eyes!*

1142
01:45:10,000 --> 01:45:20,000
*I might've been drunk last night, but I wasn't so trashed I'd invent a ridiculous scene like that whole cloth. My imagination's not that good.*

1143
01:45:20,000 --> 01:45:32,000
*That's why I wanted to become a photojournalist, rather than a writer. I'm a skeptic, and I can only believe things if I've seen them with my own eyes. I'm bad at playing pretend.*

1144
01:45:32,000 --> 01:45:37,000
*A few days prior, I would've scoffed at the mere idea of succubi...*

1145
01:45:37,000 --> 01:45:41,000
*But Marina's inhuman features have swept my doubts aside.*

1146
01:45:41,000 --> 01:45:46,000
*How can I explain her wings and her horns without the aid of the supernatural?*

1147
01:45:46,000 --> 01:45:51,000
Hiroki: "Wakatsuki Marina sure is incredible... in more ways than one."

1148
01:45:51,000 --> 01:45:53,000
*I roll over in my futon, sighing.*

1149
01:45:53,000 --> 01:46:02,000
*Since it's a Tuesday, I need to get up, freshen up, and get to work... but my daily grind seems much less pressing than per usual.*

1150
01:46:02,000 --> 01:46:08,000
*My mind's almost entirely ensconced with Wakatsuki Marina and her succubi sisters.*

1151
01:46:08,000 --> 01:46:10,000
*What's going to happen to me now?*

1152
01:46:10,000 --> 01:46:14,000
*I guess, as of today, my normal life has well and truly ended.*

1153
01:46:14,000 --> 01:46:20,000
*Despite my ominous portents, however, the day unfolds more or less the same as it always does.*

1154
01:46:20,000 --> 01:46:25,000
*I get dressed, eat a hasty breakfast, shove on my shoes, then head off for work.*

1155
01:46:25,000 --> 01:46:31,000
*I catch the 07:30 train as per usual, and relax as the doors slide shut with a hiss.*

1156
01:46:31,000 --> 01:46:42,000
*My hour commute to work passes uneventfully. Though I keep my eyes peeled, glancing this way and that through the crowds, I see hide nor hair of the elusive Cosmos.*

1157
01:46:42,000 --> 01:46:52,000
*I arrive at work a little after 08:30, and greet my fellow employees. Then, I set to work on the numerous tasks my boss set me the day prior.*

1158
01:46:52,000 --> 01:47:03,000
*Work finishes at 17:00 on the dot, much to my relief. I've worked overtime so much, I can't remember the last time I left the office while the sun was still up.*

1159
01:47:03,000 --> 01:47:10,000
*Maybe some benevolent god heard my plaintive prayers the day prior and decided to throw me a bone.*

1160
01:47:10,000 --> 01:47:15,000
*I walk to the train station in high spirits, and board a train back home.*

1161
01:47:15,000 --> 01:47:23,000
*The afternoon train headed for Tokyo's suburbs is almost as busy as the morning train headed right into its heart.*

1162
01:47:23,000 --> 01:47:31,000
*I'm hemmed in, as always, by businessmen and women of various ages, with a few high school kids thrown in for good measure.*

1163
01:47:31,000 --> 01:47:40,000
*The businessmen keep their gazes cold and unapproachable, their narrowed eyes fixed upon the scenery as it flies past the windows.*

1164
01:47:40,000 --> 01:47:49,000
*The high school students, meanwhile, are busy chattering among themselves; tapping out text messages and giggling at funny jokes.*

1165
01:47:49,000 --> 01:47:57,000
*The young kids must've had busy days themselves, full of rote learning and club activities, but they're bursting with energy!*

1166
01:47:57,000 --> 01:47:59,000
*I can't help but envy them...*

1167
01:47:59,000 --> 01:48:01,000
*I wish I was young, too!*

1168
01:48:01,000 --> 01:48:16,000
*You might not think it to look at me now, but I was pretty popular back in high school. I've always been tall for my age, so I played on the school's basketball team. That netted me quite a lot of respect among my classmates.*

1169
01:48:16,000 --> 01:48:27,000
*In my last year of high school, I even managed to snag myself a girlfriend. She wasn't the prettiest or the smartest girl in the class, but I liked her a lot.*

1170
01:48:27,000 --> 01:48:32,000
*Even now, I can remember her serious face and her long, dark hair...*

1171
01:48:32,000 --> 01:48:45,000
*I broke things off with her when we graduated from high school and went to university. It was a mutual agreement. We were too young and immature to commit to a long-distance relationship.*

1172
01:48:45,000 --> 01:48:51,000
*I don't know if I miss her, per se, but I often think back to the time we spent together.*

1173
01:48:51,000 --> 01:49:03,000
*She wasn't a cheerful, giggly girl, like the high school students on this train. She was unusually quiet and withdrawn, but I think that's what drew me to her in the first place.*

1174
01:49:03,000 --> 01:49:10,000
*She wasn't drop-dead gorgeous, but she was pretty. Her charms were understated; very traditionally Japanese.*

1175
01:49:10,000 --> 01:49:14,000
*She had delicate features, pale skin, and a snub nose.*

1176
01:49:14,000 --> 01:49:20,000
*She always needled me to take my studies seriously. In that sense, she was rather motherly.*

1177
01:49:20,000 --> 01:49:25,000
*She tried to make me lunch, too, but her cooking skills were sub-par...*

1178
01:49:25,000 --> 01:49:28,000
*But that might be putting it nicely.*

1179
01:49:28,000 --> 01:49:37,000
*Her hamburger steak was tougher than old boots, her rolled egg omelettes split down the middle, and her ginger chicken was far too salty.*

1180
01:49:37,000 --> 01:49:45,000
*I tried my best to eat her food, but I'd always end up huddled in the boys' restroom, gagging. That made her scowl.*

1181
01:49:45,000 --> 01:49:55,000
*She scowled when I looked at other girls, too. Her jealous fits were so cute they always made me laugh (which, of course, upset her all the more).*

1182
01:49:55,000 --> 01:50:02,000
*I can still remember all the things we did together, though it's been over a decade since last we spoke.*

1183
01:50:02,000 --> 01:50:12,000
*We studied together in the school library, she gave me chocolate on Valentine's Day, and sometimes we went to cafés and theme parks together...*

1184
01:50:12,000 --> 01:50:19,000
Hiroki: "When was the last time I've been to a café with a cute girl? It feels like it's been forever..."

1185
01:50:19,000 --> 01:50:27,000
Hiroki: "My life's been nothing but work for the last few years. I haven't had a chance to cut loose and have fun."

1186
01:50:27,000 --> 01:50:30,000
Hiroki: "Being an adult really does suck."

1187
01:50:30,000 --> 01:50:35,000
Hiroki: "I'd be nice if I could go on a date again, like I did before..."

1188
01:50:35,000 --> 01:50:43,000
*Not like that'll happen. It's highly unlikely a cute, perfectly-molded girlfriend will fall from the sky and into my lap.*

1189
01:50:43,000 --> 01:50:54,000
*I guess you could say Marina fits the bill, but she's not really "girlfriend" material. She's too mature for such a juvenile label. She's more like a "partner"...*

1190
01:50:54,000 --> 01:50:58,000
*Though I think she'd prefer being called "mistress".*

1191
01:50:58,000 --> 01:51:06,000
*I like Marina well enough, but there's something a little intimidating about her. She's not at all like my first girlfriend.*

1192
01:51:06,000 --> 01:51:10,000
*Then again, nobody is. It's impossible to replace a memory.*

1193
01:51:10,000 --> 01:51:16,000
Hiroki: "I'm being stupid. I should give up on dating. I'm not a teenager anymore..."

1194
01:51:16,000 --> 01:51:22,000
???: "What? But why? You don't look that old to me, and I think you're very handsome!"

1195
01:51:22,000 --> 01:51:26,000
Hiroki: "Ha. That's nice to know, Mysterious Voice, but I..."

1196
01:51:26,000 --> 01:51:27,000
Hiroki: "Wait, what?!"

1197
01:51:27,000 --> 01:51:38,000
*I can feel something - no, two somethings - pressing against my chest. A familiar scent of floral perfume wafts about me, and I feel fingers grip the sleeves of my shirt.*

1198
01:51:38,000 --> 01:51:42,000
*Somebody's pressing their body against me, but who?!*

1199
01:51:42,000 --> 01:51:46,000
*I look down, bemused by the audacity of this mysterious person...*

1200
01:51:46,000 --> 01:51:50,000
*...and my befuddlement soon morphs into full-blown disbelief.*

1201
01:51:50,000 --> 01:51:53,000
*You're that pervert from yesterday!":

1202
01:51:53,000 --> 01:51:55,000
???: "Pervert? Maybe I am..."

1203
01:51:55,000 --> 01:52:00,000
???: "But that isn't very nice. You shouldn't shout such things out in public."

1204
01:52:00,000 --> 01:52:04,000
???: "I'm bad with people, and even I know that much."

1205
01:52:04,000 --> 01:52:09,000
Hiroki: "Ahaha... Sorry, sorry. I was so surprised, it just slipped out."

1206
01:52:09,000 --> 01:52:11,000
*You're that cutie from yesterday!":

1207
01:52:11,000 --> 01:52:12,000
???: "Huh?"

1208
01:52:12,000 --> 01:52:14,000
*The girl inclines her head.*

1209
01:52:14,000 --> 01:52:16,000
???: "Do you really think I'm cute?"

1210
01:52:16,000 --> 01:52:22,000
Hiroki: "You're incredibly cute - but that's beside the point. This really is a surprise."

1211
01:52:22,000 --> 01:52:24,000
Hiroki: "Fancy seeing you here."

1212
01:52:24,000 --> 01:52:29,000
*I recognize this girl - or, to be more precise, I recognize her body.*

1213
01:52:29,000 --> 01:52:39,000
*I never got to see her face during our last encounter. The curve of her spine was pressed against my chest, her derrière resting snugly against me.*

1214
01:52:39,000 --> 01:52:46,000
*I'm quite intimately acquainted with that behind of hers, but her face was something of a mystery.*

1215
01:52:46,000 --> 01:52:54,000
*Now I can finally see what she really looks like, I can say with certainty that she's just as adorable as I anticipated.*

1216
01:52:54,000 --> 01:52:58,000
*Her eyes are a soft amber hue lined with long, luxurious lashes.*

1217
01:52:58,000 --> 01:53:03,000
*Her nose is a small, cute button, and her lips are faintly shiny with gloss.*

1218
01:53:03,000 --> 01:53:13,000
*Her hair is lilac, but it fades to an icy blue about the tips. It's cut in a rough kind of bob, and part of it is tied back in a stubby ponytail.*

1219
01:53:13,000 --> 01:53:23,000
*Atop her head is perched a pair of cat ears. They don't look very practical. I'm not sure what purpose they serve, really, beyond an aesthetic one.*

1220
01:53:23,000 --> 01:53:33,000
*Then again, a lot of women wear high heels (Marina included), and I'm not sure what practical purpose they serve, either. Can't they damage women's feet?*

1221
01:53:33,000 --> 01:53:37,000
*Plus, those sharp spikes can get stuck in gutters...*

1222
01:53:37,000 --> 01:53:44,000
*This girl's choice of headgear might be impractical, but she's wearing a sturdy pair of sneakers on her feet.*

1223
01:53:44,000 --> 01:53:49,000
*A pink jacket and those very, very short shorts serve to complete the look.*

1224
01:53:49,000 --> 01:53:57,000
*I think she might be younger than I am, but only by a handful of years. She's most likely in her early twenties...*

1225
01:53:57,000 --> 01:54:03,000
*Though, if she really is a succubus, her age might not scale like that of normal humans.*

1226
01:54:03,000 --> 01:54:06,000
*For all I know, she could be centuries old!*

1227
01:54:06,000 --> 01:54:12,000
*Would a 500-year-old wear a pair of cat ears, though? The jury's still out on that one.*

1228
01:54:12,000 --> 01:54:14,000
Hiroki: "Your name's Cosmos, right?"

1229
01:54:14,000 --> 01:54:15,000
Cosmos: "Right."

1230
01:54:15,000 --> 01:54:19,000
*Cosmos affirms this with a lethargic nod of her head.*

1231
01:54:19,000 --> 01:54:30,000
*There's something a little "off" about this girl, actually - and no, I'm not just referring to the cat ears. Her movements all seem a second or so delayed...*

1232
01:54:30,000 --> 01:54:37,000
*And then, there's the fact that she's pushing herself against me in the middle of a crowded train.*

1233
01:54:37,000 --> 01:54:41,000
*Doesn't this girl understand the concept of "personal space"?*

1234
01:54:41,000 --> 01:54:43,000
Cosmos: "How do you know my name...?"

1235
01:54:43,000 --> 01:54:47,000
Hiroki: "Marina told me. She explained who you are yesterday."

1236
01:54:47,000 --> 01:54:50,000
Hiroki: "You're... a succubus, right?"

1237
01:54:50,000 --> 01:54:52,000
Cosmos: "That's right."

1238
01:54:52,000 --> 01:55:02,000
*Cosmos nods once more, her stubby ponytail bouncing. It's not the only part of her anatomy that bounces, either - but I try not to stare too blatantly.*

1239
01:55:02,000 --> 01:55:05,000
Cosmos: "So, you know everything? Marina told you?"

1240
01:55:05,000 --> 01:55:07,000
Hiroki: "Yeah, she did."

1241
01:55:07,000 --> 01:55:08,000
Cosmos: "Oh. Good."

1242
01:55:08,000 --> 01:55:09,000
*Cosmos smiles.*

1243
01:55:09,000 --> 01:55:13,000
Cosmos: "That makes this easier. I don't like explaining things."

1244
01:55:13,000 --> 01:55:17,000
Hiroki: "You're an act first, ask questions later kind of girl?"

1245
01:55:17,000 --> 01:55:20,000
Cosmos: "I don't like asking. It's awkward."

1246
01:55:20,000 --> 01:55:24,000
Cosmos: "Talking with people is difficult for me, but..."

1247
01:55:24,000 --> 01:55:27,000
Cosmos: "I want to try and make an effort with you."

1248
01:55:27,000 --> 01:55:28,000
Cosmos: "Hiroki."

1249
01:55:28,000 --> 01:55:32,000
*Cosmos pushes her chest even more firmly against my body.*

1250
01:55:32,000 --> 01:55:36,000
Cosmos: "I know we're still strangers, but... I like you a lot."

1251
01:55:36,000 --> 01:55:37,000
Cosmos: "I want you."

1252
01:55:37,000 --> 01:55:38,000
Hiroki: "M-Me?"

1253
01:55:38,000 --> 01:55:44,000
Cosmos: "Yes. Ayu talked about you. Marina, too. They said you smell good. They're not wrong."

1254
01:55:44,000 --> 01:55:47,000
*Cosmos inhales deeply, her nostrils quivering.*

1255
01:55:47,000 --> 01:55:50,000
Cosmos: "You're... addictive. Sweet, like candy."

1256
01:55:50,000 --> 01:55:56,000
Cosmos: "Marina is... picky. Her taste is discerning. If she likes you, you must be special."

1257
01:55:56,000 --> 01:55:58,000
Cosmos: "I like you, too..."

1258
01:55:58,000 --> 01:56:00,000
Cosmos: "So, let's go."

1259
01:56:00,000 --> 01:56:11,000
*The train begins to slow as it pulls into the next station. It's not the station I want to get off at, but Cosmos doesn't seem to care about little details like that.*

1260
01:56:11,000 --> 01:56:18,000
*She grabs hold of my hand, her fingers winding with mine. Her hand is very small, and mine dwarves hers.*

1261
01:56:18,000 --> 01:56:20,000
*She's small and pixie-like...*

1262
01:56:20,000 --> 01:56:22,000
*But she's incredibly insistent!*

1263
01:56:22,000 --> 01:56:24,000
Hiroki: "H-Hey, Cosmos! Wait!"

1264
01:56:24,000 --> 01:56:28,000
*I try to pull away from her, but she doesn't listen.*

1265
01:56:28,000 --> 01:56:40,000
*The train's automatic doors open with a hiss, and Cosmos drags me forward. Buoyed by numerous passengers, who're all struggling to get off the train, I find myself pushed forth.*

1266
01:56:40,000 --> 01:56:48,000
*I feel like a fish trying to swim upriver. The current (or, in this case, Cosmos's tiny hand) is far too strong!*

1267
01:56:48,000 --> 01:56:50,000
*I'm being swept away...!*

1268
01:56:50,000 --> 01:56:54,000
Hiroki: "Wh-What do you want with me? Where are we going?!"

1269
01:56:54,000 --> 01:57:01,000
*Cosmos glances at me over her shoulder, her ombre hair fluttering. She smiles, then says sweetly...*

1270
01:57:01,000 --> 01:57:02,000
Cosmos: "On a date."

1271
01:57:02,000 --> 01:57:04,000
Hiroki: "Some date this is..."

1272
01:57:04,000 --> 01:57:11,000
*I huff, my arms folded, my long legs furled up beneath a table that's a little too small for me.*

1273
01:57:11,000 --> 01:57:16,000
*Dragging me off the train was just the first step in Cosmos's diabolical plan.*

1274
01:57:16,000 --> 01:57:25,000
*I'd barely had a chance to gather my breath when her fingers tightened about my palm once more, her eyes shining with excitement.*

1275
01:57:25,000 --> 01:57:29,000
Cosmos: "We're going on a date, Hiroki. You need to hurry!"

1276
01:57:29,000 --> 01:57:32,000
Hiroki: "A date? But where? What are you-"

1277
01:57:32,000 --> 01:57:33,000
Hiroki: "Aaaah!"

1278
01:57:33,000 --> 01:57:36,000
*And so, just like that, I found myself here.*

1279
01:57:36,000 --> 01:57:43,000
*Cosmos hauled me all the way to this maid café. It's quite a cute café, with white tables and pink walls.*

1280
01:57:43,000 --> 01:57:51,000
*Pots of flowers bloom on almost every available surface, and the smell of cinnamon and hot chocolate lingers in the air.*

1281
01:57:51,000 --> 01:58:05,000
*Waitresses bustle past, their black flats slapping against the wooden floor. They greet customers with cheery cries of "Welcome, Master! Welcome, Mistress!", their frilly dresses fluttering around their thighs.*

1282
01:58:05,000 --> 01:58:16,000
*Some of the waitresses are carrying notepads, ready to jot down orders, while others hold trays laden with slices of apple pie, strawberry sundaes, and fruity milkshakes.*

1283
01:58:16,000 --> 01:58:24,000
*Cute J-Pop music dances in the air, mingling with the chiming of the bell over the door and the chatter of the patrons.*

1284
01:58:24,000 --> 01:58:28,000
*I think I recognize this song, actually. Isn't it one of Ayu's?*

1285
01:58:28,000 --> 01:58:42,000
*This café isn't a bad place to go on a date, I guess. There are a few couples here, other than Cosmos and I, who're acting all lovey-dovey; feeding one another bites of cake and holding hands over the tabletop.*

1286
01:58:42,000 --> 01:58:46,000
*If Cosmos was my girlfriend, I'd feel right at home...*

1287
01:58:46,000 --> 01:58:48,000
*But Cosmos isn't my girlfriend.*

1288
01:58:48,000 --> 01:58:50,000
*In fact, I hardly know her!*

1289
01:58:50,000 --> 01:58:56,000
*Things are progressing way too fast, and I can't wrap my head around all of this!*

1290
01:58:56,000 --> 01:59:01,000
Hiroki: "When you said you wanted to go on a date... were you being serious?"

1291
01:59:01,000 --> 01:59:02,000
Cosmos: "..."

1292
01:59:02,000 --> 01:59:07,000
Hiroki: "What do you see in me, anyway? Are you trying to get one over on Marina?"

1293
01:59:07,000 --> 01:59:08,000
Cosmos: "..."

1294
01:59:08,000 --> 01:59:13,000
Hiroki: "Are you actually interested in me, or is this some sort of joke?"

1295
01:59:13,000 --> 01:59:14,000
Cosmos: "..."

1296
01:59:14,000 --> 01:59:19,000
Hiroki: "What sort of name is "Cosmos", anyway? It doesn't sound very Japanese."

1297
01:59:19,000 --> 01:59:20,000
Cosmos: "..."

1298
01:59:20,000 --> 01:59:26,000
Hiroki: "Then again, you are a succubus. I guess it makes sense that your name isn't Japanese..."

1299
01:59:26,000 --> 01:59:35,000
Hiroki: "Why do Ayu and Marina have Japanese names, then? Are they their real names, or did they make them up when they came to Earth?"

1300
01:59:35,000 --> 01:59:42,000
Hiroki: "Maybe their succubus moms had relationships with Japanese men, and that's how they ended up like that?"

1301
01:59:42,000 --> 01:59:51,000
Hiroki: "How long have you been on Earth, anyway - and is there some sort of succubus realm out there, where you guys live without humans?"

1302
01:59:51,000 --> 01:59:52,000
Cosmos: "..."

1303
01:59:52,000 --> 01:59:55,000
*Cosmos remains irritatingly unresponsive.*

1304
01:59:55,000 --> 02:00:04,000
*I've asked her dozens of questions since our smiling waitress showed us to our seats, and she hasn't said so much as a single syllable!*

1305
02:00:04,000 --> 02:00:10,000
*Is she trying to make me feel uncomfortable? Maybe she's a sadist just like Marina!*

1306
02:00:10,000 --> 02:00:11,000
Hiroki: "Hey! Cosmos!"

1307
02:00:11,000 --> 02:00:16,000
*I slam my palm against the table, hoping for some kind of response.*

1308
02:00:16,000 --> 02:00:23,000
Hiroki: "Why'd you bring me all the way here if you're not going to talk? What are you doing, anyway?"

1309
02:00:23,000 --> 02:00:24,000
Cosmos: "Oh..."

1310
02:00:24,000 --> 02:00:29,000
*Cosmos blinks. She sets her phone down, then looks at me beneath her eyelashes.*

1311
02:00:29,000 --> 02:00:33,000
Cosmos: "Sorry, Hiroki. I was doing something important."

1312
02:00:33,000 --> 02:00:38,000
Hiroki: "It didn't look like you were doing anything all that important to me."

1313
02:00:38,000 --> 02:00:47,000
*For the last five minutes, Cosmos has been busy snapping pictures of her ice-cream sundae, which a kind waitress already brought over.*

1314
02:00:47,000 --> 02:00:56,000
*She must've taken hundreds of pictures of the frozen treat from all sorts of angles, her tongue stuck out her mouth all the while.*

1315
02:00:56,000 --> 02:01:05,000
*Her dedication to the art of photography's kind of impressive. As a photographer myself, I want to commend her for her meticulousness...*

1316
02:01:05,000 --> 02:01:09,000
*But another, bigger part of me feels incredibly exasperated.*

1317
02:01:09,000 --> 02:01:17,000
*Thanks to the invention of camera phones, millions of people across the globe fancy themselves as pro photographers.*

1318
02:01:17,000 --> 02:01:26,000
*You see people like Cosmos everywhere, taking snapshots of every aspect of their lives so they can upload them to social media.*

1319
02:01:26,000 --> 02:01:33,000
*For some reason, people seem particularly fascinated with taking food pics. I wonder why that is...?*

1320
02:01:33,000 --> 02:01:39,000
*Maybe it's because everyone, no matter their age, gender, or personality, has to eat.*

1321
02:01:39,000 --> 02:01:46,000
*It's easy to farm likes by uploading pics of food - particularly cute food, like Cosmos's sundae.*

1322
02:01:46,000 --> 02:01:49,000
*I'll admit, her sundae does look good...*

1323
02:01:49,000 --> 02:01:53,000
*But I don't think there's anything that special about it.*

1324
02:01:53,000 --> 02:01:57,000
*Try being a real photographer, and see how difficult it is then!*

1325
02:01:57,000 --> 02:01:59,000
Cosmos: "This is important. Very."

1326
02:01:59,000 --> 02:02:03,000
*Cosmos returns my grumpy scowl with a small, serious nod.*

1327
02:02:03,000 --> 02:02:08,000
Cosmos: "I need to take photos. I'll upload the best to Rapidpound."

1328
02:02:08,000 --> 02:02:13,000
Hiroki: "Rapidpound? That social media site with the questionable name?"

1329
02:02:13,000 --> 02:02:15,000
Cosmos: "That's right."

1330
02:02:15,000 --> 02:02:16,000
*Another nod.*

1331
02:02:16,000 --> 02:02:26,000
Cosmos: "You might not know this, but I'm a little bit famous on Rapidpound. I need to upload at least five photos a day, or I'll let my fans down."

1332
02:02:26,000 --> 02:02:29,000
Hiroki: "Define "a little bit famous"."

1333
02:02:29,000 --> 02:02:32,000
Cosmos: "I have three million followers."

1334
02:02:32,000 --> 02:02:40,000
*Cosmos replies in such a simple, matter-of-fact tone, it takes me a few moments to process the full weight of her words.*

1335
02:02:40,000 --> 02:02:44,000
*When the penny finally drops, however, I find myself gawping.*

1336
02:02:44,000 --> 02:02:46,000
Hiroki: "Three million?!"

1337
02:02:46,000 --> 02:02:48,000
Cosmos: "That's right."

1338
02:02:48,000 --> 02:02:55,000
Cosmos: "I've only had a Rapidpound account for a few months, but I've become quite well-known..."

1339
02:02:55,000 --> 02:02:59,000
Hiroki: "I-I'll say! That's something of an understatement!"

1340
02:02:59,000 --> 02:03:00,000
Cosmos: "It is...?"

1341
02:03:00,000 --> 02:03:05,000
Hiroki: "Yes! A lot of famous actors and singers have less followers than that!"

1342
02:03:05,000 --> 02:03:14,000
*I don't keep abreast of social media trends (I'm too old and irrelevant to worry about online clout), but I'm not completely clueless.*

1343
02:03:14,000 --> 02:03:20,000
*I have been on Rapidpound before, and I have a few ballpark figures to work with.*

1344
02:03:20,000 --> 02:03:22,000
Hiroki: "Let me see..."

1345
02:03:22,000 --> 02:03:30,000
*I take my own phone from my pocket, then search through Rapidpound. I pull up Ikue Ayu's profile and scan through it.*

1346
02:03:30,000 --> 02:03:38,000
Hiroki: "Ayu's one of Japan's most popular idols, and she doesn't even have one million followers! She only has 700,000!"

1347
02:03:38,000 --> 02:03:43,000
Cosmos: "Oh, yes. I heard about that. Ayu was very angry. She said..."

1348
02:03:43,000 --> 02:03:50,000
*Cosmos clears her throat, then launches into an eerily accurate impression of Ikue Ayu's shrill tones.*

1349
02:03:50,000 --> 02:03:58,000
Cosmos: "Why do you have more followers than me?! You don't have any special talents, and I'm way cuter than you are!"

1350
02:03:58,000 --> 02:04:10,000
Cosmos: "All you do is upload half-naked photos in cheap, crappy cosplay and pictures of food! Thousands of girls do that, so why are you so popular? It's not faaaaaaaaair!"

1351
02:04:10,000 --> 02:04:11,000
Hiroki: "Nn..."

1352
02:04:11,000 --> 02:04:21,000
*Cosmos's impression of Ayu might be a little too spot-on, actually. I wine, and I have to clap my hands over my ears to blunt the worst of it.*

1353
02:04:21,000 --> 02:04:25,000
Hiroki: "Ayu's voice... is quite powerful, isn't it?"

1354
02:04:25,000 --> 02:04:30,000
Cosmos: "It really is. She has strong lungs. Nobody can shout louder than her."

1355
02:04:30,000 --> 02:04:35,000
Hiroki: "I dunno about that. You gave her a run for her money there."

1356
02:04:35,000 --> 02:04:37,000
Cosmos: "You think so? Thank you."

1357
02:04:37,000 --> 02:04:44,000
Cosmos: "I don't have any special talents... but I'm good at impressions. I'm good at taking photos, too."

1358
02:04:44,000 --> 02:04:50,000
Cosmos: "My fans will be waiting for me to upload a new photo. I can't let them down."

1359
02:04:50,000 --> 02:04:59,000
*So saying, Cosmos begins to take a few more photos of her icecream sundae. By this point, it's started to melt, but that doesn't deter her.*

1360
02:04:59,000 --> 02:05:05,000
*She focuses on the dessert with laser-like precision, her nose scrunched in concentration.*

1361
02:05:05,000 --> 02:05:11,000
*Her finger taps at her phone dozens of times each second, and the flash sputters accordingly.*

1362
02:05:11,000 --> 02:05:14,000
*I watch Cosmos, leaning back in my chair.*

1363
02:05:14,000 --> 02:05:22,000
*I thought she was a silly, frivolous girl, like the high school students back on the train... but maybe I was mistaken.*

1364
02:05:22,000 --> 02:05:26,000
*For an influencer, she's surprisingly hard-working.*

1365
02:05:26,000 --> 02:05:27,000
*Now, I wonder...*

1366
02:05:27,000 --> 02:05:30,000
Hiroki: "Hey, Cosmos. What's your Rapidpound name?"

1367
02:05:30,000 --> 02:05:33,000
Cosmos: "Why? Do you want to look me up?"

1368
02:05:33,000 --> 02:05:38,000
Hiroki: "I'm curious, yeah. I want to see what sort of stuff you've been posting."

1369
02:05:38,000 --> 02:05:41,000
Cosmos: "So, you're interested in me? Heh..."

1370
02:05:41,000 --> 02:05:49,000
*Cosmos giggles. Her cheeks turn pale pink with pleasure. Is she really that happy that I'm taking an interest in her?*

1371
02:05:49,000 --> 02:05:57,000
Cosmos: "I'm Cosmos Flower, but you probably shouldn't check my profile in public. Some of my photos are pretty-"

1372
02:05:57,000 --> 02:05:58,000
Hiroki: "Aaah..."

1373
02:05:58,000 --> 02:05:59,000
Cosmos: "...lewd. Um."

1374
02:05:59,000 --> 02:06:01,000
*Cosmos blinks at me, suddenly shy.*

1375
02:06:01,000 --> 02:06:04,000
Cosmos: "Are you looking at my profile, Hiroki?"

1376
02:06:04,000 --> 02:06:11,000
*I nod my head stiffly, fingers gripping my phone like claws. My face is so hot it feels like a furnace.*

1377
02:06:11,000 --> 02:06:17,000
*I know I should click away from Cosmos's profile, but I can't! My whole body's frozen up!*

1378
02:06:17,000 --> 02:06:24,000
*Cosmos wasn't joking when she said her photos are lewd! The images on her feed are incredibly revealing!*

1379
02:06:24,000 --> 02:06:31,000
*There's one photo of her dressed in a lewd bunny girl costume, a bottle of alcohol lodged between her breasts.*

1380
02:06:31,000 --> 02:06:38,000
*There's another photo of her wearing a micro-bikini, so sheer it leaves very little to the imagination...*

1381
02:06:38,000 --> 02:06:47,000
*And then, most bafflingly of all, there's a photo of her reclining in a bathtub, playing with what appears to be a live squid.*

1382
02:06:47,000 --> 02:06:49,000
*Wh-What sort of photos are these?!*

1383
02:06:49,000 --> 02:06:59,000
*This menagerie of hyper-sensual images are interspaced with shots of the sunset, slices of cake, cups of tea, and various other "aesthetic" things...*

1384
02:06:59,000 --> 02:07:05,000
*But the majority of these photos are one wardrobe malfunction away from full-blown pornography!*

1385
02:07:05,000 --> 02:07:12,000
Hiroki: "I-Is stuff like this even allowed on Rapidpound? I-Isn't it a violation of their terms and services?"

1386
02:07:12,000 --> 02:07:18,000
Cosmos: "Ayu says that, too. She keeps trying to flag my account, but it doesn't work."

1387
02:07:18,000 --> 02:07:25,000
Cosmos: "I'm not showing anything too lewd, so it's fine. That's what the people at Rapidpound say."

1388
02:07:25,000 --> 02:07:29,000
Hiroki: "M-Maybe not, but you're on pretty thin ice..."

1389
02:07:29,000 --> 02:07:39,000
*I stare at Cosmos's photos, dazed. I can see Cosmos's butt, her breasts, and her smooth, soft belly! There's so much of her, I'm starting to overheat!*

1390
02:07:39,000 --> 02:07:47,000
*With trembling hands, I navigate away from Cosmos's far-too-tempting profile. Then, I slot my phone back into my pocket.*

1391
02:07:47,000 --> 02:07:53,000
Hiroki: "Do you... really not mind, posting photos like that for the world to see?"

1392
02:07:53,000 --> 02:07:55,000
Cosmos: "No. Why should I?"

1393
02:07:55,000 --> 02:07:58,000
Cosmos: "I have a nice body. I'm not ashamed..."

1394
02:07:58,000 --> 02:08:03,000
Cosmos: "And, besides, it makes people happy. I like making people happy."

1395
02:08:03,000 --> 02:08:06,000
Cosmos: "I'm not doing anything wrong, am I...?"

1396
02:08:06,000 --> 02:08:09,000
Cosmos: "You don't think I'm dirty, do you, Hiroki?"

1397
02:08:09,000 --> 02:08:12,000
*I don't think you're dirty, but it is sketchy...":

1398
02:08:12,000 --> 02:08:16,000
Hiroki: "I don't think it's dirty, but it is a little... off."

1399
02:08:16,000 --> 02:08:25,000
Hiroki: "You're an adult, so I can't tell you what to do, but I don't think I would want any daughter of mine makig a living like this."

1400
02:08:25,000 --> 02:08:27,000
*Not that I have any children.*

1401
02:08:27,000 --> 02:08:31,000
Cosmos: "I'm not sure I follow. Am I really doing something bad?"

1402
02:08:31,000 --> 02:08:35,000
Cosmos: "I haven't murdered anybody. My photos make people happy."

1403
02:08:35,000 --> 02:08:37,000
Cosmos: "How is it "off"?"

1404
02:08:37,000 --> 02:08:43,000
Hiroki: "I guess there's nothing really wrong with it. These might be my own prejudices, but..."

1405
02:08:43,000 --> 02:08:49,000
Hiroki: "Well, whatever. It's your life. I have no right telling you how best to live it."

1406
02:08:49,000 --> 02:08:54,000
Cosmos: "OK. Thank you, Hiroki. I'm glad you're not too judgmental..."

1407
02:08:54,000 --> 02:08:56,000
*No, I don't think you're dirty.":

1408
02:08:56,000 --> 02:09:06,000
Hiroki: "N-No, uh... I-I guess not. Since you're an adult, you can do what you want with your body, and we've all got to earn a living somehow."

1409
02:09:06,000 --> 02:09:09,000
Cosmos: "Heh. I knew you would understand."

1410
02:09:09,000 --> 02:09:11,000
Cosmos: "I have a few fans-"

1411
02:09:11,000 --> 02:09:17,000
*Three million followers is definitely more than "a few" (provided they're not all bots).*

1412
02:09:17,000 --> 02:09:23,000
*Doesn't this girl realize how famous she is? Either she's very humble, or she's a total ditz.*

1413
02:09:23,000 --> 02:09:29,000
*Given her slow, sleepy way of talking, I'm personally leaning towards the latter...*

1414
02:09:29,000 --> 02:09:35,000
Cosmos: "-but some people hate me, too. I get nasty comments. People call me mean things."

1415
02:09:35,000 --> 02:09:40,000
Cosmos: "They think it's bad to show my body to people... but I don't think so."

1416
02:09:40,000 --> 02:09:45,000
Cosmos: "I'm happy you don't agree with them, Hiroki. I knew you were a nice man!"

1417
02:09:45,000 --> 02:09:49,000
Hiroki: "Nah. There's nothing special about me, really..."

1418
02:09:49,000 --> 02:09:51,000
Cosmos: "But there is."

1419
02:09:51,000 --> 02:09:57,000
*Cosmos looks at me determinedly, her voice shedding some of its sleepy, monotonous qualities.*

1420
02:09:57,000 --> 02:10:05,000
Cosmos: "I knew you were special when Marina started talking about you. My big sis has high standards and good taste."

1421
02:10:05,000 --> 02:10:11,000
Cosmos: "I was certain you would be kind and gentle... and you've not betrayed my expectations."

1422
02:10:11,000 --> 02:10:15,000
Cosmos: "I really do like you. That's why I have to thank you."

1423
02:10:15,000 --> 02:10:16,000
Cosmos: "Here."

1424
02:10:16,000 --> 02:10:21,000
*Cosmos scoops up a bit of icecream on her spoon, then proffers it to me.*

1425
02:10:21,000 --> 02:10:24,000
*I look at it flatly, my brow furrowed.*

1426
02:10:24,000 --> 02:10:26,000
Hiroki: "What's that for...?"

1427
02:10:26,000 --> 02:10:29,000
Cosmos: "It's for you. I want you to say "ah"."

1428
02:10:29,000 --> 02:10:31,000
Hiroki: "Oh, no, it's fine."

1429
02:10:31,000 --> 02:10:37,000
*I try to refute Cosmos's offer, kind though it is, by waving one hand before my face.*

1430
02:10:37,000 --> 02:10:40,000
Hiroki: "I'm not a big fan of sweets."

1431
02:10:40,000 --> 02:10:46,000
Hiroki: "You eat it for yourself. You've been looking forward to that, haven't you?"

1432
02:10:46,000 --> 02:10:52,000
Cosmos: "That is true. I like icecream a lot... And cake, and flan, and tarts, and pie."

1433
02:10:52,000 --> 02:10:54,000
Cosmos: "I love sweets..."

1434
02:10:54,000 --> 02:11:00,000
Cosmos: "But I love sweet humans, too - and you are one of the nicest I have ever met."

1435
02:11:00,000 --> 02:11:05,000
Cosmos: "Won't you let me feed you, darling? If you don't, I'll be sad."

1436
02:11:05,000 --> 02:11:08,000
Cosmos: "I mean... you are my boyfriend."

1437
02:11:08,000 --> 02:11:11,000
Hiroki: "A-And when did you decide that, exactly?"

1438
02:11:11,000 --> 02:11:18,000
Cosmos: "Yesterday, when we were on the train. That was the first time I'd ever been so close to a man."

1439
02:11:18,000 --> 02:11:20,000
Hiroki: "H-Huh? Really?"

1440
02:11:20,000 --> 02:11:23,000
Cosmos: "Yes, really. Is that hard to believe?"

1441
02:11:23,000 --> 02:11:27,000
Hiroki: "It is, a little. I mean... I thought you were a succubus?"

1442
02:11:27,000 --> 02:11:36,000
Cosmos: "I am a succubus, but I'm not like my sisters. I can't sing and dance like Ayu can, and I don't have Marina's business sense."

1443
02:11:36,000 --> 02:11:42,000
Cosmos: "I'm not athletic, and I'm not good at acting, and I don't have any motivation."

1444
02:11:42,000 --> 02:11:51,000
Cosmos: "Princess Yue told me I was a disgrace of a succubus. She said I'd never amount to anything. I thought she was right..."

1445
02:11:51,000 --> 02:11:56,000
Cosmos: "But then I discovered social media, and a new world opened up before me."

1446
02:11:56,000 --> 02:12:03,000
Cosmos: "A lot of people seem to like my content. I don't really know why, but I'm very grateful."

1447
02:12:03,000 --> 02:12:08,000
Cosmos: "Their love and support gives me strength. I don't want to let them down."

1448
02:12:08,000 --> 02:12:17,000
Cosmos: "Ayu complains a lot, and Marina doesn't understand my success. Among us succubi, I'm a total weirdo... and I'm socially awkward."

1449
02:12:17,000 --> 02:12:22,000
Cosmos: "I find it hard to talk to people face-to-face, or tell them what I want."

1450
02:12:22,000 --> 02:12:25,000
Cosmos: "Most people are... kind of scary."

1451
02:12:25,000 --> 02:12:34,000
Cosmos: "I've never been in a real relationship before. I can only communicate through a screen. That's what I thought, at least..."

1452
02:12:34,000 --> 02:12:36,000
Cosmos: "But then I met you."

1453
02:12:36,000 --> 02:12:42,000
Cosmos: "I fell for you the moment we met. That's why I wanted to be close to you."

1454
02:12:42,000 --> 02:12:45,000
Cosmos: "I want to give you everything."

1455
02:12:45,000 --> 02:12:49,000
Cosmos: "My sisters might love you... but I love you, too."

1456
02:12:49,000 --> 02:12:59,000
Cosmos: "I'm a failure of a succubus, but I still want you to be my boyfriend. Won't you say yes, please? That would make me incredibly happy."

1457
02:12:59,000 --> 02:13:00,000
*Ah, geez...*

1458
02:13:00,000 --> 02:13:05,000
*Cosmos looks and sounds so earnest, I'd feel cruel to turn her down now!*

1459
02:13:05,000 --> 02:13:11,000
*I might be in a relationship (of sorts) with Marina, but she's not really my "girlfriend".*

1460
02:13:11,000 --> 02:13:17,000
*She doesn't seem to care much about exclusivity. In fact, she told me this might happen.*

1461
02:13:17,000 --> 02:13:26,000
Marina: "My sisters will all start coming after you, desperate to claim your heart. I hope that you have enough stamina to handle all of us!"

1462
02:13:26,000 --> 02:13:32,000
*If Marina's OK with this, I guess there are no reasons why I have to turn Cosmos down.*

1463
02:13:32,000 --> 02:13:40,000
*She's a bit strange, it's true, but she's very earnest. She seems to genuinely like me, at least (though I can't fathom why).*

1464
02:13:40,000 --> 02:13:46,000
*Cosmos has done a lot for me. The least I can do is give her a bit of affection in return.*

1465
02:13:46,000 --> 02:13:51,000
Hiroki: "Alright then, Cosmos. I can be your boyfriend - for now, at least."

1466
02:13:51,000 --> 02:13:54,000
Cosmos: "You... R-Really mean that...?!"

1467
02:13:54,000 --> 02:14:01,000
Hiroki: "Yeah. I do. I was just thinking, on the train back home, it'd be nice to go out on dates again."

1468
02:14:01,000 --> 02:14:07,000
Hiroki: "I'm a little rusty when it comes to the whole "boyfriend" schtick, but I'll do my best."

1469
02:14:07,000 --> 02:14:12,000
Hiroki: "I'll show you around Tokyo, and we'll have a lot of fun together."

1470
02:14:12,000 --> 02:14:20,000
*Dating two succubi at once sounds like it'll be rough, but I think I can handle it. I want to make them both happy...*

1471
02:14:20,000 --> 02:14:27,000
*And, to start, I'm going to help myself to that spoonful of icecream Cosmos is holding out for me.*

1472
02:14:27,000 --> 02:14:29,000
Hiroki: "Thanks for the food."

1473
02:14:29,000 --> 02:14:39,000
*I lean forth and clamp my lips about the metal spoon. The gooey icecream, already melted, spreads across my tongue and slides down my throat.*

1474
02:14:39,000 --> 02:14:42,000
*It's sweet and satisfying, and I shudder.*

1475
02:14:42,000 --> 02:14:43,000
Cosmos: "Wah..."

1476
02:14:43,000 --> 02:14:49,000
Cosmos: "H-Hiroki ate some icecream from my spoon... Th-That's the same spoon I was using..."

1477
02:14:49,000 --> 02:14:53,000
Cosmos: "W-We just had an indirect kiss! That's so naughty!!!"

1478
02:14:53,000 --> 02:15:01,000
*Personally, I think it's a bit too late to worry about such childish things. We've done more than share indirect kisses...*

1479
02:15:01,000 --> 02:15:08,000
*But if Cosmos is to be believed (and I don't think she's lying to me), she's never had a relationship before.*

1480
02:15:08,000 --> 02:15:14,000
*This is the very first time she's done anything like this with a member of the opposite sex.*

1481
02:15:14,000 --> 02:15:17,000
*That being the case, I want to satisfy her.*

1482
02:15:17,000 --> 02:15:21,000
*As her boyfriend, her happiness is my number one priority.*

1483
02:15:21,000 --> 02:15:27,000
Hiroki: "So, if I’m going to be your boyfriend, we need to lay down a few ground rules."

1484
02:15:27,000 --> 02:15:28,000
Cosmos: "Rules?"

1485
02:15:28,000 --> 02:15:30,000
Hiroki: "That's right."

1486
02:15:30,000 --> 02:15:34,000
*I survey Cosmos from across the table, my fingers laced together.*

1487
02:15:34,000 --> 02:15:40,000
*We're still sitting in the maid café, bathed beneath the bright, artificial lights.*

1488
02:15:40,000 --> 02:15:47,000
*Cosmos has finished up her sundae (with a bit of help from me), and now she's sipping a strawberry milkshake.*

1489
02:15:47,000 --> 02:15:58,000
*I, meanwhile, ordered a glass of green tea. I'm not particularly thirsty, and a lot of the beverages in this place look like heart attacks waiting to happen.*

1490
02:15:58,000 --> 02:16:06,000
*I don't really like sugar at the best of times, and these icecream floats laden with syrup and sprinkles are way too much!*

1491
02:16:06,000 --> 02:16:10,000
Hiroki: "You're famous, Cosmos, so we'll have to be careful."

1492
02:16:10,000 --> 02:16:11,000
Cosmos: "Careful?"

1493
02:16:11,000 --> 02:16:15,000
*Cosmos blinks at me, her expression uncomprehending.*

1494
02:16:15,000 --> 02:16:16,000
Cosmos: "But why?"

1495
02:16:16,000 --> 02:16:18,000
Hiroki: "Why, she asks..."

1496
02:16:18,000 --> 02:16:22,000
*Shouldn't it be obvious? What planet is this girl living on?*

1497
02:16:22,000 --> 02:16:32,000
Hiroki: "If word gets out to your three million followers that you're dating somebody, my life won't be worth living! I might even get lynched!"

1498
02:16:32,000 --> 02:16:35,000
Cosmos: ""Lynched"? Like, the movie director?"

1499
02:16:35,000 --> 02:16:37,000
Hiroki: "...You've heard of Lynch?"

1500
02:16:37,000 --> 02:16:41,000
Cosmos: "I like Eraserbrain. It's one of my favorite movies."

1501
02:16:41,000 --> 02:16:42,000
Hiroki: "Huh..."

1502
02:16:42,000 --> 02:16:44,000
*I must say, I didn't expect that.*

1503
02:16:44,000 --> 02:16:53,000
*Cosmos might be wearing a pair of kitty ears and some very (very) tight booty shorts, but she has surprisingly esoteric tastes.*

1504
02:16:53,000 --> 02:16:56,000
*I guess you shouldn't judge a book by its cover.*

1505
02:16:56,000 --> 02:17:01,000
*Next, she'll be telling me she's partial to the works of Kubrick...*

1506
02:17:01,000 --> 02:17:11,000
Hiroki: "Anyway. Getting back to the subject at hand. I'm not talking about movie directors here. I'm referring to the physical act of lynching."

1507
02:17:11,000 --> 02:17:13,000
Cosmos: "Physical act...?"

1508
02:17:13,000 --> 02:17:14,000
Cosmos: "..."

1509
02:17:14,000 --> 02:17:18,000
Cosmos: "I'd like it if you could get more physical with me."

1510
02:17:18,000 --> 02:17:25,000
Hiroki: "I'd like that too, but we can only do those things in private. That's what I'm trying to say."

1511
02:17:25,000 --> 02:17:32,000
Hiroki: "You might not be an idol like Ayu, but your fans probably love you just as much as hers do."

1512
02:17:32,000 --> 02:17:37,000
Hiroki: "You have a huge following, and I bet most of them are men."

1513
02:17:37,000 --> 02:17:44,000
Hiroki: "They'd be devastated if they knew you were dating. It'll put a huge dint in your popularity."

1514
02:17:44,000 --> 02:17:48,000
Cosmos: "But why? Shouldn't they be happy that I'm happy?"

1515
02:17:48,000 --> 02:17:54,000
Hiroki: "It'd be nice if things worked out like that, but people aren't that selfless."

1516
02:17:54,000 --> 02:18:01,000
Hiroki: "I can date you, but you'll have to keep it a secret. That'll be the best, for both you and me."

1517
02:18:01,000 --> 02:18:02,000
Cosmos: "Hmm..."

1518
02:18:02,000 --> 02:18:05,000
*Cosmos stirs her drink with her straw.*

1519
02:18:05,000 --> 02:18:10,000
Cosmos: "I don't really get it... but I'm bad at understanding difficult stuff."

1520
02:18:10,000 --> 02:18:13,000
Hiroki: "I don't think this is that difficult."

1521
02:18:13,000 --> 02:18:16,000
Cosmos: "Maybe not for you, but it is for me."

1522
02:18:16,000 --> 02:18:27,000
Cosmos: "Ayu says I'm bad at reading the mood. I can't understand how people feel. Their emotions are too complicated. I try to understand, but it doesn't make any sense."

1523
02:18:27,000 --> 02:18:29,000
Cosmos: "I'm pretty dumb..."

1524
02:18:29,000 --> 02:18:31,000
Cosmos: "But you seem smart, Hiroki."

1525
02:18:31,000 --> 02:18:38,000
Cosmos: "You're sweet and kind, and I know you want the best for me, so I'll trust your judgment."

1526
02:18:38,000 --> 02:18:42,000
Cosmos: "I won't let anybody find out about us. I promise."

1527
02:18:42,000 --> 02:18:44,000
Hiroki: "Thank goodness..."

1528
02:18:44,000 --> 02:18:54,000
*I'm glad convincing Cosmos wasn't that hard, but I'm perturbed that I had to bother convincing her in the first place. Shouldn't this be common sense?*

1529
02:18:54,000 --> 02:18:59,000
*If her legions of fans find out about me, they'll tear me limb from limb!*

1530
02:18:59,000 --> 02:19:05,000
*Dating a celebrity might be every guy's dream, but it's a lot more hassle than it looks.*

1531
02:19:05,000 --> 02:19:07,000
*Popular girls are hard work...*

1532
02:19:07,000 --> 02:19:10,000
*Especially popular airheads like Cosmos!*

1533
02:19:10,000 --> 02:19:14,000
Hiroki: "H-Hey, Cosmos, um... I have a few questions."

1534
02:19:14,000 --> 02:19:17,000
Cosmos: "Yes, Hiroki? What is it, darling?"

1535
02:19:17,000 --> 02:19:22,000
Hiroki: "You said we were going to keep our relationship a secret, didn't you?"

1536
02:19:22,000 --> 02:19:24,000
Cosmos: "That's right."

1537
02:19:24,000 --> 02:19:28,000
Cosmos: "I want to tell everybody how much I love you..."

1538
02:19:28,000 --> 02:19:31,000
Cosmos: "But I'll keep quiet, for your sake!"

1539
02:19:31,000 --> 02:19:34,000
Cosmos: "You can trust me. I can keep a secret."

1540
02:19:34,000 --> 02:19:37,000
Hiroki: "I'm very glad to hear that, but... Uh..."

1541
02:19:37,000 --> 02:19:41,000
Hiroki: "W-We're not being very secretive right now!!!"

1542
02:19:41,000 --> 02:19:47,000
*Cosmos and I are walking through a crowded street, like any lovey-dovey couple might...*

1543
02:19:47,000 --> 02:19:55,000
*N-No, scratch that! No lovey-dovey couple would do what we're doing, unless they have some very specific kinks!*

1544
02:19:55,000 --> 02:20:06,000
*After our date in the café, Cosmos asked if we could go shopping together. I was happy to indulge her whims, under the caveat that she keeps quiet about this online.*

1545
02:20:06,000 --> 02:20:11,000
*She agreed readily enough, and I thought it'd be smooth sailing from thereon...*

1546
02:20:11,000 --> 02:20:12,000
*But I was mistaken!*

1547
02:20:12,000 --> 02:20:24,000
*Not five seconds after we'd exited the café, Cosmos swapped out her kitty ears for a pair of fake puppy ones, attached a tail to the back of her shorts, then knelt down on the ground!*

1548
02:20:24,000 --> 02:20:32,000
*She handed me a lead, which she had in her pocket (why was she carrying that around, exactly?) and clipped it about her neck.*

1549
02:20:32,000 --> 02:20:37,000
*Now, she's making me walk her about the street in public, just like a dog!*

1550
02:20:37,000 --> 02:20:39,000
*T-Talk about embarrassing...*

1551
02:20:39,000 --> 02:20:45,000
*I guess I could've refuted this weird suggestion of hers - though, to be fair, I did try.*

1552
02:20:45,000 --> 02:20:53,000
*I asked Cosmos blankly, eyes narrowed, what on earth she was doing - and she said she was trying to make me happy!*

1553
02:20:53,000 --> 02:21:02,000
Cosmos: "You're my boyfriend now, so I belong to you. You can do whatever you want with me. Won't you let me be your puppy? Wan."

1554
02:21:02,000 --> 02:21:08,000
*That's what she said - and she looked so earnest, I felt obliged to take hold of her leash!*

1555
02:21:08,000 --> 02:21:10,000
*I didn't want to make her cry!*

1556
02:21:10,000 --> 02:21:14,000
*At the time, I thought I was doing the gentlemanly thing...*

1557
02:21:14,000 --> 02:21:18,000
*But I'm courting a lot of stares (which is to be expected).*

1558
02:21:18,000 --> 02:21:28,000
*Middle-aged women give us a wide berth, their noses wrinkled, while a few high school students call words of encouragement and give us thumbs up.*

1559
02:21:28,000 --> 02:21:36,000
Pedestrian: "Hey, Kaede, look at that! I've seen guys walk their dogs, but I've never seen 'em walk their girlfriends before!"

1560
02:21:36,000 --> 02:21:39,000
Pedestrian 2: "D-Don't stare, Akira! It's rude!"

1561
02:21:39,000 --> 02:21:46,000
Pedestrian: "I can't help but stare! Haven't you ever thought of doing that with your main squeezes, Kaede?"

1562
02:21:46,000 --> 02:21:53,000
Pedestrian 2: "W-With Hiromi and Mieko? You must be kidding. They'd never agree to something so degrading!"

1563
02:21:53,000 --> 02:22:00,000
Pedestrian: "I dunno about that~ Didn't Hiromi dress up in a bunny girl costume for you at school?"

1564
02:22:00,000 --> 02:22:04,000
Pedestrian 2: "Wh-What? How'd you find out about that?!"

1565
02:22:04,000 --> 02:22:11,000
Pedestrian 3: "What a cute, well-behaved dog! I wonder I can get myself a pet that obedient, heheh~"

1566
02:22:11,000 --> 02:22:17,000
Pedestrian 4: "Do you think she knows any tricks? Maybe she can roll over, or shake paws!"

1567
02:22:17,000 --> 02:22:23,000
Pedestrian 5: "Hmph. I'm surrounded by degenerates. The youth of today are disgusting!"

1568
02:22:23,000 --> 02:22:29,000
*Oof. That comment (spoken by a sharp-tongued, eagle-eyed housewife) kind smarts...*

1569
02:22:29,000 --> 02:22:33,000
*But I guess it's to be expected. We are being pretty brazen.*

1570
02:22:33,000 --> 02:22:37,000
*I wouldn't be surprised somebody's called the police on us.*

1571
02:22:37,000 --> 02:22:40,000
*So much for keeping a low profile...*

1572
02:22:40,000 --> 02:22:46,000
Pedestrian 6: "What's society come to, eh? The world really has gone to the dogs - heheheh!"

1573
02:22:46,000 --> 02:22:52,000
Pedestrian: "Hey... Now that I'm looking at her more clearly, isn't that girl kind of familiar?"

1574
02:22:52,000 --> 02:22:54,000
Pedestrian 2: "Eh? She is?"

1575
02:22:54,000 --> 02:22:59,000
Pedestrian: "That's right. I'm sure I've seen her somewhere before."

1576
02:22:59,000 --> 02:23:03,000
*...Crap. This might be bad! We're going to get discovered!*

1577
02:23:03,000 --> 02:23:07,000
*I tug a Cosmos's lead, my palms slick with anxious sweat.*

1578
02:23:07,000 --> 02:23:10,000
Hiroki: "C-Come on, Cosmos. We have to go."

1579
02:23:10,000 --> 02:23:11,000
Cosmos: "But why?"

1580
02:23:11,000 --> 02:23:16,000
*Cosmos blinks at me, a hangdog (ha, ha) expression on her cute face.*

1581
02:23:16,000 --> 02:23:22,000
Cosmos: "We're making a lot of people happy. They're all looking at us, aren't they?"

1582
02:23:22,000 --> 02:23:27,000
Hiroki: "Th-They might be looking at us, but I don't know if that's a good thing!"

1583
02:23:27,000 --> 02:23:32,000
Hiroki: "In fact, I'm certain it's not! We must look like a pair of perverts!"

1584
02:23:32,000 --> 02:23:36,000
Cosmos: "There's nothing wrong with being perverted..."

1585
02:23:36,000 --> 02:23:41,000
*Cosmos wriggles her ass, which is barely contained by her booty shorts.*

1586
02:23:41,000 --> 02:23:48,000
Cosmos: "I've dressed up in naughtier outfits before. People didn't seem to mind then. In fact, they like it."

1587
02:23:48,000 --> 02:23:51,000
Cosmos: "I just want to make everybody smile..."

1588
02:23:51,000 --> 02:23:57,000
Hiroki: "They won't be smiling when they figure out who you are! We need to go, fast!"

1589
02:23:57,000 --> 02:24:09,000
*I give Cosmos's lead another sharp yank, desperate to escape - but I'm too slow! The penny must've dropped, because a few pedestrians are staring at us with newfound intrigue.*

1590
02:24:09,000 --> 02:24:12,000
Pedestrian: "That isn't Cosmos, is it?!"

1591
02:24:12,000 --> 02:24:16,000
Pedestrian 2: "C-Cosmos? The famous Rapidpounder? There's no way!"

1592
02:24:16,000 --> 02:24:20,000
Pedestrian 6: "That's Cosmos? I didn't know she had a boyfriend!"

1593
02:24:20,000 --> 02:24:24,000
Pedestrian 4: "That guy's one lucky son of a gun, whoever he is!"

1594
02:24:24,000 --> 02:24:27,000
Pedestrian 3: "Grrr... I'll knock his block off!"

1595
02:24:27,000 --> 02:24:30,000
Pedestrian 4: "How dare he do something so brazen?!"

1596
02:24:30,000 --> 02:24:32,000
Pedestrian 2: "He's the worst!"

1597
02:24:32,000 --> 02:24:35,000
Pedestrian 2: "I'd like to shake his hand!"

1598
02:24:35,000 --> 02:24:41,000
Pedestrian 4: "How dare he take our cute, lewd Venus away from us! He's unforgivable!!!!"

1599
02:24:41,000 --> 02:24:48,000
*...Well, shoot. I knew this was going to happen. This is precisely what I warned Cosmos about earlier!*

1600
02:24:48,000 --> 02:24:55,000
*The street is swimming with guys. They're glaring at us, bloodlust evident in their narrowed eyes.*

1601
02:24:55,000 --> 02:24:57,000
*A-Are they going to murder me?!*

1602
02:24:57,000 --> 02:25:06,000
*Farewell, cruel world! The twenty-nine years I lived weren't always happy, but I was rather attached to this mediocre life of mine!*

1603
02:25:06,000 --> 02:25:10,000
*At least I'll never have to see my hair turn gray! Sob, sob...*

1604
02:25:10,000 --> 02:25:19,000
Pedestrian 2: "N-Now, now. Maybe he's not her boyfriend, but her social media manager? I'm sure this is just a publicity stunt."

1605
02:25:19,000 --> 02:25:25,000
Pedestrian: "Oh, right! That's a good idea, Kaede. I guess he could be a photographer..."

1606
02:25:25,000 --> 02:25:29,000
Pedestrian 2: "I wonder if he's got a camera in that bag of this?"

1607
02:25:29,000 --> 02:25:34,000
Pedestrian: "I bet Seiji'd know if he was here. Isn't he into taking photos?"

1608
02:25:34,000 --> 02:25:37,000
Pedestrian 2: "What? I thought he was into space..."

1609
02:25:37,000 --> 02:25:48,000
*The voices of these two high school students (Akira and Kaede, are they called?) draw me out of my panicked slump. I stare at my saviors, eyes wide, and cry out...*

1610
02:25:48,000 --> 02:25:55,000
Hiroki: "Yes, that's right! I-I'm Cosmos's photographer! We came here to do a photo shoot – look!"

1611
02:25:55,000 --> 02:26:02,000
*I open my shoulder bag, then draw out my camera, relieved that I carry it around with me so frequently.*

1612
02:26:02,000 --> 02:26:05,000
Pedestrian 3: "Ah... So that's who this guy is."

1613
02:26:05,000 --> 02:26:09,000
Pedestrian 4: "I guess he really isn't Cosmos's boyfriend!"

1614
02:26:09,000 --> 02:26:15,000
Pedestrian 5: "Well, duh! Why would a gorgeous girl like Cosmos date a boring guy like that?"

1615
02:26:15,000 --> 02:26:19,000
Pedestrian 3: "You're not wrong! She could have anybody she wants!"

1616
02:26:19,000 --> 02:26:23,000
Pedestrian 6: "I can't believe we were getting so worried! Hahaha!"

1617
02:26:23,000 --> 02:26:28,000
Hiroki: "Y-Yeah, that's pretty funny. As if Cosmos would ever like me..."

1618
02:26:28,000 --> 02:26:35,000
*Slowly but surely, the bloodlust in the air evaporates. It looks like these guys are buying my excuse!*

1619
02:26:35,000 --> 02:26:40,000
*Why bother telling the truth? Lying is so much easier! Ha ha ha ha-*

1620
02:26:40,000 --> 02:26:45,000
Cosmos: "Huh? But I do like you, Hiroki. Don't you remember? We've already had-"

1621
02:26:45,000 --> 02:26:48,000
Hiroki: "A-Alright, that's enough out of you!"

1622
02:26:48,000 --> 02:26:54,000
*I give Cosmos's lead another sharp tug, before she can say anything incriminating.*

1623
02:26:54,000 --> 02:26:58,000
Hiroki: "Let's go! We need to get this photo shoot underway!"

1624
02:26:58,000 --> 02:27:02,000
*I drag Cosmos along behind me, my heart hammering all the while.*

1625
02:27:02,000 --> 02:27:06,000
*Cosmos might be cute, but she's dumber than a bag of spanners!*

1626
02:27:06,000 --> 02:27:10,000
*Is this what Marina meant when she told me to watch out?*

1627
02:27:10,000 --> 02:27:14,000
*If I'm not careful, Cosmos really might end up killing me!*

1628
02:27:14,000 --> 02:27:19,000
*My first date with Cosmos progresses more or less smoothly after that hiccup.*

1629
02:27:19,000 --> 02:27:29,000
*I convince Cosmos to put the collar and the lead away. Then, the pair of us spend a relatively relaxing evening walking through the streets, shopping.*

1630
02:27:29,000 --> 02:27:32,000
