1631
02:27:32,000 --> 02:27:36,000
*Or, to be more precise, she invites herself over to my home.*

1632
02:27:36,000 --> 02:27:45,000
*I didn't want things to move too quickly (not on our first date), but Cosmos isn't one to care about silly social norms like that.*

1633
02:27:45,000 --> 02:27:54,000
Cosmos: "You're my boyfriend now, so I want to see what your house is like. Won't you let me come in, Hiroki? I promise I'll behave."

1634
02:27:54,000 --> 02:27:59,000
*I was dead-set on rejecting her, but her earnest pleas made me reconsider.*

1635
02:27:59,000 --> 02:28:06,000
*Cosmos's pouting face is super effective against my fragile self-control. She can twist my arm in an instant!*

1636
02:28:06,000 --> 02:28:17,000
*Fortunately, Cosmos is quite an easy-to-please house guest. She doesn't turn her nose up at my home, unglamorous though it is, and she even helps me tidy up.*

1637
02:28:17,000 --> 02:28:24,000
*We watch TV together in comfortable silence. Then, when our show's over, she helps me prepare dinner.*

1638
02:28:24,000 --> 02:28:31,000
*I was a little worried about Cosmos's cooking skills, but she's surprisingly efficient in the kitchen.*

1639
02:28:31,000 --> 02:28:40,000
Cosmos: "I like making lots of different kinds of food. Sometimes, I film myself eating it. My ASMR MyTube channel is very popular."

1640
02:28:40,000 --> 02:28:44,000
Cosmos: "I particularly like slurping up somen noodles."

1641
02:28:44,000 --> 02:28:47,000
*That's what Cosmos told me, at least.*

1642
02:28:47,000 --> 02:28:52,000
*I guess she's not just a Rapidpounder - she's also an up-and-coming MyTube star.*

1643
02:28:52,000 --> 02:29:01,000
*She doesn't have as many MyTube subs as she does Rapidpound followers, but some of her videos have upwards of 10 million views!*

1644
02:29:01,000 --> 02:29:06,000
*Cosmos might not be a traditional celeb, but she's famous in her own right.*

1645
02:29:06,000 --> 02:29:10,000
*She has legions of adoring fans all across the internet...*

1646
02:29:10,000 --> 02:29:13,000
*But she's decided to pledge her heart to me.*

1647
02:29:13,000 --> 02:29:16,000
*That thought is more than a little humbling.*

1648
02:29:16,000 --> 02:29:22,000
*It's been a while since I dated anybody, so this all feels new to me, but I'm trying my best.*

1649
02:29:22,000 --> 02:29:29,000
*Once we've finished dinner, I send Cosmos home. I have to go to bed early so I can be up in time for work.*

1650
02:29:29,000 --> 02:29:37,000
*I have a quick shower, change into my pajamas, then set my hateful alarm clock. Then, I slide into bed and close my eyes.*

1651
02:29:37,000 --> 02:29:44,000
*I must've been exhausted, because fatigue washes over me like a tidal wave the moment my head meets my pillow.*

1652
02:29:44,000 --> 02:29:47,000
*I yawn deeply, my eyes screwed shut...*

1653
02:29:47,000 --> 02:29:52,000
*And then, less than five seconds later, I fall into a deep, dreamless sleep.*

1654
02:29:52,000 --> 02:30:00,000
*The rest of the week passes by in a blur. I go to work every day, then spend my evenings either with Cosmos or Marina.*

1655
02:30:00,000 --> 02:30:12,000
*As a guy who hasn't dated in years, it's hard to get accustomed to all this female attention. It's a bit overwhelming, to be honest, but their joint affection is hardly unwelcome.*

1656
02:30:12,000 --> 02:30:15,000
*In fact, I've never felt more loved.*

1657
02:30:15,000 --> 02:30:24,000
*Dating two women at once is a bit difficult (particularly when both women are celebs), but I've never been one to balk at a challenge!*

1658
02:30:24,000 --> 02:30:26,000
*And, speaking of challenges...*

1659
02:30:26,000 --> 02:30:32,000
Hiroki: "I'm finally here. I've come to settle the score with Ikue Ayu once and for all!"

1660
02:30:32,000 --> 02:30:39,000
Hiroki: "We got off on the wrong foot during our first meeting, but I can't afford to back down now!"

1661
02:30:39,000 --> 02:30:45,000
Hiroki: "I'm only here because of Marina. She gave me this chance, and she saved my job."

1662
02:30:45,000 --> 02:30:48,000
Hiroki: "Now, it's time to repay her."

1663
02:30:48,000 --> 02:30:51,000
Hiroki: "It's time to face the music!"

1664
02:30:51,000 --> 02:30:57,000
*It's Saturday, and I've come all the way to Okinawa so I can photograph Ikue Ayu.*

1665
02:30:57,000 --> 02:31:06,000
*I set off early this morning, on a flight paid for by Marina. The flight took about three hours, and it was relatively comfortable.*

1666
02:31:06,000 --> 02:31:14,000
*Marina spared no expenses, and I found myself sitting in first class, with spacious chairs and more than enough leg room.*

1667
02:31:14,000 --> 02:31:22,000
*I've flown a couple of times before (it's a necessity for my job), but I've had unilaterally miserable experiences.*

1668
02:31:22,000 --> 02:31:30,000
*The lack of leg room is the biggest factor in my flight-induced misery. Being over six feet tall can be quite a burden.*

1669
02:31:30,000 --> 02:31:32,000
*My legs are just too long!*

1670
02:31:32,000 --> 02:31:35,000
*...Oh well. The flight's over and done with now.*

1671
02:31:35,000 --> 02:31:41,000
*I was met at the airport by a chauffeur (Ayu's, presumably), who drove me to this beach.*

1672
02:31:41,000 --> 02:31:52,000
*The chauffeur dropped me off here, then left, after telling me to look for Ayu on my own. That's precisely what I'm doing right now, though I haven't had much luck.*

1673
02:31:52,000 --> 02:31:55,000
*I can't find hide nor hair of Ayu anywhere!*

1674
02:31:55,000 --> 02:32:02,000
*I'm not sure where I should start looking, and my indecision's not helped by how huge this beach is.*

1675
02:32:02,000 --> 02:32:08,000
*It's a vast stretch of pure white sand that sparkles beneath the warm sun like sugar.*

1676
02:32:08,000 --> 02:32:15,000
*The turquoise waves lap against the shore, breaking into creamy foam, and palm trees sway in the wind.*

1677
02:32:15,000 --> 02:32:20,000
*Seagulls caw above my head, and when I inhale I can smell the salt in the air.*

1678
02:32:20,000 --> 02:32:25,000
*A warm, gentle breeze rumples my hair and tugs at the hem of my shirt.*

1679
02:32:25,000 --> 02:32:31,000
*Other than the undulating waves and the call of the birds, it's almost completely silent.*

1680
02:32:31,000 --> 02:32:38,000
*Since this is a private beach, there are no surfing men, sunbathing women, or screaming children.*

1681
02:32:38,000 --> 02:32:47,000
*Neither are there are any stray volleyballs, discarded food wrappers, or abandoned buckets and spades to mar the perfect landscape.*

1682
02:32:47,000 --> 02:32:57,000
*This beach is so vast and so still, it feels almost completely cut off from the rest of the world. It's a small slice of paradise: a veritable shangri-la.*

1683
02:32:57,000 --> 02:33:00,000
Hiroki: "Is this really how the other half live...?"

1684
02:33:00,000 --> 02:33:03,000
Hiroki: "I've been missing out my whole life."

1685
02:33:03,000 --> 02:33:10,000
*I've been to the beach before, of course. I went a few times during the heady summer days of my youth.*

1686
02:33:10,000 --> 02:33:20,000
*My parents took me to the beach when I was a child. Then, when I got older, I took a few trips with high school friends, and later my girlfriend.*

1687
02:33:20,000 --> 02:33:28,000
*It's been years since I was last able to get the time off work (or the motivation) to go to the beach, though...*

1688
02:33:28,000 --> 02:33:33,000
*And I've certainly never been to a beach as beautiful as this one.*

1689
02:33:33,000 --> 02:33:35,000
*I can't help but be impressed.*

1690
02:33:35,000 --> 02:33:39,000
Hiroki: "How rich is Ayu anyway, if she can afford all this?"

1691
02:33:39,000 --> 02:33:47,000
*It's almost unthinkable that this huge expanse of unsullied land could belong to one person. Ayu's incredible...*

1692
02:33:47,000 --> 02:33:52,000
Hiroki: "I wonder if that's why she asked me to photograph her here?"

1693
02:33:52,000 --> 02:33:55,000
Hiroki: "Maybe she was trying to show off..."

1694
02:33:55,000 --> 02:34:01,000
*It's not like she needs to bother, though. I think she's impressive enough as it is.*

1695
02:34:01,000 --> 02:34:06,000
*Why would a famous idol like Ikue Ayu worry about my opinion, anyway?*

1696
02:34:06,000 --> 02:34:10,000
Hiroki: "Is she trying to get one over on her succubus sisters...?"

1697
02:34:10,000 --> 02:34:14,000
Hiroki: "That sounds like the sort of petty thing she might do."

1698
02:34:14,000 --> 02:34:20,000
Hiroki: "Well, I'm not going to find her if I keep standing here. I need to start making tracks."

1699
02:34:20,000 --> 02:34:23,000
Hiroki: "Operation Locate Ayu is underway!"

1700
02:34:23,000 --> 02:34:28,000
*To my relief, it doesn't take all that long to locate my absent host.*

1701
02:34:28,000 --> 02:34:37,000
*I wander the beach for a few minutes, hands jammed into my pockets, content to enjoy the warm sunshine and the sound of the rolling waves.*

1702
02:34:37,000 --> 02:34:42,000
*I turn my head this way and that, shielding my eyeballs from the sun.*

1703
02:34:42,000 --> 02:34:52,000
*It's a little after midday, and the heat gets more and more intense with every footstep. I can feel it burning the nape of my neck and I pause, wincing.*

1704
02:34:52,000 --> 02:34:57,000
*I pause in my travails, taking refuge beneath the shade of a nearby palm tree...*

1705
02:34:57,000 --> 02:34:58,000
Hiroki: "Ah...!"

1706
02:34:58,000 --> 02:35:04,000
*And that's when I finally spot her, half-concealed beneath a cluster of swaying palms.*

1707
02:35:04,000 --> 02:35:06,000
*It's Ikue Ayu, in the flesh.*

1708
02:35:06,000 --> 02:35:14,000
*She looks far more "real" than she did when I saw her onstage, surrounded by screaming fans and blinking lights...*

1709
02:35:14,000 --> 02:35:17,000
*But there's something "off" about this picture.*

1710
02:35:17,000 --> 02:35:21,000
*In fact, there's a whole bunch of stuff that's "off" about this!*

1711
02:35:21,000 --> 02:35:26,000
*Ayu is reclining in what appears to be an inflatable paddling pool.*

1712
02:35:26,000 --> 02:35:33,000
*She's wearing a very tight swimsuit made of a golden, metallic material that winks in the sunlight.*

1713
02:35:33,000 --> 02:35:41,000
*Her hair is tied back in her signature twintails, and a pair of dark sunglasses are balanced on the bridge of her nose.*

1714
02:35:41,000 --> 02:35:45,000
*So far, there's nothing so unusual about this scene...*

1715
02:35:45,000 --> 02:35:49,000
*But the contents of her paddling pool are downright bizarre.*

1716
02:35:49,000 --> 02:35:53,000
*It's so bizarre, in fact, I have to do a double take.*

1717
02:35:53,000 --> 02:36:00,000
*I rub my eyes and pinch my cheek. This must be some sort of hallucination, brought about by the sultry heat...*

1718
02:36:00,000 --> 02:36:04,000
*But, no. The scene before me doesn't waver. It must be real!*

1719
02:36:04,000 --> 02:36:11,000
*Ikue Ayu, Japan's most famous idol, is reclining in a plastic padding pool filled to the brim with money.*

1720
02:36:11,000 --> 02:36:17,000
*It's not just loose change, either. She's steeped in what appear to be ¥10,000 notes!*

1721
02:36:17,000 --> 02:36:22,000
*It must take a huge amount of banknotes to fill a pool of this size.*

1722
02:36:22,000 --> 02:36:31,000
*I'm not sure how much money is crammed into that plastic pool, but it must be easily over several hundred million - maybe even a billion!*

1723
02:36:31,000 --> 02:36:35,000
*That's more money than I've ever seen in my whole life...*

1724
02:36:35,000 --> 02:36:39,000
*And Ayu is luxuriating in it with nary a care in the world!*

1725
02:36:39,000 --> 02:36:50,000
*A few loose, crumpled notes lie on the sandy dunes around the pool. Since there's a bit of a breeze, some of the notes must've blown away, but Ayu doesn't care.*

1726
02:36:50,000 --> 02:36:58,000
*Neither does she seem to care that the weight of her firm, plump thighs must be crumpling hundreds of these notes.*

1727
02:36:58,000 --> 02:37:02,000
*Is this money nothing more than loose change to her?!*

1728
02:37:02,000 --> 02:37:09,000
*She could feed hundreds of starving people with this money, but she's using it as nothing more than a prop!*

1729
02:37:09,000 --> 02:37:15,000
*I've never been one to get worked up about social issues, but this is kind of pissing me off.*

1730
02:37:15,000 --> 02:37:20,000
*If this was 18th century France, Ayu's head would be rolling right now!*

1731
02:37:20,000 --> 02:37:22,000
Hiroki: "Ah... I, uh..."

1732
02:37:22,000 --> 02:37:30,000
*I try to greet Ayu, but this lascivious display of wealth has thrown me. I can only gawp at her, incoherent and confused.*

1733
02:37:30,000 --> 02:37:37,000
*Fortunately, these noises of mine seem to be enough to announce my presence... and to convey my feelings.*

1734
02:37:37,000 --> 02:37:43,000
*Ayu pulls up her sunglasses and glances over to me, a smug smile on her pretty face.*

1735
02:37:43,000 --> 02:37:46,000
Ayu: "My, my. Look at what the cat dragged in."

1736
02:37:46,000 --> 02:37:49,000
Ayu: "You're Mr. Ogasawara, aren't you?"

1737
02:37:49,000 --> 02:37:53,000
Hiroki: "Th-That's right, um... Ogasawara Hiroki, at your service."

1738
02:37:53,000 --> 02:37:54,000
Ayu: "Hmmm."

1739
02:37:54,000 --> 02:37:56,000
*Ayu purses her lips together.*

1740
02:37:56,000 --> 02:38:02,000
Ayu: ""Ogasawara" is such a long family name. It's not very elegant, either. I don't like it."

1741
02:38:02,000 --> 02:38:04,000
Hiroki: "I, um... I'm sorry?"

1742
02:38:04,000 --> 02:38:14,000
Ayu: "I can't exactly call you "Hiroki", though. That would suggest some level of closeness between us, but that couldn't be further from the truth!"

1743
02:38:14,000 --> 02:38:20,000
Ayu: "I'd sooner die than befriend a gangly man like you, with such a tragic fashion sense!"

1744
02:38:20,000 --> 02:38:29,000
Ayu: "Your watch isn't even a designer brand, and your pants are so scruffy! Your hair is sticking up, and those glasses are tragic."

1745
02:38:29,000 --> 02:38:32,000
*Ayu turns her nose up in the air, unimpressed.*

1746
02:38:32,000 --> 02:38:40,000
Ayu: "I thought you would've made a bit of effort before you came to see me! I'm Ikue Ayu, after all! I'm famous!"

1747
02:38:40,000 --> 02:38:42,000
Ayu: "Don't you know who I am?"

1748
02:38:42,000 --> 02:38:46,000
Hiroki: "I... I-I'm very aware of who you are, Miss Ikue..."

1749
02:38:46,000 --> 02:38:55,000
*In fact, I'm more intimately acquainted with her than most. I still can't forget the sensation of her body pressed against mine...*

1750
02:38:55,000 --> 02:38:58,000
*Or the sharp sting on my cheek as she slapped me.*

1751
02:38:58,000 --> 02:39:08,000
*I wonder if she remembers that? If she does, she's made no indication of it. Maybe she wants to forget that embarrassing chapter of her life.*

1752
02:39:08,000 --> 02:39:18,000
*Could that be the reason for this extravagant display? Is she hoping to dazzle me with so much luxury I'll forget about our first encounter too?*

1753
02:39:18,000 --> 02:39:21,000
Ayu: "Hmph. Pathetic. Absolutely pathetic."

1754
02:39:21,000 --> 02:39:26,000
*Ayu shakes her head. Her long twintails flutter in the tropical breeze.*

1755
02:39:26,000 --> 02:39:33,000
Ayu: "I can see you and I will never get along. Compared to me, you are nothing more than an insect."

1756
02:39:33,000 --> 02:39:36,000
Ayu: "I have no desire to speak to you..."

1757
02:39:36,000 --> 02:39:45,000
Ayu: "But I promised Marina I would do this, and I owe her a few favors. She's scary when she gets mad, so I'll grin and bear it."

1758
02:39:45,000 --> 02:39:52,000
Ayu: "As an idol, it's my job to smile,  though my fans are so disgusting they make me want to hurl!"

1759
02:39:52,000 --> 02:39:54,000
*...Wow. Talk about direct.*

1760
02:39:54,000 --> 02:40:01,000
*I never quite bought Ayu's "cutesey" act, but I didn't think she'd be so upfront about loathing her fanbase!*

1761
02:40:01,000 --> 02:40:11,000
*If wasn't for those "disgusting" fans that she maligns, Ayu wouldn't be able to kick back on a private beach in a paddling pool full of money!*

1762
02:40:11,000 --> 02:40:14,000
*A bit of gratitude wouldn't kill her, would it?*

1763
02:40:14,000 --> 02:40:21,000
Ayu: "This is for business, not pleasure, so I'll behave with the dignity befitting of a true pro."

1764
02:40:21,000 --> 02:40:26,000
Ayu: "From now on, you'll be my cameraman. I hope you're up to the task."

1765
02:40:26,000 --> 02:40:29,000
Hiroki: "R-Right...! I'll do my best!"

1766
02:40:29,000 --> 02:40:30,000
Ayu: "You'd better."

1767
02:40:30,000 --> 02:40:31,000
*Ayu's lip curls.*

1768
02:40:31,000 --> 02:40:40,000
Ayu: "I can't understand why Marina was so adamant that I let you take my photograph, though. You already had your chance, and you blew it."

1769
02:40:40,000 --> 02:40:44,000
*So, she does remember our first meeting. I figured as much.*

1770
02:40:44,000 --> 02:40:53,000
Ayu: "My obnoxious big sister seems quite taken with you. She kept telling me that you were a good, kind man, with a most delectable scent."

1771
02:40:53,000 --> 02:40:56,000
Ayu: "I'll admit, your aroma is quite appealing..."

1772
02:40:56,000 --> 02:41:05,000
Ayu: "But you're no looker. Everything about you, from your fashion sense to your posture to your style of speaking, is a huge turn-off!"

1773
02:41:05,000 --> 02:41:07,000
Ayu: "You're not attractive at all!"

1774
02:41:07,000 --> 02:41:14,000
Ayu: "Why, then, is Marina giving you such preferential treatment? What in the world does she see in you..."

1775
02:41:14,000 --> 02:41:18,000
Ayu: "And why did I feel so hot during our first meeting?"

1776
02:41:18,000 --> 02:41:24,000
*Ayu mumbles this last question under her breath, more to herself than anybody else.*

1777
02:41:24,000 --> 02:41:32,000
*I don't think she means for me to overhear her, but she's not being particularly subtle, and I do all the same.*

1778
02:41:32,000 --> 02:41:36,000
*How am I supposed to respond to that? Should I apologize?*

1779
02:41:36,000 --> 02:41:39,000
*But Marina scolded me for apologizing too much.*

1780
02:41:39,000 --> 02:41:42,000
*Maybe I should have more faith in myself.*

1781
02:41:42,000 --> 02:41:51,000
Hiroki: "So, Miss Ikue... Is it alright if we start the photo shoot? I have my equipment with me. I'm ready to go whenever you are."

1782
02:41:51,000 --> 02:41:52,000
Ayu: "Fine, fine."

1783
02:41:52,000 --> 02:41:54,000
*Ayu waves one hand carelessly.*

1784
02:41:54,000 --> 02:42:00,000
Ayu: "Start snapping away. I don't care. The sooner we get this over with, the better."

1785
02:42:00,000 --> 02:42:02,000
Hiroki: "I couldn't agree more..."

1786
02:42:02,000 --> 02:42:12,000
*Ayu might be hot (her tight swimsuit is struggling to contain the heft of her huge melons!), but her personality leaves something to be desired.*

1787
02:42:12,000 --> 02:42:24,000
*I wouldn't mind so much if she was just vain and materialistic (I've worked with more difficult clients than her before), but her two-faced nature makes her even more aggravating.*

1788
02:42:24,000 --> 02:42:29,000
*She's nothing at all like the adorable image she projects to her fans!*

1789
02:42:29,000 --> 02:42:36,000
*If they knew what their idol really thought of them, I doubt they'd be willing to support her much longer.*

1790
02:42:36,000 --> 02:42:39,000
*Show biz is such a sketchy industry...*

1791
02:42:39,000 --> 02:42:47,000
*I get my camera out of my bag and start adjusting the lens. I hold it to my face, zooming in on Ayu's buxom body, then pause.*

1792
02:42:47,000 --> 02:42:49,000
Hiroki: "Uh, Miss Ikue..."

1793
02:42:49,000 --> 02:42:51,000
Ayu: "Yes? What is it, cameraman?"

1794
02:42:51,000 --> 02:42:59,000
Hiroki: "I was just wondering, uh... Do you really want me to take photos of you lying in a pool filled with money?"

1795
02:42:59,000 --> 02:43:08,000
Ayu: "But of course! That's why I set this all up! I wouldn't have bothered if I hadn't known you were coming. I don't like wasting time."

1796
02:43:08,000 --> 02:43:09,000
*Ayu snorts.*

1797
02:43:09,000 --> 02:43:12,000
Ayu: "You're not very bright, are you?"

1798
02:43:12,000 --> 02:43:15,000
*This barb makes me grit my teeth together.*

1799
02:43:15,000 --> 02:43:17,000
*This girl is seriously annoying...!*

1800
02:43:17,000 --> 02:43:22,000
*Her moody scowls are bad enough, but this smug smirk of hers is even worse!*

1801
02:43:22,000 --> 02:43:27,000
Ayu: "I thought I'd show the world just how incredible I really am."

1802
02:43:27,000 --> 02:43:38,000
Ayu: "It doesn't matter that Cosmos has two million more Rapidpound followers than I do! I'm the real celebrity here, and I have more than enough cash to prove it!"

1803
02:43:38,000 --> 02:43:50,000
Ayu: "I won't let anybody look down on me, or mock me, or insult me! I might be an idol, but I've worked hard! I clawed my way to the top, and this is where I intend to stay!"

1804
02:43:50,000 --> 02:43:53,000
Ayu: "If money is power, I must be invincible!"

1805
02:43:53,000 --> 02:44:00,000
Ayu: "So, what do you think? Are you impressed? You must be impressed! Who wouldn't be impressed? Hohohoho!"

1806
02:44:00,000 --> 02:44:01,000
Hiroki: "Uh..."

1807
02:44:01,000 --> 02:44:04,000
*I feel a bead of sweat trickling down my cheek.*

1808
02:44:04,000 --> 02:44:11,000
*I never would've thought it of a star like Ikue Ayu, but she must have a serious chip of her shoulder.*

1809
02:44:11,000 --> 02:44:21,000
Hiroki: "I don't think you need to go to such lengths to prove your worth. Everybody knows you're successful, without you flaunting your wealth like this."

1810
02:44:21,000 --> 02:44:27,000
Hiroki: "In fact, I think posing in a tub full of money would make your fans turn against you..."

1811
02:44:27,000 --> 02:44:29,000
Ayu: "Pah! What do you know!"

1812
02:44:29,000 --> 02:44:31,000
*Ayu turns her nose up in the air.*

1813
02:44:31,000 --> 02:44:43,000
Ayu: "In this world, money is everything! I have a lot of money - much more than Cosmos, or even Marina - so I must be a queen! My authority is unshakable! Bow down before me!"

1814
02:44:43,000 --> 02:44:48,000
Hiroki: "I can't bow down right now. I'm supposed to be taking your photo..."

1815
02:44:48,000 --> 02:44:54,000
Ayu: "Then do it! Capture my beauty, right here and now! That's an order, peasant!"

1816
02:44:54,000 --> 02:45:00,000
*So, I've been downgraded from "cameraman" to "peasant". What's next? Serf? Slave?*

1817
02:45:00,000 --> 02:45:02,000
*I'm pondering this, when...*

1818
02:45:02,000 --> 02:45:03,000
Ayu: "Kyaaa...?!"

1819
02:45:03,000 --> 02:45:07,000
*Ayu jolts, her eyes widening to comical proportions.*

1820
02:45:07,000 --> 02:45:15,000
*All of her smug self-confidence is gone. Now, she looks like a little girl, embarrassed after being caught pilfering cookies.*

1821
02:45:15,000 --> 02:45:22,000
*I gather my senses about me (a more difficult task then it sounds), and rush to Ayu's side in alarm.*

1822
02:45:22,000 --> 02:45:26,000
Hiroki: "Are you alright, Ayu? Did something happen?"

1823
02:45:26,000 --> 02:45:27,000
Ayu: "Y-Yes, I, um..."

1824
02:45:27,000 --> 02:45:30,000
Ayu: "I wasn't paying attention, and... Well..."

1825
02:45:30,000 --> 02:45:41,000
*Shyly, Japan's number one idol holds up the finger of her right hand for my inspection. Its tip is swollen pink, and its been bisected horizontally with a hairline cut.*

1826
02:45:41,000 --> 02:45:45,000
*I know what this is, even before Ayu's tearful confession.*

1827
02:45:45,000 --> 02:45:47,000
Ayu: "M-Mr. Cameraman..."

1828
02:45:47,000 --> 02:45:49,000
Ayu: "I think I have a papercut!"

1829
02:45:49,000 --> 02:45:52,000
Hiroki: "Alright... That just about does it."

1830
02:45:52,000 --> 02:45:57,000
*I sigh, wiping a few beads of sweat from my forehead, then examine my handiwork.*

1831
02:45:57,000 --> 02:46:01,000
*I managed to salvage most of the money from Ayu's paddling pool.*

1832
