Ayu: "No, I'm not!"

2023
03:01:08,000 --> 03:01:13,000
*Ayu counters shrilly, but her arms wind about my neck more tightly than before.*

2024
03:01:13,000 --> 03:01:16,000
*I-If this keeps up, she really might choke me...!*

2025
03:01:16,000 --> 03:01:26,000
*Cosmos has control of my right side. My arm's being engulfed by the impressive valley of her breasts, and I'm afraid I'll never be able to extricate it.*

2026
03:01:26,000 --> 03:01:36,000
*Ayu, meanwhile, has taken hold of my left. Her arms are looped greedily about my arms like those of a small child grasping at a favorite toy.*

2027
03:01:36,000 --> 03:01:42,000
*These girls are both shorter than I am, despite their heels, but they're surprisingly strong...*

2028
03:01:42,000 --> 03:01:48,000
*They're gripping me so hard my arms feel numb! I'm afraid my bones are going to splinter!*

2029
03:01:48,000 --> 03:01:56,000
*Marina wasn't kidding when she said succubi had more stamina than your regular person. They're way too powerful!*

2030
03:01:56,000 --> 03:02:01,000
Ayu: "I'm not clinging to Hiroki because I like him or anything, i-idiot!"

2031
03:02:01,000 --> 03:02:09,000
*...Ah. Now Ayu's realized there's no way she can deny Cosmos's claims, I guess she's decided to change tack. Clever.*

2032
03:02:09,000 --> 03:02:17,000
Ayu: "I'm clinging to him because he's my cameraman! We were in the middle of a shoot, which you so rudely interrupted!"

2033
03:02:17,000 --> 03:02:19,000
Ayu: "Now, relinquish him at once!"

2034
03:02:19,000 --> 03:02:25,000
Cosmos: "I won't. Hiroki agreed to be my boyfriend before he became your cameraman, so there."

2035
03:02:25,000 --> 03:02:26,000
Ayu: "Wh-Why, you..."

2036
03:02:26,000 --> 03:02:28,000
*Ayu glowers at Cosmos.*

2037
03:02:28,000 --> 03:02:37,000
Ayu: "Stop acting so impertinent! Don't think you can boss me around just because you have a few more followers on Rapidpound than I do!"

2038
03:02:37,000 --> 03:02:41,000
Cosmos: "I have two million more followers than you do."

2039
03:02:41,000 --> 03:02:45,000
Ayu: "Eeek! Don't say it, don't say it! Nobody likes a show-off!"

2040
03:02:45,000 --> 03:02:50,000
*Geez. This is a prime example of "the pot calling the kettle black".*

2041
03:02:50,000 --> 03:02:52,000
*Ayu's such a hypocrite!*

2042
03:02:52,000 --> 03:03:03,000
*I'm tempted to call her out on this, but she's still talking. Her shrill voices cuts through the air like a scythe, her chest pushed even more firmly against my arm.*

2043
03:03:03,000 --> 03:03:10,000
Ayu: "Who cares how many followers you have? I'm still older than you! You should respect my wishes!"

2044
03:03:10,000 --> 03:03:14,000
Ayu: "Why are you even here? Who told you I'd be here?!"

2045
03:03:14,000 --> 03:03:18,000
Cosmos: "Marina did. She told me about your photo shoot."

2046
03:03:18,000 --> 03:03:25,000
Cosmos: "I was afraid you'd try to seduce my boyfriend, so I came to see you. I know what you're like."

2047
03:03:25,000 --> 03:03:31,000
Cosmos: "I don't trust you, Ayu. You're a bad girl. You always want the things I have."

2048
03:03:31,000 --> 03:03:33,000
Cosmos: "You're so jealous..."

2049
03:03:33,000 --> 03:03:39,000
Ayu: "J-Jealous? Who said I was jealous? I'm not jealous! I don't like Hiroki one little bit!"

2050
03:03:39,000 --> 03:03:41,000
Cosmos: "Then let go of him."

2051
03:03:41,000 --> 03:03:44,000
Ayu: "Only if you let go of him first!"

2052
03:03:44,000 --> 03:03:46,000
Cosmos: "I won't. I love him."

2053
03:03:46,000 --> 03:03:52,000
Ayu: "And I'd love it if he could finish up my photo shoot without you distracting him!"

2054
03:03:52,000 --> 03:04:01,000
*Ayu tugs my left arm, while Cosmos tugs my right. They're both pulling so hard, I'm afraid my limbs will pop clean out their sockets!*

2055
03:04:01,000 --> 03:04:05,000
*Then, my career as a photographer will be well truly scuppered!*

2056
03:04:05,000 --> 03:04:08,000
*Is there any way to make them stop?!*

2057
03:04:08,000 --> 03:04:10,000
*Tell Cosmos to let go.":

2058
03:04:10,000 --> 03:04:14,000
Hiroki: "Cosmos, please... Let go... You're hurting me!"

2059
03:04:14,000 --> 03:04:18,000
Ayu: "Yeah, Cosmos! Let go! Hiroki belongs to me right now!"

2060
03:04:18,000 --> 03:04:23,000
Cosmos: "No, he does not. He is my boyfriend. You have no right to touch him!"

2061
03:04:23,000 --> 03:04:27,000
*...And my request has been completely ignored. Very cool.*

2062
03:04:27,000 --> 03:04:28,000
*Tell Ayu to let go.":

2063
03:04:28,000 --> 03:04:33,000
Ayu: "What? Why are you me to let go but not Cosmos? I weigh far less than her!"

2064
03:04:33,000 --> 03:04:39,000
Ayu: "She eats junk food and gorges on snacks every day, while I keep my body fit and trim!"

2065
03:04:39,000 --> 03:04:47,000
Ayu: "If anybody should relinquish their hold on you, it's that tub of icecream, chocolate, cookies, and churros!"

2066
03:04:47,000 --> 03:04:51,000
Cosmos: "There's nothing wrong with churros. They taste good."

2067
03:04:51,000 --> 03:04:57,000
Cosmos: "You are very sad, Ayu, to not know this. Your life must be horribly empty."

2068
03:04:57,000 --> 03:05:01,000
Cosmos: "Is that why you're clinging so hard to Hiroki?"

2069
03:05:01,000 --> 03:05:05,000
Ayu: "O-Of course not, you moron - and I'm not clinging!"

2070
03:05:05,000 --> 03:05:10,000
Ayu: "You're the one who's being too rough! You have no sense of moderation!"

2071
03:05:10,000 --> 03:05:16,000
Ayu: "That's why you upload so many skanky photos online! You just can't help yourself!"

2072
03:05:16,000 --> 03:05:18,000
Cosmos: "I am not a skank!"

2073
03:05:18,000 --> 03:05:22,000
*Aaand it looks like my request has been ignored. Amazing.*

2074
03:05:22,000 --> 03:05:24,000
*Tell them both to let go.":

2075
03:05:24,000 --> 03:05:29,000
Hiroki: "G-Girls, please... You don't need to fight. Please, let go-"

2076
03:05:29,000 --> 03:05:30,000
Ayu: "Oh, shut up!"

2077
03:05:30,000 --> 03:05:33,000
*Ayu, being Ayu, completely ignores my pleas.*

2078
03:05:33,000 --> 03:05:36,000
*I'm not sure what I expected, really.*

2079
03:05:36,000 --> 03:05:38,000
*Why did I even bother?*

2080
03:05:38,000 --> 03:05:41,000
Ayu: "I don't even know why you like Hiroki!"

2081
03:05:41,000 --> 03:05:47,000
Ayu: "You've always had strange tastes, but I didn't think you were quite this weird!"

2082
03:05:47,000 --> 03:05:50,000
Cosmos: "I'm not weird. Marina likes him too."

2083
03:05:50,000 --> 03:05:57,000
Ayu: "Marina likes any spineless man she can manipulate! I wouldn't set much store by her paramours!"

2084
03:05:57,000 --> 03:05:59,000
*Ayu snorts dismissively.*

2085
03:05:59,000 --> 03:06:07,000
Ayu: "Marina's not as young as she used to be. She's getting on in years. Her prime's well and truly behind her."

2086
03:06:07,000 --> 03:06:15,000
Ayu: "Our poor older sister can't seduce men like she used to, so she has to settle for dregs now. She's desperate!"

2087
03:06:15,000 --> 03:06:17,000
???: "Oh? Desperate, am I?"

2088
03:06:17,000 --> 03:06:23,000
Ayu: "Yes, that's right! Marina only wishes she could be as cute as I am! She's pathetic! She..."

2089
03:06:23,000 --> 03:06:26,000
*But Ayu's mocking tirade soon peters out.*

2090
03:06:26,000 --> 03:06:31,000
*She lets go of my arm and turns her head, stiffer than a wooden doll.*

2091
03:06:31,000 --> 03:06:35,000
*All color drains from her cheeks. Then she whimpers.*

2092
03:06:35,000 --> 03:06:38,000
Ayu: "M-Marina...? Is that really you...?"

2093
03:06:38,000 --> 03:06:41,000
Marina: "But of course. Who else would it be?"

2094
03:06:41,000 --> 03:06:54,000
*Marina stands before us, tall and striking as always. She's attired, not in the regalia of a businesswoman, but the garb of a succubus; her horns and her wings adding to her disconcerting demanor.*

2095
03:06:54,000 --> 03:07:04,000
*Marina's dark skin glows in the tropical sunlight. Her long, white hair flutters in the breeze, and her eyes narrow into a look of unmistakable disdain.*

2096
03:07:04,000 --> 03:07:09,000
Marina: "It's a pleasure to see you, Ayu. I missed you, my dear younger sister."

2097
03:07:09,000 --> 03:07:14,000
Marina: "I wish I could say that without any lingering regret, but..."

2098
03:07:14,000 --> 03:07:15,000
*Marina scowls.*

2099
03:07:15,000 --> 03:07:19,000
Marina: "I could not help but overhear what you said about me."

2100
03:07:19,000 --> 03:07:29,000
Marina: "I'd like to believe I was mistaken - being so very old, my hearing isn't what it used to be - but I doubt I would make such a mistake."

2101
03:07:29,000 --> 03:07:33,000
Marina: "You said I was desperate. You called me pathetic."

2102
03:07:33,000 --> 03:07:41,000
Marina: "Is that any way to speak about your kind, caring older sister, who has stuck by you through thick and thin?"

2103
03:07:41,000 --> 03:07:45,000
Marina: "What do you have to say in your defense, hmm?"

2104
03:07:45,000 --> 03:07:46,000
Ayu: "I... Ah, uh..."

2105
03:07:46,000 --> 03:07:47,000
Ayu: "Um..."

2106
03:07:47,000 --> 03:07:55,000
*Ayu swallows. Then, she gets down on her hands and knees, her forehead pressed against the burning sand, and cries...*

2107
03:07:55,000 --> 03:07:59,000
Ayu: "I'm so sorry, Marina! I'm really, truly sorry!"

2108
03:07:59,000 --> 03:08:00,000
Marina: "Really?"

2109
03:08:00,000 --> 03:08:02,000
*Marina raises an eyebrow.*

2110
03:08:02,000 --> 03:08:07,000
Marina: "That is gratifying to hear... but I don't think you're sorry enough."

2111
03:08:07,000 --> 03:08:09,000
Marina: "Now, come here."

2112
03:08:09,000 --> 03:08:14,000
*Marina sits upon a nearby rock, then pats her thighs with one hand.*

2113
03:08:14,000 --> 03:08:24,000
Marina: "You've clearly forgotten your manners, but don't worry. I will teach them to you once more, as any kind, benevolent big sister should."

2114
03:08:24,000 --> 03:08:31,000
Marina: "It's because I care about you that I'm willing to go to such lengths for your sake,  my dear Ayu."

2115
03:08:31,000 --> 03:08:34,000
Marina: "Now... What do you have to say about that?"

2116
03:08:34,000 --> 03:08:35,000
Ayu: "I, uh..."

2117
03:08:35,000 --> 03:08:39,000
*Ayu gets to her feet, her knees spotted with sand, and winces.*

2118
03:08:39,000 --> 03:08:43,000
Ayu: "I'm... so happy, big sis. Thank you very much."

2119
03:08:43,000 --> 03:08:45,000
Ayu: "I sure do love you a bunch..."

2120
03:08:45,000 --> 03:08:48,000
Ayu: "You dessicated, dried-out old hag."

2121
03:08:48,000 --> 03:08:52,000
Marina: "Alright, Ayu. Have you learnt your lesson yet?"

2122
03:08:52,000 --> 03:08:56,000
Ayu: "Y-Yes, big sis! I've learned my lesson! I-I'm sorry!"

2123
03:08:56,000 --> 03:09:06,000
Marina: "Really...? That's what you say, but you don't sound very sorry to me. I still don't think you grasp the sheer gravity of your wrongdoings."

2124
03:09:06,000 --> 03:09:14,000
Ayu: "N-No, I do! I definitely do! I understand, so please, let me off the hook! Don't spank me again, Marina! Please, don't-"

2125
03:09:14,000 --> 03:09:21,000
Marina: "That's Miss Marina to you, you ungrateful maggot - and you're in no position to tell me what to do!"

2126
03:09:21,000 --> 03:09:26,000
Marina: "Now, repent! Maybe this'll help you shed some of your hubris!"

2127
03:09:26,000 --> 03:09:28,000
Marina: "This is for insulting me-"

2128
03:09:28,000 --> 03:09:29,000
*SMACK!*

2129
03:09:29,000 --> 03:09:32,000
Marina: "-and this is for bothering Hiroki-"

2130
03:09:32,000 --> 03:09:33,000
*SMACK!*

2131
03:09:33,000 --> 03:09:36,000
Marina: "-and this is for arguing with Cosmos-"

2132
03:09:36,000 --> 03:09:37,000
*SMACK!*

2133
03:09:37,000 --> 03:09:42,000
Marina: "-and this is because looking at your smug face pisses me off!"

2134
03:09:42,000 --> 03:09:45,000
Ayu: "What? Hey, wait! That's not fair! I-"

2135
03:09:45,000 --> 03:09:46,000
*SMACK!*

2136
03:09:46,000 --> 03:09:47,000
Ayu: "Waaaaah...!!!"

2137
03:09:47,000 --> 03:09:56,000
*Marina's palm finds Ayu's unprotected ass once more. Her palm cracks against Ayu's rear like a whip, and Ayu cries out in pain.*

2138
03:09:56,000 --> 03:10:01,000
*Her legs kick back and forth in the air, and tears bead in her eyes.*

2139
03:10:01,000 --> 03:10:10,000
*I haven't counted how many times Marina's spanked her naughty little sister, but this must be the fourth round or so of her "punishment".*

2140
03:10:10,000 --> 03:10:16,000
*Ayu's been bent double over Marina's lap, her plush ass raised, for almost ten minutes.*

2141
03:10:16,000 --> 03:10:19,000
*I'm starting to feel sorry for the poor girl.*

2142
03:10:19,000 --> 03:10:25,000
*It is true Ayu's pretty obnoxious, but does she really deserve such a harsh punishment?!*

2143
03:10:25,000 --> 03:10:27,000
Hiroki: "Hey, Cosmos..."

2144
03:10:27,000 --> 03:10:33,000
*I shoot a look at Cosmos, who's been observing this scene with an impassive look on her face.*

2145
03:10:33,000 --> 03:10:37,000
Hiroki: "Does Marina often discipline Ayu like this?"

2146
03:10:37,000 --> 03:10:42,000
Cosmos: "Yes. Ayu often annoys Marina. She doesn't show her any respect."

2147
03:10:42,000 --> 03:10:47,000
Cosmos: "Ayu blurts out whatever comes into her head. Then, she gets in trouble."

2148
03:10:47,000 --> 03:10:48,000
Hiroki: "I see. Uh..."

2149
03:10:48,000 --> 03:10:51,000
Hiroki: "D'you think I should try to stop them?"

2150
03:10:51,000 --> 03:10:53,000
Cosmos: "Huh? Why would you do that?"

2151
03:10:53,000 --> 03:10:54,000
Hiroki: "Well..."

2152
03:10:54,000 --> 03:10:55,000
*SLAP! SLAP! SLAP!*

2153
03:10:55,000 --> 03:10:59,000
Ayu: "Waaah! My ass is burning! Have mercy, Marina!!!"

2154
03:10:59,000 --> 03:11:06,000
Marina: "Why should I, after you said so many horrible things about me? This is what you deserve."

2155
03:11:06,000 --> 03:11:14,000
Marina: "You should count yourself lucky I'm so merciful, or I'd be beating your behind with a slipper. Now, apologize!"

2156
03:11:14,000 --> 03:11:20,000
Hiroki: "Aren't you, um, a little worried? Ayu sounds like she's in a lot of pain."

2157
03:11:20,000 --> 03:11:25,000
Cosmos: "It's fine. She's stronger than she looks. It's all an act."

2158
03:11:25,000 --> 03:11:29,000
Hiroki: "Are you sure? It looks like she's really crying..."

2159
03:11:29,000 --> 03:11:36,000
Cosmos: "They're fake tears. She's not really sorry, and she hasn't learned anything from this. I can tell."

2160
03:11:36,000 --> 03:11:41,000
Cosmos: "I've known Ayu longer than you have. She's a natural-born actress."

2161
03:11:41,000 --> 03:11:52,000
Cosmos: "I can't keep up with her, really. Talking to people is exhausting. I don't think I could interact with society while pretending to be somebody else..."

2162
03:11:52,000 --> 03:11:56,000
Cosmos: "I guess she's kind of impressive, in a sense."

2163
03:11:56,000 --> 03:11:57,000
*SLAP, SLAP, SLAP!*

2164
03:11:57,000 --> 03:12:05,000
Ayu: "Hey, Marinaaa! Please, stop! I-I already said I'm sorry! Please, don't hit me so hard! It'll make it hard to dance!"

2165
03:12:05,000 --> 03:12:13,000
Ayu: "As an idol, I need to take good care of my body! I can't afford to let it get all flabby and saggy like yours!"

2166
03:12:13,000 --> 03:12:21,000
Marina: "Flabby and saggy, am I? That's news to me! I had no idea, but thank you for bringing that to my attention!"

2167
03:12:21,000 --> 03:12:24,000
Marina: "Now, let me repay you for your kindness!"

2168
03:12:24,000 --> 03:12:29,000
Ayu: "What? No, Marina, I didn't mean it like that! I just meant, I, uh, well-"

2169
03:12:29,000 --> 03:12:30,000
*SLAP!*

2170
03:12:30,000 --> 03:12:31,000
Ayu: "KYAAAA!"

2171
03:12:31,000 --> 03:12:34,000
Cosmos: "...But she's very stupid, too."

2172
03:12:34,000 --> 03:12:37,000
Hiroki: "Yes. I can see that for myself."

2173
03:12:37,000 --> 03:12:43,000
*I continue to watch, my lips pursed, as Marina subjects Ayu to the full brunt of her ire.*

2174
03:12:43,000 --> 03:12:51,000
*I do feel sorry for Ayu, but this is her fault. None of this would be happening if she hadn't been so rude to Marina.*

2175
03:12:51,000 --> 03:12:55,000
*Cosmos is right. Ayu really hasn't learned anything.*

2176
03:12:55,000 --> 03:12:56,000
*She's such a dummy.*

2177
03:12:56,000 --> 03:13:00,000
Marina: "Good grief. My hand feels sore after all that exercise!"

2178
03:13:00,000 --> 03:13:06,000
*Marina wiggles her fingertips in an attempt to ease the dull ache of her much abused palm.*

2179
03:13:06,000 --> 03:13:11,000
*Ayu, meanwhile, is lying on the sand, curled up on herself in a ball.*

2180
03:13:11,000 --> 03:13:20,000
*Her arms are wound about her legs, and she's sniffling to herself in a tiny voice I can only half-catch above the rolling of the waves.*

2181
03:13:20,000 --> 03:13:23,000
Ayu: "Stupid meanie... What a poopie-head..."

2182
03:13:23,000 --> 03:13:30,000
Ayu: "Why do I always get scolded? It's not fair. I didn't do anything wrong! This is all Cosmos's fault..."

2183
03:13:30,000 --> 03:13:34,000
Ayu: "I'll tell Princess Yue about this. Marina is the worst!"

2184
03:13:34,000 --> 03:13:43,000
*Cosmos, for her part, is kneeling by Ayu's side. She gently pats on her head, like one might a farmyard animal, and says sweetly...*

2185
03:13:43,000 --> 03:13:47,000
Cosmos: "There, there. Don't worry. I'll look after you."

2186
03:13:47,000 --> 03:13:49,000
Ayu: "L-Like Hell you will!"

2187
03:13:49,000 --> 03:13:54,000
*Ayu throws Cosmos's hand off her, then shoots her a fierce glare...*

2188
03:13:54,000 --> 03:14:01,000
*Though the intensity of said glare is hampered somewhat by the angry tears still beading in her eyes.*

2189
03:14:01,000 --> 03:14:05,000
Ayu: "I don't want your sympathy! Don't touch me! I hate you!"

2190
03:14:05,000 --> 03:14:11,000
Cosmos: "Is that because I have more Rapidpound followers than you do, despite being younger?"

2191
03:14:11,000 --> 03:14:15,000
Ayu: "What? N-No! Like I care about that! It doesn't matter to me!"

2192
03:14:15,000 --> 03:14:17,000
Ayu: "I don't care, I don't care, I-"

2193
03:14:17,000 --> 03:14:18,000
Ayu: "Waaah...!"

2194
03:14:18,000 --> 03:14:24,000
*Ayu whimpers, her eyelashes squeezing shut, as a burst of pain flares through her body.*

2195
03:14:24,000 --> 03:14:26,000
Ayu: "My ass... It stiiiiiings...!"

2196
03:14:26,000 --> 03:14:29,000
Cosmos: "It'll be alright. There, there."

2197
03:14:29,000 --> 03:14:36,000
*Cosmos resumes petting Ayu. This time, she doesn't stroke the crown of her head, but her reddened behind.*

2198
03:14:36,000 --> 03:14:44,000
*Ayu hisses at this, but she doesn't try to push Cosmos away. Maybe she doesn't have the energy. She certainly looks defeated.*

2199
03:14:44,000 --> 03:14:48,000
Marina: "Goodness gracious. Those silly younger sisters of mine..."

2200
03:14:48,000 --> 03:14:53,000
*Marina shakes her head, bemused, and folds her arms over her ample chest.*

2201
03:14:53,000 --> 03:15:02,000
Marina: "I'm sorry, Hiroki, for causing such a disturbance. I didn't mean to interrupt you while you were working, but I had no choice."

2202
03:15:02,000 --> 03:15:08,000
Marina: "Once I heard Cosmos was coming here, I knew I had to check up on things, too."

2203
03:15:08,000 --> 03:15:14,000
Marina: "Cosmos and Ayu have always butted heads, and I feared there would be some fallout."

2204
03:15:14,000 --> 03:15:24,000
Marina: "We succubi are physically stronger than most humans. I was worried you might get caught up in one of their silly fights, and then you'd be injured."

2205
03:15:24,000 --> 03:15:27,000
*So, that's why Marina's here... I was wondering.*

2206
03:15:27,000 --> 03:15:36,000
*That makes sense, I guess. As the oldest succubus of the group, she felt obliged to discipline her juniors, lest they cause me any problems.*

2207
03:15:36,000 --> 03:15:42,000
*Marina might come across as a cool, distant beauty, but she's actually quite caring.*

2208
03:15:42,000 --> 03:15:51,000
Hiroki: "Thanks, Marina. You helped me out a lot. Those two were tugging at my arms so hard, I was afraid I'd split down the middle..."

2209
03:15:51,000 --> 03:15:58,000
Marina: "If you had split in two, that might be for the best. Then, my sisters wouldn't fight over you so..."

2210
03:15:58,000 --> 03:16:07,000
Marina: "But perhaps two Hirokis would not be enough. I'm fond of you, too, and I don't want to give you up to Ayu or Cosmos without a fight!"

2211
03:16:07,000 --> 03:16:12,000
*Marina pouts cutely, coiling a strand of white hair around her finger.*

2212
03:16:12,000 --> 03:16:16,000
Marina: "You don't think I'm old and saggy, do you, Hiroki?"

2213
03:16:16,000 --> 03:16:18,000
Hiroki: "What! Of course not!"

2214
03:16:18,000 --> 03:16:19,000
Marina: "Really?"

2215
03:16:19,000 --> 03:16:25,000
Hiroki: "Really. You might be older than Ayu and Cosmos, but that doesn't diminish your charms."

2216
03:16:25,000 --> 03:16:33,000
Hiroki: "I think you're a very attractive woman, and I'm glad you care about me so much! That makes me very happy!"

2217
03:16:33,000 --> 03:16:36,000
Marina: "Oh, thank goodness! That is a relief!"

2218
03:16:36,000 --> 03:16:45,000
Marina: "I don't tend to let Ayu's words get to me, but she is right on that score. I am a good deal older than both her and Cosmos."

2219
03:16:45,000 --> 03:16:50,000
Marina: "I've been feeling somewhat self-conscious about it as of late..."

2220
03:16:50,000 --> 03:17:01,000
Marina: "In any event, I must apologize once more for getting in your way. As a businesswoman myself, I know how aggravating it is to be distracted while on the job."

2221
03:17:01,000 --> 03:17:11,000
Hiroki: "It, um... It's alright. I wouldn't even be here if it wasn't for you. You convinced Ayu to meet with me, and you paid for the tickets."

2222
03:17:11,000 --> 03:17:13,000
Hiroki: "I'm in your debt, Marina."

2223
03:17:13,000 --> 03:17:16,000
*I bow my head before her, and she smiles.*

2224
03:17:16,000 --> 03:17:23,000
Marina: "That's quite alright, dear! As you are my partner, it's only natural I should help you where I can!"

2225
03:17:23,000 --> 03:17:28,000
Marina: "I fear my machinations have done little to aid you, though..."

2226
03:17:28,000 --> 03:17:33,000
*Marina places her fingers against her chin, a thoughtful look upon her face.*

2227
03:17:33,000 --> 03:17:37,000
Marina: "Were you able to take any photographs of Ayu?"

2228
03:17:37,000 --> 03:17:48,000
Hiroki: "I took a few, but it would be nice if I could get some more. It'd be good to get some shots of her in different outfits, or at different locations..."

2229
03:17:48,000 --> 03:17:51,000
Marina: "Yes, indeed. You're quite right!"

2230
03:17:51,000 --> 03:17:56,000
Marina: "Then the solution is clear: you must spend even more time with us!"

2231
03:17:56,000 --> 03:17:58,000
Ayu: "Oh, yes! That's a great idea!"

2232
03:17:58,000 --> 03:18:06,000
*Ayu, who's seemingly recovered from her trauma, springs to her feet. She strikes a cute pose, then proclaims...*

2233
03:18:06,000 --> 03:18:18,000
Ayu: "One day is simply not enough time to capture all my charms! If you want to get some decent photographs of yours truly, you'll need to spend at least a week in my presence!"

2234
03:18:18,000 --> 03:18:23,000
Cosmos: "That's no fair. I want to spend a week with Hiroki, too..."

2235
03:18:23,000 --> 03:18:30,000
Marina: "And I could use a break from work. I'd very much like to toy with you for a full seven days, darling~"

2236
03:18:30,000 --> 03:18:34,000
Ayu: "Like Hell he's your darling! He's my cameraman!"

2237
03:18:34,000 --> 03:18:36,000
Cosmos: "No, he's my boyfriend!"

2238
03:18:36,000 --> 03:18:37,000
Marina: "Darling!"

2239
03:18:37,000 --> 03:18:38,000
Ayu: "Cameraman!"

2240
03:18:38,000 --> 03:18:39,000
Cosmos: "Boyfriend!"

2241
03:18:39,000 --> 03:18:41,000
Hiroki: "Uh... You guys..."

2242
03:18:41,000 --> 03:18:46,000
*I glance between the three succubi, an awkward grimace on my face.*

2243
03:18:46,000 --> 03:18:54,000
*Naturally, I'm flattered that these three babes have taken such an interest in me, but I'm a little perturbed, too.*

2244
03:18:54,000 --> 03:18:58,000
*I don't want them attacking one another again! I'm not worth it!*

2245
03:18:58,000 --> 03:18:59,000
*Besides...*

2246
03:18:59,000 --> 03:19:08,000
Hiroki: "I don't think I'll be able to get a full week off work. My boss is very stingy. He'll turn down my request in an instant."

2247
03:19:08,000 --> 03:19:11,000
Marina: "Oh, I wouldn't worry about him, darling."

2248
03:19:11,000 --> 03:19:16,000
*Marina replies archly, with nary a hint of concern marring her pretty face.*

2249
03:19:16,000 --> 03:19:25,000
Marina: "I'll arrange something with that boss of yours. He's a tedious bore of a man, but I can wrap him around my little finger like yarn."

2250
03:19:25,000 --> 03:19:35,000
Ayu: "It's not like you'd be on vacation, anyway. You'd be busy taking photos of me for this upcoming article. You can put it down as a business expense!"

2251
03:19:35,000 --> 03:19:45,000
Cosmos: "And then, when you're tired from work, you can collapse in my arms. I'll give you a long, firm massage, and help you forget all your woes... Ehehe~"

2252
03:19:45,000 --> 03:19:49,000
Ayu: "What? N-No way! I'll be the one to ease Hiroki's concerns!"

2253
03:19:49,000 --> 03:19:59,000
Cosmos: "Really? But he's not your boyfriend. He's just your cameraman. You have no right to touch him. That would be a breech of workplace etiquette."

2254
03:19:59,000 --> 03:20:02,000
Ayu: "Grrr... You're smarter than you look..."

2255
03:20:02,000 --> 03:20:05,000
Cosmos: "And you're just as dumb as you look."

2256
03:20:05,000 --> 03:20:07,000
Ayu: "Wh-Why, you...! That DOES IT!"

2257
03:20:07,000 --> 03:20:18,000
*Ayu and Cosmos start brawling, still dressed in their skimpy succubus attire. Cosmos tugs at Ayu's long twintails, while Ayu pinches Cosmos's cheeks like mochi.*

2258
03:20:18,000 --> 03:20:23,000
*Their enraged shouts echo across the sand, mingled with the cawing of the gulls.*

2259
03:20:23,000 --> 03:20:27,000
Hiroki: "Those two... are certainly lively, aren't they?"

2260
03:20:27,000 --> 03:20:34,000
Marina: "Yes, indeed. It's because they're so young, relatively speaking. They have a lot to learn."

2261
03:20:34,000 --> 03:20:43,000
*Marina sighs and shakes her head. She looks exasperated, like a put-upon teacher, but I think I can see genuine compassion in her eyes.*

2262
03:20:43,000 --> 03:20:49,000
*Cosmos and Ayu might annoy her, but I'm sure she cares for them, just as she cares for me.*

2263
03:20:49,000 --> 03:20:54,000
*Idly, I find myself thinking she'd make a great mother. She's so nurturing!*

2264
03:20:54,000 --> 03:20:58,000
Marina: "Well... Putting them to one side for now..."

2265
03:20:58,000 --> 03:21:03,000
Marina: "Would you like to go on a trip to a hot spring with us next week?"

2266
03:21:03,000 --> 03:21:16,000
Marina: "I'd prefer it if it was just you and I, of course, but I doubt those girls would let us skulk off on our own. They can be very demanding, and you do need to take more photographs of Ayu."

2267
03:21:16,000 --> 03:21:23,000
Marina: "I'll work things out with your boss, and I'll pay for it out of pocket. How does that sound?"

2268
03:21:23,000 --> 03:21:26,000
Hiroki: "It sounds pleasant enough, but-"

2269
03:21:26,000 --> 03:21:27,000
Marina: "Now, now."

2270
03:21:27,000 --> 03:21:33,000
*Marina cups my cheek with her hand and leans in, her eyes half-lidded and sultry.*

2271
03:21:33,000 --> 03:21:40,000
*Her large bosom presses against my chest, and I can smell a powerful floral aroma emitting from her skin.*

2272
03:21:40,000 --> 03:21:47,000
*I'm not sure if this is because of Marina's perfume, or if this is some scent unique to succubi.*

2273
03:21:47,000 --> 03:21:51,000
*Now that I think about it, Cosmos smells pretty good, too...*

2274
03:21:51,000 --> 03:21:53,000
Marina: "Please say yes."

2275
03:21:53,000 --> 03:21:57,000
*Marina stares into my eyes, her voice a soft, seductive whisper.*

2276
03:21:57,000 --> 03:22:01,000
Marina: "I would break my heart if you refused, my darling Hiroki."

2277
03:22:01,000 --> 03:22:02,000
Hiroki: "Well..."

2278
03:22:02,000 --> 03:22:06,000
*Honestly speaking, I'm a little worried about this invitation.*

2279
03:22:06,000 --> 03:22:14,000
*While I'd love to relax my weary body in a hot spring, being groped at by three horny succubi sounds exhausting.*

2280
03:22:14,000 --> 03:22:17,000
*Who knew being Mr. Popular could be so hard?*

2281
03:22:17,000 --> 03:22:23,000
*I'm not sure if I can deal with Cosmos and Ayu's constant bickering for a whole week...*

2282
03:22:23,000 --> 03:22:30,000
*But Marina's being so kind, I'd feel guilty refusig her offer. Her dynamite body is similarly hard to resist.*

2283
03:22:30,000 --> 03:22:36,000
Hiroki: "...Oh, alright then. I'll go with you. It would make a nice change of pace, at least."

2284
03:22:36,000 --> 03:22:41,000
Marina: "Wonderful! I knew you'd make the right choice, Hiroki~ Ehehe~"

2285
03:22:41,000 --> 03:22:46,000
*Well, of course I made the right choice. I didn't have any choices to make...*

2286
03:22:46,000 --> 03:22:48,000
*But that's beside the point.*

2287
03:22:48,000 --> 03:22:51,000
*It looks like I'll be going on a trip soon.*

2288
03:22:51,000 --> 03:22:52,000
*I can hardly wait.*

2289
03:22:52,000 --> 03:22:53,000
*Next Monday...*

2290
03:22:53,000 --> 03:22:56,000
Cosmos: "Is this the place we'll be staying?"

2291
03:22:56,000 --> 03:23:04,000
Marina: "Yes, it is. It was one the best rated ryokans in the area, and it's in such a beautiful, scenic location!"

2292
03:23:04,000 --> 03:23:07,000
Marina: "What do you think, everybody?"

2293
03:23:07,000 --> 03:23:08,000
Hiroki: "Wow..."

2294
03:23:08,000 --> 03:23:12,000
*I whistle, impressed, as I take in my surroundings.*

2295
03:23:12,000 --> 03:23:22,000
*After a couple of hours on a train, with only a handful of changes, the four of us made our way to our destination: that being, this charming ryokan.*

2296
03:23:22,000 --> 03:23:28,000
*The ryokan is located in the countryside, only a stone's throw away from Mt. Fuji.*

2297
03:23:28,000 --> 03:23:36,000
*This ryokan's located at the top of a hill, and though getting here was a bit of a slog, I think it was worth it.*

2298
03:23:36,000 --> 03:23:41,000
*The air smells crisp and clean, and the tall cedar trees are breath-taking.*

2299
03:23:41,000 --> 03:23:48,000
*The ryokan itself is a large, spacious building, which looks a little like an old-fashioned palace.*

2300
03:23:48,000 --> 03:23:59,000
*A gentle breeze ruffles the hem of my shirt and my flyaway hair. I can smell sulphur, mingled with the earthy aroma of the forest. Is that from the hot springs?*

2301
03:23:59,000 --> 03:24:07,000
*I haven't seen the springs yet, but if they're anything like the façade of this ryokan, I'm sure they'll be luxurious!*

2302
03:24:07,000 --> 03:24:10,000
Hiroki: "This place looks nice, Marina!"

2303
03:24:10,000 --> 03:24:16,000
*In fact, it looks better than nice. I've never stayed anywhere this fancy in my life!*

2304
03:24:16,000 --> 03:24:24,000
Hiroki: "Thank you for organizing this trip - but are you sure you're alright paying for this? This place looks expensive..."

2305
03:24:24,000 --> 03:24:34,000
Marina: "Don't worry about it, dear. I have more than enough money. I'd prefer to use my wealth to bring others joy, rather than hoarding it like a dragon!"

2306
03:24:34,000 --> 03:24:36,000
Marina: "And what about you two?"

2307
03:24:36,000 --> 03:24:42,000
*Marina shoots quizzical looks at Ayu and Cosmos, the final two members of our quartet.*

2308
03:24:42,000 --> 03:24:44,000
Marina: "Do you like this place?"

2309
03:24:44,000 --> 03:24:54,000
Cosmos: "I think it's incredible! I've never been to the countryside before! I thought it would be smelly and run-down, but this place is amazing!"

2310
03:24:54,000 --> 03:25:00,000
Cosmos: "I need to take a lot of photos. My fans on Rapidpound would love to see this..."

2311
03:25:00,000 --> 03:25:05,000
*Cosmos reaches into the pocket of her short shorts and extricates her phone.*

2312
03:25:05,000 --> 03:25:12,000
*She begins snapping pictures of the ryokan excitedly, with all the gusto of an American tourist.*

2313
03:25:12,000 --> 03:25:15,000
Marina: "I'm glad you're so easy to please."

2314
03:25:15,000 --> 03:25:16,000
*Marina giggles.*

2315
03:25:16,000 --> 03:25:19,000
Marina: "And what about her majesty over here?"

2316
03:25:19,000 --> 03:25:20,000
Ayu: "...Hmph."

2317
03:25:20,000 --> 03:25:23,000
*Ikue Ayu stands proud and undaunted.*

2318
03:25:23,000 --> 03:25:33,000
*She's clad in the frilly costume she usually wears while performing; her skirt layered like a wedding cake, her white shirt bedecked with ribbons.*

2319
03:25:33,000 --> 03:25:39,000
*She's even wearing the little hat that caught my attention during our first meeting.*

2320
03:25:39,000 --> 03:25:43,000
*How does that hat stay on her head, anyway? It's a mystery!*

2321
03:25:43,000 --> 03:25:46,000
Ayu: "It's too hot outside. I'm sweaty."

2322
03:25:46,000 --> 03:25:52,000
Marina: "If you'd checked the weather forecast before you set off, you would have known that."

2323
03:25:52,000 --> 03:25:54,000
*Marina clicks her tongue.*

2324
03:25:54,000 --> 03:26:00,000
Marina: "Why did you decide to wear that silly outfit, anyway? It's not very practical."

2325
03:26:00,000 --> 03:26:03,000
Ayu: "Says you, Miss "I-Live-In-My-Business-Suits"."

2326
03:26:03,000 --> 03:26:09,000
Marina: "Business suits are certainly more sensible than your over-designed garments."

2327
03:26:09,000 --> 03:26:16,000
Marina: "I can always take off my jacket or unbutton my shirt if I get too hot, but how can you cool down?"

2328
03:26:16,000 --> 03:26:21,000
Marina: "You're already exposing so much, there's little left for you to remove!"

2329
03:26:21,000 --> 03:26:23,000
Ayu: "Can it, you old hag."

2330
03:26:23,000 --> 03:26:26,000
Ayu: "I have to wear this outfit, rain or shine."

2331
03:26:26,000 --> 03:26:35,000
Ayu: "As an idol, I'm always performing for my fans, whether I'm onstage or not. That being the case, I always need to look cute!"

2332
03:26:35,000 --> 03:26:42,000
Hiroki: "That's very, uh... inspiring, but I don't think you need to wear quite that many ribbons..."

2333
03:26:42,000 --> 03:26:47,000
*We got no shortage of funny looks on the train here, thanks to Ayu's appearance.*

2334
03:26:47,000 --> 03:26:52,000
*Does she love being the center of attention that much? She's so vain...*

2335
03:26:52,000 --> 03:26:59,000
Ayu: "Oh, what do you know? You're just a cameraman! You don't understand the first thing about fashion!"

2336
03:26:59,000 --> 03:27:06,000
Ayu: "I'd rather die than wear a boring suit like you, or a baggy jacket like Cosmos! I'm too good for that!"

2337
03:27:06,000 --> 03:27:08,000
Marina: "Have fun sweating, then."

2338
03:27:08,000 --> 03:27:16,000
Ayu: "I won't have fun! Nothing about this rotten journey has been fun so far, but I'm doing my best to bear it!"

2339
03:27:16,000 --> 03:27:21,000
Ayu: "There's nobody better than faking smiles like seasoned idols, tehe ☆"

2340
03:27:21,000 --> 03:27:23,000
Ayu: "Really, though..."

2341
03:27:23,000 --> 03:27:26,000
*Ayu scowls, her face thunderous once more.*

2342
03:27:26,000 --> 03:27:33,000
Ayu: "I hate the countryside - especially in the summer. It's so muggy, and there are so many insects."

2343
03:27:33,000 --> 03:27:40,000
Ayu: "It's smelly, it's nasty, and it's inconvenient! Plus, this place looks like it's hundreds of years old!"

2344
03:27:40,000 --> 03:27:45,000
Ayu: "I'd far rather stay in a nice, modern hotel, not a hovel like this!"

2345
03:27:45,000 --> 03:27:46,000
Marina: "Why, you..."

2346
03:27:46,000 --> 03:27:53,000
*Marina rounds on the problematic idol, no doubt ready to discipline her, but Cosmos gets there quicker.*

2347
03:27:53,000 --> 03:27:57,000
*She grabs hold of Ayu, a bright smile on her face, and says...*

2348
03:27:57,000 --> 03:28:01,000
Cosmos: "Don't be mad. We're on vacation. Smile, Ayu."

2349
03:28:01,000 --> 03:28:07,000
Ayu: "I don't feel like smiling - particularly not when I'm with you. Let go of me!"

2350
03:28:07,000 --> 03:28:14,000
Cosmos: "I won't. We need to take a photo together, so everybody on Rapidpound knows we're having fun."

2351
03:28:14,000 --> 03:28:18,000
Cosmos: "I want to make my three million fans happy."

2352
03:28:18,000 --> 03:28:24,000
Cosmos: "You're an idol. You should understand. Don't you want to make your fans happy, too?"

2353
03:28:24,000 --> 03:28:35,000
Ayu: "Like I care about them! They're all disgusting pigs! I bet they'd break out into a cold sweat if they ever spoke to a real woman! They're the worst! They-"

2354
03:28:35,000 --> 03:28:40,000
Ayu: "Wait. Did you say you want to upload this photo to Rapidpound?"

2355
03:28:40,000 --> 03:28:43,000
Cosmos: "Yes, I do. Is that a problem?"

2356
03:28:43,000 --> 03:28:50,000
Ayu: "N-No, that's not a problem. In fact, I think it might be a good idea! After all, we're such good friends!"

2357
03:28:50,000 --> 03:28:53,000
Marina: "Hmm. She's sure changed her tune."

2358
03:28:53,000 --> 03:28:55,000
Hiroki: "I can't imagine why..."

2359
03:28:55,000 --> 03:29:02,000
*Though Ayu doesn't say it aloud, I think I understand what's prompted this sudden bout of docility.*

2360
03:29:02,000 --> 03:29:13,000
*Cosmos has three million Rapidpound followers, but Ayu has less than one million. If Cosmos uploads a selfie of them online, it should boost Ayu's exposure.*

2361
03:29:13,000 --> 03:29:21,000
*Ayu doesn't care about Cosmos, and she certainly doesn't want to be her friend. She's just trying to steal her fans!*

2362
03:29:21,000 --> 03:29:24,000
*I wonder what to think of this little ploy...*

2363
03:29:24,000 --> 03:29:26,000
*I guess it's kind of impressive.":

2364
03:29:26,000 --> 03:29:31,000
*For such a cute, frilly creature, Ayu's business acumen is impeccable.*

2365
03:29:31,000 --> 03:29:38,000
*It's little wonder she shot to stardom in so little time. There's nobody more vicious and cutthroat than her!*

2366
03:29:38,000 --> 03:29:40,000
*It's actually pretty impressive.*

2367
03:29:40,000 --> 03:29:43,000
*Maybe I should take some pointers from Ayu...*

2368
03:29:43,000 --> 03:29:45,000
*It's unfair to Cosmos.":

2369
03:29:45,000 --> 03:29:49,000
*Ayu's being so brazen about this, I can't help but feel annoyed.*

2370
03:29:49,000 --> 03:29:56,000
*Cosmos seems pretty genuine about befriending Ayu, but all Ayu can think of is herself. She's so selfish!*

2371
03:29:56,000 --> 03:30:00,000
*I don't think Ayu deserves a sweet, earnest friend like Cosmos...*

2372
03:30:00,000 --> 03:30:10,000
*But Cosmos doesn't seem to notice Ayu's evil scheme - or, if she has, she doesn't care. She holds the camera up before them, smiling sweetly.*

2373
03:30:10,000 --> 03:30:14,000
Cosmos: "Come closer to me. I need to get you in the frame."

2374
03:30:14,000 --> 03:30:16,000
Ayu: "Of course! Right away!"

2375
03:30:16,000 --> 03:30:20,000
*Ayu leans in a little closer to Cosmos, smiling brightly.*

2376
03:30:20,000 --> 03:30:24,000
*Her hefty bust pushes up against Cosmos's, and she winks cutely.*

2377
03:30:24,000 --> 03:30:28,000
Ayu: "Should I strike a pose like this? Or maybe this like this?"

2378
03:30:28,000 --> 03:30:30,000
Cosmos: "That's fine. Hehe..."

2379
03:30:30,000 --> 03:30:31,000
*Cosmos giggles.*

2380
03:30:31,000 --> 03:30:35,000
Cosmos: "This is the first picture I've taken with a friend..."

2381
03:30:35,000 --> 03:30:39,000
Cosmos: "Ayu might be annoying, but she's my friend..."

2382
03:30:39,000 --> 03:30:41,000
Cosmos: "I'm really happy."

2383
03:30:41,000 --> 03:30:43,000
Cosmos: "OK, Ayu. Say cheese."

2384
03:30:43,000 --> 03:30:44,000
Ayu: "Cheese!!!"

2385
03:30:44,000 --> 03:30:49,000
*With a bright smile, Cosmos pushes the shutter, then takes a photo.*

2386
03:30:49,000 --> 03:31:00,000
*Though it's nothing particularly professional, I can sense Cosmos's love in that selfie. She loves Marina for organizing this trip, and Ayu for being her friend...*

2387
03:31:00,000 --> 03:31:04,000
*And I'd like to think she loves me, too, for being her boyfriend.*

2388
03:31:04,000 --> 03:31:09,000
*Cosmos is definitely weird, but her heart is overflowing with affection.*

2389
03:31:09,000 --> 03:31:17,000
*Coming here wasn't a mistake after all. Of that, I'm certain. By the time the week's up, I'm sure we'll all be good friends!*

2390
03:31:17,000 --> 03:31:21,000
Ayu: "Friends... I thought you said we were friends..."

2391
03:31:21,000 --> 03:31:23,000
Cosmos: "We are friends. Why?"

2392
03:31:23,000 --> 03:31:26,000
Ayu: "Why, you ask? Just look at this!!!"

2393
03:31:26,000 --> 03:31:32,000
*Ayu thrusts her own phone in Cosmos's face, her eyes beading with embarrassed tears.*

2394
03:31:32,000 --> 03:31:39,000
Ayu: "I didn't know you were going to put stupid filters all over our photo! You never told me about that!"

2395
03:31:39,000 --> 03:31:45,000
Ayu: "Now you've made me look like a moron! How dare you upload this online?! You're the worst!"

2396
03:31:45,000 --> 03:31:48,000
