2587
03:46:41,000 --> 03:46:46,000
Cosmos: "I love you a lot, and I want the world to know it. I'm not ashamed."

2588
03:46:46,000 --> 03:46:57,000
Hiroki: "I'm not ashamed of you, either. To be honest, I think I'm punching in way over my weight, dating a girl like you. You're much more attractive than I am."

2589
03:46:57,000 --> 03:47:05,000
Hiroki: "I'm sure, if you showed my plain face to all your followers, they'd think the same. They'd say I don't deserve you."

2590
03:47:05,000 --> 03:47:15,000
Hiroki: "They'd start digging into my past, and they'd ream me endlessly. They might even claim that I've blackmailed you into this relationship..."

2591
03:47:15,000 --> 03:47:16,000
Cosmos: "No!"

2592
03:47:16,000 --> 03:47:20,000
*Cosmos clings to me, her arms wound possessively about my own.*

2593
03:47:20,000 --> 03:47:25,000
Cosmos: "That isn't true! They're wrong! You'd never do anything that awful!"

2594
03:47:25,000 --> 03:47:34,000
Cosmos: "I love you because you accept me for who I am! You don't look down on me and you don't mock me! You're supportive and kind..."

2595
03:47:34,000 --> 03:47:36,000
Hiroki: "And I smell of desire?"

2596
03:47:36,000 --> 03:47:40,000
Cosmos: "Yes! You're wonderful, so don't put yourself down!"

2597
03:47:40,000 --> 03:47:45,000
Hiroki: "I'm trying not to. I doubt your fans would be so kind, though..."

2598
03:47:45,000 --> 03:47:48,000
Cosmos: "That's sad, but... you're right, I think."

2599
03:47:48,000 --> 03:47:49,000
*Cosmos sighs.*

2600
03:47:49,000 --> 03:48:00,000
Cosmos: "I try to be optimistic, but I know not everybody out there is kind. I receive a lot of hate comments myself - from people online, and other succubi."

2601
03:48:00,000 --> 03:48:11,000
Cosmos: "My sisters always used to tease me for being weird and awkward. They said so many cruel things, I started to believe them. Then, I beat myself up, too."

2602
03:48:11,000 --> 03:48:13,000
Cosmos: "I felt sad and lonely..."

2603
03:48:13,000 --> 03:48:20,000
Cosmos: "But I'm happy now. I have my fans, and I have you. You're very special to me, and I won't let you go."

2604
03:48:20,000 --> 03:48:25,000
Cosmos: "I don't want you to be harassed, too... so I won't upload any photos."

2605
03:48:25,000 --> 03:48:34,000
Cosmos: "I would like to take a few photos of us together, though. That way, I can have something to remember these happy times by."

2606
03:48:34,000 --> 03:48:37,000
Cosmos: "Would that... be a problem, Hiroki?"

2607
03:48:37,000 --> 03:48:43,000
Hiroki: "I think that should be fine. I'd be honored to be in a photo with you, Cosmos."

2608
03:48:43,000 --> 03:48:44,000
Cosmos: "Yay!"

2609
03:48:44,000 --> 03:48:46,000
*Cosmos claps her hands together.*

2610
03:48:46,000 --> 03:48:51,000
Cosmos: "Then lean in close to me. Let's strike a pose, like couples do!"

2611
03:48:51,000 --> 03:49:02,000
*Cosmos takes her phone from her pocket and points it at us. Cosmos, being a seasoned selfie-taker, flashes a peace sign on cue, but I'm a little more reserved.*

2612
03:49:02,000 --> 03:49:13,000
*I might be a photographer, but I usually take photos of other people, not myself. I've never considered my own ordinary features worth committing to the ages...*

2613
03:49:13,000 --> 03:49:18,000
*But I guess my plainness is offset, somewhat, by Cosmos's presence.*

2614
03:49:18,000 --> 03:49:23,000
*I look brighter than usual when I'm with her. Happier, maybe? I'm not sure.*

2615
03:49:23,000 --> 03:49:30,000
*Cosmos isn't the same as my ex-girlfriend, but she brings out the best in me, and I care for her a lot.*

2616
03:49:30,000 --> 03:49:39,000
*I don't quite know how to work my best angles, like Cosmos does... but that doesn't matter. I'm through with being self-conscious.*

2617
03:49:39,000 --> 03:49:43,000
Cosmos: "Are you ready Hiroki? I'm going to take it!"

2618
03:49:43,000 --> 03:49:44,000
Hiroki: "I'm ready."

2619
03:49:44,000 --> 03:49:53,000
*I strike the moment Cosmos pushes her finger down to take the photo. I lean in, bringing my face even closer to hers, and kiss her.*

2620
03:49:53,000 --> 03:49:54,000
Cosmos: "Kya!"

2621
03:49:54,000 --> 03:49:58,000
*Cosmos wasn't expecting the kiss and she gasps, startled.*

2622
03:49:58,000 --> 03:50:03,000
*A blush spreads across her cheeks, all the way to the tips of her ears.*

2623
03:50:03,000 --> 03:50:06,000
*She looks so funny, I can't help but laugh.*

2624
03:50:06,000 --> 03:50:08,000
Hiroki: "Haha... Hahaha!"

2625
03:50:08,000 --> 03:50:12,000
*It's a cheerful laugh, devoid of my usual self-consciousness.*

2626
03:50:12,000 --> 03:50:21,000
*Though I worry a lot about what Cosmos's fans would say if they found out about us, I feel relaxed when I'm alone with her like this.*

2627
03:50:21,000 --> 03:50:28,000
*Just as Cosmos trusts me, I trust her. As a fellow outcast, I know she won't sneer at me, or deride me.*

2628
03:50:28,000 --> 03:50:36,000
*She's a very pure, innocent girl (her penchant for half-naked posing notwithstanding), and I'm happy to have met her.*

2629
03:50:36,000 --> 03:50:44,000
*I love all the succubi I've met in different ways, but Cosmos is special. She really is a wonderful girlfriend.*

2630
03:50:44,000 --> 03:50:47,000
???: "Heh. Is that what you really think? How cute."

2631
03:50:47,000 --> 03:50:48,000
Hiroki: "Aah...!"

2632
03:50:48,000 --> 03:50:54,000
*My head snaps to one side. I gasp, alarmed, as my eyes land upon those of my intruder's.*

2633
03:50:54,000 --> 03:50:59,000
*Standing in my room, attired in the skin-tight garb of a succubus, is Ikue Ayu.*

2634
03:50:59,000 --> 03:51:04,000
Hiroki: "A-Ayu...?! How did you get in here? I didn't hear the door open."

2635
03:51:04,000 --> 03:51:05,000
Ayu: "Oh, please."

2636
03:51:05,000 --> 03:51:06,000
*Ayu rolls her eyes.*

2637
03:51:06,000 --> 03:51:16,000
Ayu: "I'm a succubus, Hiroki. I have magical powers you humans can only dream of. Breaking and entering without a sound is a speciality of mine!"

2638
03:51:16,000 --> 03:51:18,000
Hiroki: "Right. I should've known..."

2639
03:51:18,000 --> 03:51:19,000
*I shake my head.*

2640
03:51:19,000 --> 03:51:23,000
Hiroki: "Forget being an idol. You'd make a pretty good burglar."

2641
03:51:23,000 --> 03:51:32,000
Ayu: "As if I would ever debase myself by embarking upon a life of crime! As a lady, I could never demean myself in such a way!"

2642
03:51:32,000 --> 03:51:36,000
Hiroki: "Since you're an idol, you're basically a thief anyway..."

2643
03:51:36,000 --> 03:51:37,000
Ayu: "Huh?"

2644
03:51:37,000 --> 03:51:41,000
*Ayu glowers at me, her hands planted upon her shapely hips.*

2645
03:51:41,000 --> 03:51:43,000
Ayu: "What's that supposed to mean?!"

2646
03:51:43,000 --> 03:51:47,000
*Crap. Did I just say that aloud? Me and my big mouth.*

2647
03:51:47,000 --> 03:51:51,000
*Well. Since I've put my foot in it, I might as well elaborate.*

2648
03:51:51,000 --> 03:52:02,000
Hiroki: "I was just thinking, uh... You idols sell singles by putting tickets to your live shows in randomly-selected CD cases. Isn't that how you generate sales?"

2649
03:52:02,000 --> 03:52:11,000
*Some fans will buy four or five copies of a single CD to be in with a shot of winning a coveted ticket to one of Ayu's live shows.*

2650
03:52:11,000 --> 03:52:15,000
*If that's not extortion at its finest, I don't know what isn't!*

2651
03:52:15,000 --> 03:52:23,000
Ayu: "That's true enough, yes, but I'm not the one who came up with that idea. That was down to my my management."

2652
03:52:23,000 --> 03:52:29,000
Ayu: "Believe it or not, I don't get the final say in all my promotions or advertising schemes."

2653
03:52:29,000 --> 03:52:31,000
Hiroki: "You don't...?"

2654
03:52:31,000 --> 03:52:35,000
Ayu: "Of course not. I'm an employee, just like you."

2655
03:52:35,000 --> 03:52:44,000
Ayu: "The higher ups in my company are all old men, and they have their own ideas about how to market me. I'm just in it for the ride."

2656
03:52:44,000 --> 03:52:53,000
Ayu: "I have to do what they say, wear the clothes they want, and perform the dance steps they prepare, or I'd be out of a job."

2657
03:52:53,000 --> 03:52:57,000
Ayu: "The idol industry's tough, even for a succubus."

2658
03:52:57,000 --> 03:53:06,000
Ayu: "It takes sweat, blood, and tears to claw your way to the top, and you've got to bow and scrape to your superiors all the while!"

2659
03:53:06,000 --> 03:53:14,000
Ayu: "Don't look down on me for doing my job! It's every bit as difficult - no, it's more difficult - than yours!"

2660
03:53:14,000 --> 03:53:16,000
Hiroki: "Alright, alright. I get it."

2661
03:53:16,000 --> 03:53:22,000
*Ayu sounds so impassioned, I almost feel obliged to bow before her in supplication.*

2662
03:53:22,000 --> 03:53:26,000
Hiroki: "Sorry, Ayu. I never realized how hard you work."

2663
03:53:26,000 --> 03:53:27,000
Ayu: "It's fine."

2664
03:53:27,000 --> 03:53:33,000
*Ayu sits next to me on the futon, her knees beneath her chin and her arms wound about her legs.*

2665
03:53:33,000 --> 03:53:44,000
Ayu: "As an idol, it's my job to put on a happy, smiling face to my adoring fans. I can't let people know I can tired, too. I want them to see that I'm giving it 110%%..."

2666
03:53:44,000 --> 03:53:47,000
Ayu: "But I'm only a human, and I have my limits."

2667
03:53:47,000 --> 03:53:49,000
Hiroki: "You're a human?"

2668
03:53:49,000 --> 03:53:52,000
*I nudge Ayu, a teasing smile on my lips.*

2669
03:53:52,000 --> 03:53:54,000
Hiroki: "That's news to me."

2670
03:53:54,000 --> 03:54:00,000
Ayu: "OK, OK, Mr. Pernickety. I'm a succubus, not a human, but we're not all that different."

2671
03:54:00,000 --> 03:54:06,000
Ayu: "We succubi might have more stamina than most people, but we can get worn down, too."

2672
03:54:06,000 --> 03:54:13,000
Ayu: "I've been working so much lately, I was starting to get run-down. I really needed this break."

2673
03:54:13,000 --> 03:54:24,000
Ayu: "I know I complain a lot, but it's nice going to the countryside every once in a while. The city's so big and noisy by comparison, but this place is nice and quiet."

2674
03:54:24,000 --> 03:54:30,000
Ayu: "I can finally relax. I don't have to worry about pleasing people. I can be myself..."

2675
03:54:30,000 --> 03:54:35,000
Ayu: "And I can make fun of Marina a lot, too. That's especially enjoyable!"

2676
03:54:35,000 --> 03:54:40,000
Hiroki: "I'm not sure if that's a good idea. Marina's scary when she gets mad..."

2677
03:54:40,000 --> 03:54:44,000
Ayu: "It's fine. She doesn't scare me. I can look after myself!"

2678
03:54:44,000 --> 03:54:45,000
Hiroki: "Right..."

2679
03:54:45,000 --> 03:54:56,000
*Tactfully, I decide to keep quiet about how Ayu cried during her last altercation with Marina. I wonder if her ass has recovered from that intense spanking she received?*

2680
03:54:56,000 --> 03:54:59,000
Hiroki: "So, Ayu... Why'd you come into my room?"

2681
03:54:59,000 --> 03:55:02,000
Ayu: "Why can't I come into your room?"

2682
03:55:02,000 --> 03:55:05,000
*Ayu pouts at me, suddenly defensive.*

2683
03:55:05,000 --> 03:55:11,000
Ayu: "I was going back to my own room, but then I heard your self-congratulatory voice."

2684
03:55:11,000 --> 03:55:20,000
Ayu: "You sounded so pleased with yourself, it made me feel sick, so I thought I should drop by and put you back in your place."

2685
03:55:20,000 --> 03:55:31,000
Ayu: "You haven't worked half - no, a quarter - as hard as I have over the years! It's light years too soon for you to be crowing about how you've made it big!"

2686
03:55:31,000 --> 03:55:35,000
Ayu: "Compared to me, you're still nothing more than an amoeba."

2687
03:55:35,000 --> 03:55:41,000
Ayu: "Now, bask in my perfection and know your place, you lowly single-celled organism!"

2688
03:55:41,000 --> 03:55:45,000
Hiroki: "O-Ouch... You don't mince words, do you, Ayu?"

2689
03:55:45,000 --> 03:55:55,000
Ayu: "I can't. If I acted like a mealy-mouthed little schoolgirl, the entertainment industry would've chewed me up and spat me back out already."

2690
03:55:55,000 --> 03:56:03,000
Ayu: "If you want to get anywhere in life, you need to assert your dominance. You can't let people push you around!"

2691
03:56:03,000 --> 03:56:05,000
Hiroki: "I'll keep that in mind..."

2692
03:56:05,000 --> 03:56:10,000
*I lean against Ayu's side companionably, our shoulders pressed together.*

2693
03:56:10,000 --> 03:56:21,000
*I half-expect Ayu to leap back at this, with a disgusted cry of "How dare you touch me with your unworthy shoulder, you irreverent water bug!", but she doesn't.*

2694
03:56:21,000 --> 03:56:25,000
*Instead, she smiles, and shifts her body even closer to mine.*

2695
03:56:25,000 --> 03:56:27,000
*Is she enjoying our little chat?*

2696
03:56:27,000 --> 03:56:30,000
*Maybe she likes me more than she lets on.*

2697
03:56:30,000 --> 03:56:35,000
*She's such a (to borrow the parlance of your everyday otaku) tsundere.*

2698
03:56:35,000 --> 03:56:39,000
*I guess those twintails of hers aren't just for show.*

2699
03:56:39,000 --> 03:56:48,000
*Silence descends upon us for a few moments. We sit there together, Ayu's long hair tickling my cheeks, while the cicadas outside hum.*

2700
03:56:48,000 --> 03:56:58,000
*Strangely, this silence isn't at all awkward or uncomfortable. Sitting with Ayu, enjoying the touch of her skin, is actually quite comforting.*

2701
03:56:58,000 --> 03:57:01,000
*Our relationship sure has come a long way.*

2702
03:57:01,000 --> 03:57:08,000
*Eventually, however, the silence ends. Ayu blinks at me beneath her lashes, her lips pursed, and says...*

2703
03:57:08,000 --> 03:57:10,000
Ayu: "H-Hey, Hiroki..."

2704
03:57:10,000 --> 03:57:12,000
Hiroki: "What is it, Ayu?"

2705
03:57:12,000 --> 03:57:14,000
Ayu: "I was just thinking, um..."

2706
03:57:14,000 --> 03:57:17,000
Ayu: "You're Cosmos's boyfriend, aren't you?"

2707
03:57:17,000 --> 03:57:20,000
Hiroki: "That's what I agreed on, yes."

2708
03:57:20,000 --> 03:57:23,000
Ayu: "So, she wasn't lying about that. I see. Um..."

2709
03:57:23,000 --> 03:57:26,000
Ayu: "You're not... serious about her, are you?"

2710
03:57:26,000 --> 03:57:34,000
Hiroki: "I guess? In the beginning, I was just going with the flow, but I'm pretty fond of her. She's a nice girl."

2711
03:57:34,000 --> 03:57:38,000
Hiroki: "I don't always understand her, but she's fun to talk to."

2712
03:57:38,000 --> 03:57:45,000
Ayu: "Fun? Yeah, right. She's really fun, for people who like having their fingernails pulled out!"

2713
03:57:45,000 --> 03:57:47,000
Hiroki: "What was that?"

2714
03:57:47,000 --> 03:57:48,000
Ayu: "O-Oh, nothing!"

2715
03:57:48,000 --> 03:57:52,000
Ayu: "I just... wasn't sure how much you liked her, is all."

2716
03:57:52,000 --> 03:57:54,000
Ayu: "This might sound weird, but..."

2717
03:57:54,000 --> 03:58:04,000
Ayu: "I've... never had a boyfriend before. I've slept with a few guys, being a succubus and all, but none of those relationships were very serious."

2718
03:58:04,000 --> 03:58:11,000
Ayu: "I did it because... I dunno. I wanted to prove that I was a real succubus like Marina, I guess."

2719
03:58:11,000 --> 03:58:22,000
Ayu: "Now that I've become an idol in the human world, I can't go out with any guys at all. There'd be a huge scandal. If my agency heard I had a partner, they'd fire me."

2720
03:58:22,000 --> 03:58:33,000
Ayu: "I might be Japan's number one idol right now, but that's only temporary. I'm a cog in the machine. No matter how much money I make, I'm still replaceable."

2721
03:58:33,000 --> 03:58:42,000
Ayu: "In a way, I envy Cosmos. She's her own boss. She can do what she wants. She doesn't need to answer to other people's expectations."

2722
03:58:42,000 --> 03:58:45,000
Hiroki: "You say that, but I'm not so sure..."

2723
03:58:45,000 --> 03:58:57,000
*While it's true Cosmos has no agency breathing down her neck, ready to fire her for the slightest breech of contract, she still has to juggle the expectations of millions of fans.*

2724
03:58:57,000 --> 03:59:01,000
*If they knew Cosmos had a boyfriend, I'm sure they'd be livid.*

2725
03:59:01,000 --> 03:59:04,000
Ayu: "...Well. You might be right there."

2726
03:59:04,000 --> 03:59:14,000
Ayu: "We're all succubi. We're stronger than you humans, and we have far more stamina... but, because we live in your world, we're bound by your rules."

2727
03:59:14,000 --> 03:59:16,000
Ayu: "We're not really free."

2728
03:59:16,000 --> 03:59:27,000
Ayu: "I thought, if I had enough money, I'd be able to do whatever I wanted... but with a lot of money comes restrictions and regulations. It can't fix all my problems."

2729
03:59:27,000 --> 03:59:29,000
Ayu: "Sometimes, I feel trapped..."

2730
03:59:29,000 --> 03:59:32,000
Ayu: "But I feel better when I'm with you."

2731
03:59:32,000 --> 03:59:33,000
Hiroki: "Ayu...?"

2732
03:59:33,000 --> 03:59:42,000
*I blink at Ayu, bemused, as she takes my hand in her own. She squeezes it, then leans in, her bust pushing up seductively against my arm.*

2733
03:59:42,000 --> 03:59:50,000
Ayu: "I know you're not my boyfriend. You can't be my boyfriend. If the world found out about us, my career would be over."

2734
03:59:50,000 --> 03:59:55,000
Ayu: "I'd have to give up everything I've worked for. I don't want that, but..."

2735
03:59:55,000 --> 03:59:57,000
Ayu: "I still want you."

2736
03:59:57,000 --> 04:00:05,000
Ayu: "When we first met, I thought I hated you. You smelled so good, my senses went into overload. It was confusing."

2737
04:00:05,000 --> 04:00:12,000
Ayu: "It was even a little scary. I was afraid, so I lashed out. I said horrible things, and I hurt you."

2738
04:00:12,000 --> 04:00:16,000
Ayu: "When I got to know you, however, I saw how kind you are."

2739
04:00:16,000 --> 04:00:25,000
Ayu: "Your fashion sense does leave a lot to be desired, and you're not particularly attractive. You're not really my type, but..."

2740
04:00:25,000 --> 04:00:28,000
Ayu: "I've grown to like you all the same."

2741
04:00:28,000 --> 04:00:37,000
Ayu: "I'm not as naïve as Cosmos, so I can't love you like she does. I'm not as independent as Marina, so I can't love you like she does."

2742
04:00:37,000 --> 04:00:43,000
Ayu: "I'm up against some stiff competition, and for once, I'm not sure I can win..."

2743
04:00:43,000 --> 04:00:48,000
Ayu: "But I love you all the same, and I still want to be with you."

2744
04:00:48,000 --> 04:00:50,000
Ayu: "Would that... be okay...?"

2745
04:00:50,000 --> 04:00:55,000
*Ayu stares at me, her eyes large; glittering just like the stars in the sky.*

2746
04:00:55,000 --> 04:01:02,000
Ayu: "You can't be my boyfriend... but could you always be my cameraman? I want you to stay by my side forever."

2747
04:01:02,000 --> 04:01:03,000
Hiroki: "Ayu..."

2748
04:01:03,000 --> 04:01:09,000
*My heart melts upon hearing Ayu's speech. I don't think I've ever heard her sound this sincere.*

2749
04:01:09,000 --> 04:01:14,000
*As an idol, Ayu's trained herself to hide behind layer upon layer of artifice.*

2750
04:01:14,000 --> 04:01:22,000
*She never shows her real self before her fans, for fear that they'll turn against her. She has to play pretend.*

2751
04:01:22,000 --> 04:01:27,000
*When she's with me, however, those pretences can be stripped away.*

2752
04:01:27,000 --> 04:01:29,000
*She knows that I won't judge her.*

2753
04:01:29,000 --> 04:01:39,000
Hiroki: "I might be Cosmos's boyfriend and Marina's darling... but I have a big heart. There's more than enough room in my life to be your cameraman."

2754
04:01:39,000 --> 04:01:43,000
Hiroki: "I'll be with you for as long as you want me. I promise."

2755
04:01:43,000 --> 04:01:47,000
Ayu: "Hiroki... Oh, Hiroki...! I really do love you!"

2756
04:01:47,000 --> 04:01:53,000
*And so it is, with this heartfelt confession, that Ayu throws herself at me in a warm embrace.*

2757
04:01:53,000 --> 04:02:00,000
*Her grip about my shoulders is a little too tight, and her long hair's tickling my nose, but I don't care.*

2758
04:02:00,000 --> 04:02:05,000
*Ayu's love is a bit awkward and clumsy, but I appreciate it all the same.*

2759
04:02:05,000 --> 04:02:06,000
*I appreciate Ayu.*

2760
04:02:06,000 --> 04:02:10,000
*I'm going to fill her up with love until she feels satisfied.*

2761
04:02:10,000 --> 04:02:13,000
*I don't want her to ever feel left out.*

2762
04:02:13,000 --> 04:02:17,000
*Alone once more, I lie back on my futon, exhausted.*

2763
04:02:17,000 --> 04:02:21,000
*I want to lie back here, close my eyes, and sleep...*

2764
04:02:21,000 --> 04:02:25,000
*But, though the minutes tick by, sleep doesn't come.*

2765
04:02:25,000 --> 04:02:31,000
*My body might be worn down, but my mind is still active, and I can't turn it off.*

2766
04:02:31,000 --> 04:02:37,000
